ra becomes an X/X green Hydra creature. It's still a land. X can't be 0.", 'If you would create one or more Treasure tokens, instead create those tokens plus an additional Treasure token.', 'Improvised Weaponry deals 2 damage to any target. Create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', 'Invoke Duplicity — Equipped creature gets +1/+1 and has "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, you may sacrifice Trickster\'s Talisman. If you do, create a token that\'s a copy of this creature."\\nEquip {2}', 'Lifelink', "Lurking Roper doesn't untap during your untap step.\\nWhenever you gain life, untap Lurking Roper.", 'Mage Hand — {T}: Untap target permanent not named Clever Conjurer. Activate only as a sorcery.', "Magical Tinkering — {W}, {T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Search your library for an artifact card with mana value equal to 1 plus the sacrificed artifact's mana value, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle. Activate only as a sorcery.", 'Menace\\nPack tactics — Whenever Minion of the Mighty attacks, if you attacked with creatures with total power 6 or greater this combat, you may put a Dragon creature card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped and attacking.', 'Menace\\n{1}{B}, {T}, Pay 1 life: Create a Treasure token.\\n{2}{B}: Target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn. If mana from a Treasure was spent to activate this ability, that creature also gains deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Meteor Swarm deals 8 damage divided as you choose among X target creatures and/or planeswalkers.', 'Other Goblins you control get +1/+1.\\n{R}, {T}: Hobgoblin Bandit Lord deals damage equal to the number of Goblins that entered the battlefield under your control this turn to any target.', 'Pack tactics — Whenever Gnoll Hunter attacks, if you attacked with creatures with total power 6 or greater this combat, put a +1/+1 counter on Gnoll Hunter.', 'Pack tactics — Whenever Hobgoblin Captain attacks, if you attacked with creatures with total power 6 or greater this combat, Hobgoblin Captain gains first strike until end of turn.', "Pack tactics — Whenever Targ Nar, Demon-Fang Gnoll attacks, if you attacked with creatures with total power 6 or greater this combat, attacking creatures get +1/+0 until end of turn.\\n{2}{R}{G}: Double Targ Nar's power and toughness until end of turn.", "Pack tactics — Whenever Werewolf Pack Leader attacks, if you attacked with creatures with total power 6 or greater this combat, draw a card.\\n{3}{G}: Until end of turn, Werewolf Pack Leader has base power and toughness 5/3, gains trample, and isn't a Human.", 'Psionic Spells — When Aberrant Mind Sorcerer enters the battlefield, choose target instant or sorcery card in your graveyard, then roll a d20.\\n1—9 | You may put that card on top of your library.\\n10—20 | Return that card to your hand.', "Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. That creature gains haste until end of turn and can't be blocked by Walls this turn. Venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)", 'Reach, ward {1}\\nWhenever you cast a creature or planeswalker spell, venture into the dungeon. This ability triggers only once each turn. (To venture into the dungeon, enter the first room or advance to the next room.)\\nWhenever you complete a dungeon, create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token.', 'Reach\\nPack tactics — Whenever Intrepid Outlander attacks, if you attacked with creatures with total power 6 or greater this combat, venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)', 'Reach\\nWhen Elturgard Ranger enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token.', 'Reach\\nWhenever Drider deals combat damage to a player, create a 2/1 black Spider creature token with menace and reach.', 'Return X target cards with different mana values from your graveyard to your hand. If eight or more cards were returned to your hand this way, your life total becomes equal to your starting life total. Exile Long Rest.', 'Return up to one target creature card from your graveyard to your hand. Venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)', 'Roll a d20.\\n1—9 | Draw two cards.\\n10—19 | Scry 2, then draw two cards.\\n20 | Scry 3, then draw three cards.', 'Room abilities of dungeons you own trigger an additional time.', 'Sacrifice another creature: Sepulcher Ghoul gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', 'Search the Room — {5}{U}: Roll a d20.\\n1—9 | Draw a card.\\n10—20 | Look at the top three cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Siege Monster — When Earth-Cult Elemental enters the battlefield, roll a d20.\\n1—9 | Each player sacrifices a permanent.\\n10—19 | Each opponent sacrifices a permanent.\\n20 | Each opponent sacrifices two permanents.', 'Skeletons, Vampires, and Zombies you control get +1/+1.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if a creature died this turn, you may pay {1}. If you do, create a 1/1 black Skeleton creature token.', 'Sneak Attack — Whenever Lightfoot Rogue attacks, roll a d20.\\n1—9 | Lightfoot Rogue gains deathtouch until end of turn.\\n10—19 | It gets +1/+0 and gains deathtouch until end of turn.\\n20 | It gets +3/+0 and gains first strike and deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Sphere of Annihilation enters the battlefield with X void counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, exile Sphere of Annihilation, all creatures and planeswalkers with mana value less than or equal to the number of void counters on it, and all creature and planeswalker cards in graveyards with mana value less than or equal to the number of void counters on it.', 'Target artifact or creature becomes a copy of another target artifact or creature.', 'Target creature gains double strike until end of turn.\\nWhen you roll a natural 20, return Critical Hit from your graveyard to your hand. (A natural 20 is a roll that displays 20 on the die.)', 'Target creature gets +2/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn. Up to one other target creature gets +0/+2 and gains lifelink until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn. Untap it.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn and must be blocked this turn if able.', 'Target creature gets -11/-11 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -2/-0 until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets -4/-1 until end of turn. If that creature is white, it gets -4/-4 until end of turn instead.', "Target creature or planeswalker an opponent controls phases out. If that permanent is black, exile it instead. (If it phases out, treat it and anything attached to it as though they don't exist until its controller's next turn.)", 'Target creature you control gets +1/+0 until end of turn for each mana from a Treasure that was spent to cast this spell. Then that creature deals damage equal to its power to target creature an opponent controls.', 'Target opponent discards a card. If mana from a Treasure was spent to cast this spell, instead that player reveals their hand, you choose a nonland card from it, then that player discards that card.', 'Target opponent discards two cards, mills two cards, and loses 2 life. (To mill a card, a player puts the top card of their library into their graveyard.)', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it. Exile that card. If an instant card or a card with flash is exiled this way, they lose 1 life. Otherwise, you lose 1 life.', 'The Tarrasque has haste and ward {10} as long as it was cast.\\nWhenever The Tarrasque attacks, it fights target creature defending player controls.', "This spell can't be countered.\\nFlying, haste\\n{R}: Inferno of the Star Mounts gets +1/+0 until end of turn. When its power becomes 20 this way, it deals 20 damage to any target.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nMagic Missile deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets.", 'This spell costs {2} less to cast if a creature died this turn.\\nWard {2} (Whenever this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter it unless that player pays {2}.)', "This spell costs {3} less to cast if it targets a blue permanent you don't control.\\nThis spell can't be countered.\\nTarget creature you control gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Then it deals damage equal to its power to target creature or planeswalker you don't control.", "This spell costs {U} less to cast for each instant and sorcery spell you've cast this turn.\\nWhenever Demilich attacks, exile up to one target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard. Copy it. You may cast the copy.\\nYou may cast Demilich from your graveyard by exiling four instant and/or sorcery cards from your graveyard in addition to paying its other costs.", 'Trample, haste\\nWhenever Froghemoth deals combat damage to a player, exile up to that many target cards from their graveyard. Put a +1/+1 counter on Froghemoth for each creature card exiled this way. You gain 1 life for each noncreature card exiled this way.', 'Trample\\nKeen Senses — When Owlbear enters the battlefield, draw a card.', "Trample\\nOchre Jelly enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\nSplit — When Ochre Jelly dies, if it had two or more +1/+1 counters on it, create a token that's a copy of it at the beginning of the next end step. The token enters the battlefield with half that many +1/+1 counters on it, rounded down.", "Trample\\nPack tactics — Whenever Tiger-Tribe Hunter attacks, if you attacked with creatures with total power 6 or greater this combat, you may sacrifice another creature. When you do, Tiger-Tribe Hunter deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to target creature.", 'Trample\\nWhenever Zalto, Fire Giant Duke is dealt damage, venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)', 'Until end of turn, target creature becomes a Dragon with base power and toughness 4/4 and gains flying. (It loses all other creature types.)', 'Until end of turn, target creature gains "When this creature dies, return it to the battlefield tapped under its owner\'s control with a +1/+1 counter on it."', 'Vigilance\\nIron Golem attacks or blocks each combat if able.', 'Vigilance\\nStunning Strike — {1}{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', 'Vigilance\\nWhen Loyal Warhound enters the battlefield, if an opponent controls more lands than you, search your library for a basic Plains card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "Vigilance\\nWhenever Nadaar, Selfless Paladin enters the battlefield or attacks, venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)\\nOther creatures you control get +1/+1 as long as you've completed a dungeon.", 'Vigilance\\nWhenever Sylvan Shepherd attacks, roll a d20.\\n1—9 | You gain 1 life.\\n10—19 | You gain 2 life.\\n20 | You gain 5 life.', 'Ward {3} (Whenever this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter it unless that player pays {3}.)', "When Acererak the Archlich enters the battlefield, if you haven't completed Tomb of Annihilation, return Acererak the Archlich to its owner's hand and venture into the dungeon.\\nWhenever Acererak the Archlich attacks, for each opponent, you create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token unless that player sacrifices a creature.", "When Baleful Beholder enters the battlefield, choose one —\\n• Antimagic Cone — Each opponent sacrifices an enchantment.\\n• Fear Ray — Creatures you control gain menace until end of turn. (A creature with menace can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", "When Barrowin of Clan Undurr enters the battlefield, venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)\\nWhenever Barrowin of Clan Undurr attacks, return up to one creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield if you've completed a dungeon.", 'When Clattering Skeletons dies, venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)', "When Cloister Gargoyle enters the battlefield, venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)\\nAs long as you've completed a dungeon, Cloister Gargoyle gets +3/+0 and has flying.", 'When Dawnbringer Cleric enters the battlefield, choose one —\\n• Cure Wounds — You gain 2 life.\\n• Dispel Magic — Destroy target enchantment.\\n• Gentle Repose — Exile target card from a graveyard.', "When Displacer Beast enters the battlefield, venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)\\nDisplacement — {3}{U}: Return Displacer Beast to its owner's hand.", 'When Eye of Vecna enters the battlefield, you draw a card and you lose 2 life.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may pay {2}. If you do, you draw a card and you lose 2 life.', 'When Hill Giant Herdgorger enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'When Hired Hexblade enters the battlefield, if mana from a Treasure was spent to cast it, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'When Ingenious Smith enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal an artifact card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\\nWhenever one or more artifacts enter the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Ingenious Smith. This ability triggers only once each turn.', 'When Inspiring Bard enters the battlefield, choose one —\\n• Bardic Inspiration — Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\\n• Song of Rest — You gain 3 life.', 'When Jaded Sell-Sword enters the battlefield, if mana from a Treasure was spent to cast it, it gains first strike and haste until end of turn.', 'When Kalain, Reclusive Painter enters the battlefield, create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")\\nOther creatures you control enter the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on them for each mana from a Treasure spent to cast them.', 'When Minsc, Beloved Ranger enters the battlefield, create Boo, a legendary 1/1 red Hamster creature token with trample and haste.\\n{X}: Until end of turn, target creature you control has base power and toughness X/X and becomes a Giant in addition to its other types. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'When Plundering Barbarian enters the battlefield, choose one —\\n• Smash the Chest — Destroy target artifact.\\n• Pry It Open — Create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', 'When Portable Hole enters the battlefield, exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls with mana value 2 or less until Portable Hole leaves the battlefield.', 'When Potion of Healing enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\n{W}, {T}, Sacrifice Potion of Healing: You gain 3 life.', 'When Priest of Ancient Lore enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life and draw a card.', 'When Prosperous Innkeeper enters the battlefield, create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")\\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life.', 'When Shambling Ghast dies, choose one —\\n• Brave the Stench — Target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.\\n• Search the Body — Create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', 'When Skullport Merchant enters the battlefield, create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifice another creature or a Treasure: Draw a card.', 'When Swarming Goblins enters the battlefield, roll a d20.\\n1—9 | Create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token.\\n10—19 | Create two of those tokens.\\n20 | Create three of those tokens.', 'When Thieves\' Tools enters the battlefield, create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")\\nEquipped creature can\'t be blocked as long as its power is 3 or less.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'When Vampire Spawn enters the battlefield, each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', 'When Veteran Dungeoneer enters the battlefield, venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)', 'Whenever Delina, Wild Mage attacks, choose target creature you control, then roll a d20.\\n1—14 | Create a tapped and attacking token that\'s a copy of that creature, except it\'s not legendary and it has "At end of combat, exile this creature."\\n15—20 | Create one of those tokens. You may roll again.', "Whenever Guild Thief deals combat damage to a player, put a +1/+1 counter on it.\\nCunning Action — {3}{U}: Guild Thief can't be blocked this turn.", 'Whenever Hoard Robber deals combat damage to a player, create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', 'Whenever Hoarding Ogre attacks, roll a d20.\\n1—9 | Create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")\\n10—19 | Create two Treasure tokens.\\n20 | Create three Treasure tokens.', "Whenever Krydle of Baldur's Gate deals combat damage to a player, that player loses 1 life and mills a card, then you gain 1 life and scry 1.\\nWhenever you attack, you may pay {2}. If you do, target creature can't be blocked this turn.", 'Whenever Shortcut Seeker deals combat damage to a player, venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)', 'Whenever Soulknife Spy deals combat damage to a player, draw a card.', "Whenever a creature you control becomes blocked, you may return it to its owner's hand.\\nWhenever one or more creatures you control deal combat damage to a player, draw a card.", 'Whenever a creature you control dies, put a loyalty counter on Lolth, Spider Queen.\\n[0]: You draw a card and you lose 1 life.\\n[−3]: Create two 2/1 black Spider creature tokens with menace and reach.\\n[−8]: You get an emblem with "Whenever an opponent is dealt combat damage by one or more creatures you control, if that player lost less than 8 life this turn, they lose life equal to the difference."', 'Whenever equipped creature attacks, it gains deathtouch until end of turn.\\nWhenever equipped creature attacks alone, defending player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Whenever you cast a creature spell that doesn't share a creature type with a creature you control or a creature card in your graveyard, copy that spell. (A copy of a creature spell becomes a token.)", "Whenever you discard a card, exile that card from your graveyard.\\n{2}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Bag of Holding: Return all cards exiled with Bag of Holding to their owner's hand.", 'Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on Celestial Unicorn.', 'Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on Trelasarra, Moon Dancer and scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', 'Whenever you roll one or more dice, Brazen Dwarf deals 1 damage to each opponent.', 'Whenever you roll one or more dice, create a 1/1 blue Faerie Dragon creature token with flying.', 'Wight enters the battlefield tapped.\\nLife Drain — Whenever a creature dealt damage by Wight this turn dies, create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token and exile that card.', 'Wild Magic Surge — Whenever Chaos Channeler attacks, roll a d20.\\n1—9 | Exile the top card of your library. You may play it this turn.\\n10—19 | Exile the top two cards of your library. You may play them this turn.\\n20 | Exile the top three cards of your library. You may play them this turn.', "You have hexproof. (You can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\nEach opponent can't venture into the dungeon more than once each turn.", 'You may choose not to untap The Blackstaff of Waterdeep during your untap step.\\nAnimate Walking Statue — {1}{U}, {T}: Another target nontoken artifact you control becomes a 4/4 artifact creature for as long as The Blackstaff of Waterdeep remains tapped. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'You may play a card you own from outside the game this turn.', "Yuan-Ti Malison can't be blocked as long as it's attacking alone.\\nWhenever Yuan-Ti Malison deals combat damage to a player, venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)", '[+1]: Creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain haste until end of turn.\\n[0]: Create a 1/1 red Devil creature token with "When this creature dies, it deals 1 damage to any target."\\n[−6]: You get an emblem with "At the end of the first combat phase on your turn, untap target creature you control. After this phase, there is an additional combat phase."', '[+1]: Venture into the dungeon. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)\\n[−2]: Look at the top six cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card from among them and put it into your hand. If it\'s legendary, you gain 3 life. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\\n[−7]: You get an emblem with "Creatures you control have trample and haste and get +2/+2 for each differently named dungeon you\'ve completed."', '[+2]: Draw two cards, then put a card from your hand on the bottom of your library.\\n[−2]: Create a blue Dog Illusion creature token with "This creature\'s power and toughness are each equal to twice the number of cards in your hand."\\n[−10]: Exchange your hand and library, then shuffle. You get an emblem with "You have no maximum hand size."', '{1}, {T}: Add two mana in any combination of colors. Spend this mana only to cast Dragon spells or activate abilities of Dragons.\\n{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Orb of Dragonkind: Look at the top seven cards of your library. You may reveal a Dragon card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', '{1}{G}: Dire Wolf Prowler gets +2/+2 and gains haste until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', "{1}{R}: Goblins you control get +1/+0 and gain haste until end of turn.\\nPack tactics — Whenever Battle Cry Goblin attacks, if you attacked with creatures with total power 6 or greater this combat, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token that's tapped and attacking.", '{2}, Sacrifice Neverwinter Dryad: Search your library for a basic Forest card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{2}, {T}: Roll a d20 and subtract the number of cards in your hand. If the result is 0 or less, discard your hand.\\n1—9 | Return a card at random from your graveyard to your hand.\\n10—19 | Draw two cards.\\n20 | Put a creature card from any graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. When that creature dies, its owner loses the game.', '{2}{G}{U}: Draw a card. You may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield.', '{3}{G}: Roll a d20. Activate only if Loathsome Troll is in your graveyard.\\n1—9 | Put Loathsome Troll on top of your library.\\n10—19 | Return Loathsome Troll to your hand.\\n20 | Return Loathsome Troll to the battlefield tapped.', "{4}, Sacrifice Treasure Chest: Roll a d20.\\n1 | Trapped! — You lose 3 life.\\n2—9 | Create five Treasure tokens.\\n10—19 | You gain 3 life and draw three cards.\\n20 | Search your library for a card. If it's an artifact card, you may put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put that card into your hand. Then shuffle.", '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}, Sacrifice Mimic: Add one mana of any color.\\n{2}: Mimic becomes a Shapeshifter artifact creature with base power and toughness 3/3 until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Venture into the dungeon. Activate only as a sorcery. (Enter the first room or advance to the next room.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{X}{X}, {T}, Sacrifice Treasure Vault: Create X Treasure tokens.', '{T}: Add {G} for each creature you control.', "{T}: Exile target instant or sorcery card from a graveyard. Roll a d20. Activate only as a sorcery.\\n1—9 | Copy that card. You may cast the copy.\\n10—19 | Copy that card. You may cast the copy by paying {1} rather than paying its mana cost.\\n20 | Copy each card exiled with Wizard's Spellbook. You may cast any number of the copies without paying their mana costs.", '{T}: You may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield.']
flavor: ['"A pact is a tool, not a damnation."', '"Ah, the old \'trap door under a rug\' trick. This is almost too easy."', '"And to think, a year ago I was picking pockets in Waterdeep."', '"Buy something or get out."', '"Can\'t see this airship crashing in the near future. Sturdy as a rock."', '"Don\'t give up! You are steel and fire, and victory is yours to seize."', '"Easy now, everyone. I\'ll take care of this."\\n—Nadaar', '"Eilistraee teaches us that we are not bound by the circumstances of our birth. We all may find beauty and light, if we have the courage to seek them."', '"Every coin helps rebuild the town they destroyed."', '"Give me just a moment! I almost have it."', '"Hand over your loot and no one gets hurt!"', '"Hold on to your lunch!"\\n—Bartleby, gnome wizard', '"How do you kill what\'s already dead? *That\'s* how."', '"I could help you, or I could eat you for lunch. I haven\'t decided yet."', '"I have the shot. Shall I take it?"\\n—Varis, Silverymoon ranger', '"I see all things as they truly are! I see . . . decay in all flesh, and betrayal in every heart."', '"I swore a sacred oath to protect the weak and punish those who threaten them. As long as I draw breath, I will protect you."', '"I think of it as giving them another chance to achieve their potential."\\n—Nestus Wrasse, necromancer', '"I\'ll know what you know soon enough."\\n—Nihiloor, Xanathar Guild spymaster', '"I\'ll make sure you never mistake a roper for a stalagmite again."', '"I\'ll take care of it. You just be sure to hold up your end of the deal."', '"I\'m always happy to lend a hand!"', '"If you had just one wish, what would it be? Gold, or angel song? Finding a lost love, or finding your way back home? Let me sing a song about one wish that came true . . ."\\n—Ellywick Tumblestrum', '"If you\'re so mighty, scaled one, then why are you dead?"', '"Knew I\'d find ye in trouble if I came out an\' looked for ye!"', '"Lady Luck, smile on me!"', '"Looks like we\'ve got company."', '"Metal armor? A poor choice."', '"Most folks got mayhem in their hearts. Just gotta know their price."', '"Move it, Varis, or I\'ll pick one for you!"\\n—Ellywick Tumblestrum', '"My children will rule over all!"', '"My grandmother saved the life of a brass dragon, and in return she was given a glimpse of the fire in its heart—a glimpse she passed down to me."', '"My psychic blade cuts the mind and severs thoughts. Even if you survive, you\'ll never remember I was here."', '"Not all of us have darkvision, okay?"', '"On the plus side, Throg no longer thinks he\'s clever."\\n—Xanathar', '"Plant what you wish to see grow. Listen for the stories you want to hear told."', '"Relax. I\'m a professional."', '"See how the statues all have chunks bitten out of them? We\'re dealing with a basilisk, or I\'m a froghemoth."\\n—Larissa Kyriln, learned warlock', '"Shed your thoughts and let my will flow through you."', '"Someone took the time to carve these inscriptions. The least we can do is care enough to read them."', '"That\'s a pretty ring! Trade you my knife for it."', '"The Reaper bids you rise!"', '"The air is sweet with the taste of your fear."', '"The beholder told me I had a good eye for details. Who was I to argue?"', '"There is only one way forward: into legend."', '"There\'s a new ballad waiting to be born around every corner."', '"They don\'t seem scary, but then you\'re suddenly standing there in your underclothes without a weapon. Then everything looks like a threat."\\n—Jarro, battle master', '"They fall for it every time."', '"This one is for goblins, this one is for owlbears, this one is for toast, this one is for . . ."', '"This path is closed to you!"', '"Today? That\'ll cost you extra."', '"Wait, is that a secret door? I can\'t tell for sure . . . there\'s some blood in the way."', '"Wake up, my friends! There are deeds to be done and treasures to be won!"', '"We are a product of our ancestors, the apotheosis of countless noble generations. Speak their names with reverence, and they will guide your path."', '"We tried your way. Now we do it my way!"\\n—Jym, barbarian of Baldur\'s Gate', '"When I made my oath to Moradin, I left selfishness and cowardice behind. Every battle, I make that commitment anew."', '"When darkness closes in around us, my blade will light our path."', '"You might be four times my size, but I will not be ignored!"', '"You see, stalac-*tites* grow down from the ceiling, while stalag-*mites* reach—AAHHHHHHHHH—"', '"You studied hard. How delicious!"', '"You\'re not the first to underestimate me."', '"Your purpose may change along with your shape, but you will serve regardless."', 'A doom denied—or, perhaps, delayed.', 'A drastic measure for dangerous times.', 'A job well done means a rest well earned.', 'A lucky draw from the Deck of Many Things gave Voltusk an inexplicable flash of understanding that he spent the rest of his life trying to repeat.', "A paladin's steed is a celestial spirit in animal form.", "A shepherd's crook is useful for cleaning bits of wool out of the teeth.", 'A simple fire spell that grows in intensity along with its caster.', 'A tried-and-true favorite of many wizards, whatever their school.', "After careful study, you've determined that the giant ruins served to track the movement of the planets ... and they will soon align once more.", 'Alarmed by the news you brought, the storm giant king of the Maelstrom has called his kin to council.', 'Anything can be a weapon if you swing it hard enough.', 'Aramil issued a long, heroic challenge, then the lich felled him with a single word.', "As a plague ravages the world above, you've made your way into the Underdark in search of a fungal panacea.", "As monsters from the Underdark rampage across the world above, you've delved deep underground to determine what has driven them upward.", 'As the iron bars of the portcullis parted like reeds, the defenders of the keep suddenly felt much less secure.', 'As the sun reaches its zenith on the day of the solstice, a castle shimmers into view on the hilltop, just as the ancient text predicted.', 'As you make camp near the ancient ruin, you hear the sound of drums echoing in halls where no dwarf has lived in generations.', "As you trudge through the sewers of Baldur's Gate it dawns on you: where are all the rats?", 'As you venture deeper under the boughs of Neverwinter Wood, arrows in a tree trunk suggest you might not be welcome.', 'As your ship clears the edge of Waterdeep harbor, you notice pirate sails on the horizon. What has made them so bold?', 'Before the elf queen will aid you, you must find a way to cure the strange rot afflicting the roots of the ancient trees.', 'Black dragons revel in the collapse of humanoid kingdoms.', 'Blink dogs protect the wild places of the world, driving away evil influences.', 'Bugbears move with surprising speed for their size and bulk, a fact that has led to the demise of many unwary adventurers.', "Capable of moving swiftly through even tightly-packed earth and leaping surprising distances above ground, bulettes are difficult to escape once they've caught scent of prey.", 'Click your heels and become the wind.', 'Courage is neither a shield nor an axe, but the will to wield both in defense of the innocent.', "Don't.", 'Druids of the Circle of the Moon are fierce guardians of nature who haunt the deepest parts of the wilderness.', 'Elemental Evil distorts the natural elements, limiting them to aspects of destruction.', 'Erigan cried out in pain as a hideous weakness settled into his bones.', 'Fire giants love to fight on a large scale, and Duke Zalto is one of the greatest warmongers of his age.', 'Flumphs siphon thoughts and energy from evil aberrations, and are often eager to share the dark knowledge they obtain with friendly adventurers.', 'Fortune favors the fortunate.', 'Freed from the need to pay tribute to the dragon, the villages gladly paid the dragon-slayers instead.', 'Frost giants carry the trophies of their greatest victories into battle, fashioned into armor of strength and savage beauty.', 'Ghouls devour the dead and any living creatures unwary enough to fall into their grasp.', 'Gold dragons are the greatest of the metallic dragons in size, power, and wisdom, and often take it upon themselves to safeguard mortal communities from evils that might threaten them.', 'Green dragons take special pleasure in corrupting the good-hearted.', 'Hate gets you only so far. A pointy stick can close the rest of the distance.', 'Her light touches every corner and her wings brush either wall, leaving no place for evil to lurk.', 'Her tales of glory light a fire in the souls of the next generation of adventurers.', 'His mind is a tranquil meadow, his fists a raging storm.', 'Hobgoblins do not fear death, for those who fall in battle have gained glory eternal.', "In a hobgoblin's view of the world, the weak owe tribute and fealty to the strong.", "In crystal-studded waters far below the surface, you've discovered an incubating egg of mysterious origin.", 'In the end, there was nothing beautiful to be seen.', 'Its life force entwined with its tree, a dryad is an elusive and solitary being that wishes only to be left alone.', 'Large as horses, dire wolves must hunt often to satisfy thier ravenous hunger. A mere human does little more than blunt their appetite.', 'Leave no treasure behind.', 'Lightweight, flexible, and protective.', 'Magic can knit the body back together, but the courage to fight on comes only from within.', 'Many people believe a misguided wizard created the first owlbear, but others insist that these creatures have always dwelled in the Feywild.', 'Maybe a little *too* convincing.', "Once an iron golem is set to a task, it won't turn aside until that task is complete or it has been destroyed.", 'Parts of Faerûn still churn with the magic of arrogant Netherese archmages long dead.', 'Pixies are well known as pranksters, but some delight in more helpful magic.', 'Red dragons consider the world and every creature in it as theirs to command.', "Searching for a vanished caravan that was bound for Silverymoon, you've come to a bank of mysterious fog.", "Seeking to learn why the ancestors have fallen silent, you've made your way to their ancient cairns.", 'Selûne guides her devotees with majestic wisdom and grace.', "She puts some coin in the Guild's pocket and sends a message at the same time.", 'Silent. Slithering. Sinister.', "Since the fall of Elturel, they've walked the Sword Coast from Tethyr to Icewind Dale, eyes always on their prey.", "Sometimes one fireball isn't enough.", 'Swift eyes to scout the way ahead.', 'The ancient dragon Imvaernarhro has earned his fiery nickname.', 'The ancient green dragon Claugiyliamatar is often seen with a mangled corpse dangling from her mouth.', "The dragon's noxious breath withered the forest. The whistle of a hundred arrows filled the air. The ground roiled as if shaken by an earthquake. The tyrant fell from the sky.", 'The good will be corrupted, the kind will be devoured, and all will be dragged into the bottomless Abyss.', 'The noble steeds of the elven gods can sometimes be persuaded to allow mere mortals on their backs.', "The only place you can be sure it's not is wherever it appears to be.", 'The raging behir reared back, opened its terrible maw . . . and collapsed in a fit of horrifying giggles.', 'The realms protected by druids of the Circle of Dreams are gleaming, fruitful places, where dream and reality blur together and the weary can find rest.', 'The way opened before him, and the dust of centuries stirred in the air.', 'The weight of this magic weapon falls heavy on the wicked.', 'There is a stillness that walks with him, the quiet that follows great tragedy, when even the mourners are too exhausted to weep.', 'There is wealth enough inside to cause the rise and the ruin of dynasties.', 'This fight was over the moment you picked up that clumsy cleaver of a sword.', 'Those who die in the dungeon become its guardians.', "Though their forms embody Lolth's image, driders are those unfortunate drow who have failed the Spider Queen.", 'Underground civilizations maintain magical barriers around their settlements to deter these monsters.', 'Unlike most warlocks, those who make pacts with archfey are drawn to pranks and whimsy moreso than death and darkness.', 'Unsuccessful vampire hunters often wind up as ravenous spawn.', "Venturing beneath the desert sands, you've discovered an alien power pulsing with inconceivable energy.", 'When all hope fails, its light remains.', 'When it rises, nations fall.', 'White dragons are unparalleled hunters, keenly focused on slaughtering their enemies.', 'Wights want the world to resound with echoes of their own cruel hatred.', 'Wings take flight on whispered wind.', 'With the right weapon, a fearsome beholder is nothing more than a big floating bullseye.', 'Xorns are native to the Elemental Plane of Earth, where gems and rare stones are plentiful. When summoned elsewhere they can be quite destructive in search of food.', 'Yipping and cackling, the hunters tore through the village, leaving nothing but snapped bones and burning homes in their wake.', 'You expected to meet hostile drow in this ancient ruin . . . but they fled long ago. What darkness could have driven them out?', 'You meant to simply rest in Hundelstone, but the miners have told you stories of whispers in the dark below.', "You've traced the tensions in Ten-Towns to the dwindling reindeer populations ... but what has been hunting them?", "You've ventured deep into the heart of the mountain to determine what can calm its quaking rage.", 'Your path lies across the Spine of the World, where every cave hides some new danger.', 'Your search for a stolen artifact has brought you to the edge of the Mere of Dead Men.']
