rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If Bag of Holding is moved to exile when you sacrifice it (most likely due to Leyline of the Void\'s effect), it remains in exile. It won\'t be returned to your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If Bag of Holding leaves the battlefield, the items it contained are exiled forever (and, perhaps, scattered throughout the Astral Plane). If the same Bag of Holding card returns to the battlefield, it\'s considered a new object without access to the cards stored by the old object."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If you control more than one Bag of Holding, you choose which one will hold the discarded card. Other Bags of Holding can\'t return that card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If you discard a card but that card is not in your graveyard as Bag of Holding\'s first ability resolves, that card remains wherever it has moved."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "You both draw and discard while Bag of Holding\'s second ability is resolving. No player may take any action—nor can anything else happen—until you\'ve both drawn and discarded."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "A Dragon card is a card with the creature type Dragon in its type line. A card that has “Dragon” in the name (such as Dragon\'s Disciple) isn\'t a Dragon card unless it also has the Dragon creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Tiamat\'s enters-the-battlefield ability will trigger if you cast Tiamat from any zone, not just from your hand. Still thinking command zone over here."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "A Dragon card is a card with the creature type Dragon in its type line. Similarly, a creature on the battlefield is a Dragon if it has the Dragon creature type. A card that has “Dragon” in the name (such as Dragon\'s Disciple) isn\'t a Dragon card unless it also has the Dragon creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you choose to reveal a Dragon card from your hand and also control a Dragon, Dragon\'s Disciple still only gets a single +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Players can respond to Dragon\'s Disciple while it is on the stack, but they cannot respond to the choice of whether or not to reveal a Dragon as it enters the battlefield. Notably, that means they can\'t remove your Dragon from play to prevent Dragon\'s Disciple from getting the counter once you\'ve decided not to reveal a Dragon card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Revealing a Dragon card happens as Dragon\'s Disciple resolves. It is not an additional cost for casting the spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "A Dragon card is a card with the creature type Dragon in its type line. Similarly, a creature on the battlefield is a Dragon if it has the Dragon creature type. A card that has “Dragon” in the name (such as Dragon\'s Fire) isn\'t a Dragon card unless it also has the Dragon creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you chose a Dragon you control, use that Dragon\'s power as Dragon\'s Fire resolves to determine how much damage is dealt. If the Dragon you chose is no longer on the battlefield as Dragon\'s Fire resolves, Dragon\'s Fire will deal damage equal to the power it had the last time it was on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "A Dragon card is a card with the creature type Dragon in its type line. Similarly, a creature on the battlefield is a Dragon if it has the Dragon creature type. A card that has “Dragon” in the name (such as Orb of Dragonkind) isn\'t a Dragon card unless it also has the Dragon creature type."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "A Dragon card is a card with the creature type Dragon in its type line. Similarly, a creature on the battlefield is a Dragon if it has the Dragon creature type. A card that has “Dragon” in the name (such as Temple of the Dragon Queen) isn\'t a Dragon card unless it also has the Dragon creature type."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "A creature enchanted with Minimus Containment stops being a creature. Equipment attached to that creature become unattached. Auras attached to that creature will be put into their owner\'s graveyard (unless they could also enchant a Treasure artifact)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Treasure, it means any Treasure artifact, not just a Treasure artifact token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The enchanted permanent still retains its name, colors, mana cost, and mana value. It isn\'t a token unless it already was one."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "A creature is a legal target for Power Word Kill if it doesn\'t have any of these four creature types. If it has one of these four creature types, it\'s not a legal target, even if it also has a creature type that\'s not among these four. For example, a Demon Rogue is not a valid target for this spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "A creature you control that\'s more than one of the creature types listed in the first ability will get only +1/+1."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Death-Priest of Myrkul doesn\'t need to have been on the battlefield when the creature died. For example, if a creature dies during combat on your turn and you cast Death-Priest of Myrkul during your second main phase, its last ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Death-Priest of Myrkul\'s last ability will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many creatures died this turn. However, if no creatures have died so far this turn as the end step begins, the ability won\'t trigger at all. It\'s not possible to cause a creature to die during the end step in time to have the ability trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "A token has a mana value of 0 unless it\'s copying something else."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "An artifact\'s mana value is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner (unless that artifact is copying something else; see below). If its mana cost includes {X}, X is considered to be 0. If it has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s an animated land that\'s also an artifact, for example), its mana value is 0. Ignore any alternative costs or additional costs (such as kicker) paid when the artifact spell was cast."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If an artifact is copying something else, its mana value is the mana value of whatever it\'s copying."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Acererak the Archlich has an intervening if clause in its first triggered ability. If you have completed Tomb of Annihilation, the ability won\'t trigger at all. If it does trigger, but you somehow complete Tomb of Annihilation while the ability is on the stack, then the ability won\'t do anything. You won\'t return Acererak to its owner\'s hand and you won\'t venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Acererak is no longer on the battlefield as its first ability resolves and you haven\'t completed Tomb of Annihilation, you will still venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, each opponent decides in turn order whether or not they will sacrifice a creature and which one they will sacrifice. Each opponent knows the choices made before they make their own choice. Then, once all opponents have chosen, creatures are sacrificed and tokens are created simultaneously.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Although land cards aren\'t considered, nonland cards with mana value 0 are. For example if the cards in your graveyard are an artifact card with mana cost {X} and a sorcery card with mana cost {2}{U}, you\'ll draw two cards."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a card in your graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0 when determining that card\'s mana value."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Gelatinous Cube leaves the battlefield before its Engulf ability resolves, the target non-Ooze creature won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the engulfed creature card leaves exile, perhaps because of the Dissolve ability, it won\'t return to the battlefield after Gelatinous Cube leaves the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Portable Hole leaves the battlefield before its ability resolves, the target permanent won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If an Aura is exiled this way, its owner chooses what it will enchant as it returns to the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn\'t target anything (so it could be attached to a permanent with shroud, for example), but the Aura\'s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can\'t legally be attached to anything, it remains in exile for the rest of the game."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'We recommend keeping your Bag of Holding far, far away.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Battle Cry Goblin\'s activated ability will affect only Goblins you control as it resolves. If you activate it before attacking and then create a Goblin with its triggered ability during combat, the Goblin you create will not get +1/+0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Blue Dragon\'s Lightning Breath ability cannot target the same creature multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The last two targets are optional, but the first target is not. If an opponent has at least one creature the ability could target, you must choose a target to get -3/-0. (Note that the last two targets can be any creature, not just one an opponent controls.)\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Both the target creature and the mode are chosen on announcement. You can\'t choose a different form if something changes in response to the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The creature loses all other creature types, but it retains its abilities. Wild Shape will overwrite any previous effects that set the creature\'s power and toughness to specific numbers. Effects that otherwise modify the target creature\'s power and toughness will still apply no matter when they took effect. The same is true for +1/+1 counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Casting the copy happens as part of the resolution of Demilich\'s triggered ability. If you choose to cast it, you must do so right away. If you choose not to cast it right away, the copy ceases to exist the next time a player would receive priority."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Demilich\'s last ability doesn\'t change when you can cast it. In most cases, you can cast Demilich only during your main phase."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you exile a card as the triggered ability resolves, that card will remain exiled whether you cast the copy or not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "While casting Demilich, if you are required to pay an additional cost that includes a generic mana component, Demilich\'s cost reduction effect can apply to it. For example, if you\'re required to pay an additional {1} to cast Demilich (perhaps because of Sphere of Resistance), and you\'ve cast five or more instant and/or sorcery spells this turn, you would pay {0} to cast Demilich."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You must pay all normal costs for casting the copy.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Casting this spell and choosing the Find a Crossing mode targeting an attacking creature that has already been blocked won\'t change or undo that block. It will still get the +1/+0 though."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Casting this spell and choosing the Intimidate Them mode after blockers have been declared won\'t change or undo any blocks."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Copying a spell won\'t cause Sorcerer Class\'s level 3 ability to trigger and won\'t be counted toward the number of spells you\'ve cast during the turn. However, if an effect copies a card and you cast the copy, that will count for both of those things."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class has five abilities. The three in the major sections of its text box are class abilities. Class abilities can be static, activated, or triggered abilities. The other two are level abilities, one activated ability to advance the Class to level 2 and another to advance the Class to level 3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class starts with only the first of three class abilities. As the first level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 2 and gains the second class ability. As the second level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 3 and gains the third class ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Gaining a level is a normal activated ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Gaining a level won\'t remove abilities that a Class had at a previous level."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If the spell that causes the last ability to trigger is countered or is otherwise no longer on the stack as the ability resolves, it will still deal damage. Last known information will be used to do determine the effects of that damage. For example, if the spell has lifelink, you will still gain life when it deals damage, even if the spell was countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some Class cards have an effect that increases when more are under your control. For example, if you have multiple Barbarian Class cards, you roll that many additional dice and ignore that many of the lowest rolls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The last ability counts the number of spells that were cast before it resolved, not the number of spells that were cast before it was placed on the stack. For example, if you cast a sorcery and then respond to Sorcerer Class\'s triggered ability by casting an instant, both triggered abilities will deal 2 damage when they resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can multiclass or even control multiple Class enchantments of the same class. Each Class permanent tracks its own level separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate the first level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 1. Similarly, you can\'t activate the second level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Demogorgon\'s Clutches requires its target to discard cards before milling cards. This means they do not get to know what cards are milled when they choose what cards to discard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Drizzt\'s last ability checks his power both at the time the creature dies and at the time the ability resolves. Notably, this means that if several creatures with power greater than Drizzt\'s die at the same time, Drizzt\'s ability will trigger that many times, but some of those abilities may not put counters on him as they resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "During your turn, you can look at the top card of the chosen opponent\'s library whenever you want (with one restriction; see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the top card of that library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast a spell from the top of that library, you can\'t look at the next card until you\'re done paying for that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The target opponent may still cast spells in response to Xanathar, Guild Kingpin\'s ability in your upkeep. If that player has somehow become an illegal target for the ability as it tries to resolve, the ability does nothing. They may cast spells and you cannot look at or play the top card of their library."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Xanathar doesn\'t change when you can cast spells or play lands. You must still follow all normal timing rules and land play limits."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for spells cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Exiling Flameskull as its triggered ability resolves isn\'t optional, but if Flameskull leaves the graveyard before the ability starts resolving, you won\'t exile it or the top card of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You must still pay all costs and follow all timing rules for spells cast this way. Likewise, playing lands this way is subject to the normal rules for playing lands.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Fighting is not optional. If there is at least one legal target for The Tarrasque\'s last ability, it must fight."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The Tarrasque will have haste and ward {10} even if it was cast from a zone other than your hand. May we suggest the command zone?\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The fight happens in the declare attackers step before blockers are declared. Unless the creature it is fighting survives, that creature won\'t be able to block that combat."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Flumph\'s ability only triggers once each time it is dealt damage, even if multiple sources are dealing damage to it at once."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Flumph\'s ability will trigger even if it is dealt lethal damage."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Flumph\'s triggered ability is not optional. You must target an opponent if able."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the opponent is somehow an illegal target for Flumph\'s ability when it tries to resolve, neither player will draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "For the Interrogate Them mode, the cards you didn\'t choose remain in exile. If you don\'t play the chosen card, it also remains in exile."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Gloom Stalker will have double strike even if it wasn\'t on the battlefield as you completed a dungeon."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Grazilaxx\'s first ability triggers before combat damage is dealt. If you choose to return the creature to your hand, it won\'t deal or receive combat damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Green Dragon\'s Poison Breath ability continues to function until end of turn even if Green Dragon is destroyed or otherwise leaves the battlefield. It takes some time for toxic gas to dissipate."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Green Dragon\'s Poison Breath ability is different than deathtouch. Notably, creatures still need to deal damage to a blocking creature equal to its toughness before dealing damage to another blocking creature or trampling over to a player or planeswalker."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Grim Wanderer\'s ability doesn\'t care who controlled the creature that died."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Hama Pashar, Ruin Seeker\'s ability causes the same room you ventured into to trigger an additional time. It does not cause you to move to the next room."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Hand of Vecna\'s triggered ability uses the number of cards in your hand as it resolves to determine the bonus the creature gets. It won\'t change if the number of cards in your hand changes later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you control both Vecna and Hand of Vecna equipped to another creature, you choose which creature to apply the bonus to as the triggered ability resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Hobgoblin Bandit Lord\'s activated ability only counts the number of Goblins that entered the battlefield this turn. It doesn\'t matter if those Goblins are still on the battlefield as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If no Goblins have entered the battlefield this turn, no damage will be dealt. Abilities that trigger whenever damage is dealt won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Cave of the Frost Dragon enters the battlefield at the same time as one or more other lands, it doesn\'t take those lands into consideration when determining how many other lands you control."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you turn Cave of the Frost Dragon into a creature but haven\'t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won\'t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Den of the Bugbear enters the battlefield at the same time as one or more other lands, it doesn\'t take those lands into consideration when determining how many other lands you control."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Den of the Bugbear\'s last ability is activated multiple times in one turn, it will have multiple instances of the triggered ability that it grants. For example, if you activate it twice and attack, you will create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens that are tapped and attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you turn Den of the Bugbear into a creature but haven\'t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won\'t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Grand Master of Flowers somehow gains enough loyalty to become a creature while it is being attacked, it is removed from combat. If blockers haven\'t been declared yet, it may then block. It may even block creatures that were previously attacking it. Creatures that were previously attacking it that go unblocked won\'t deal combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The first ability of Grand Master of Flowers doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Similarly, players can\'t respond to paying the cost of adding loyalty counters for an ability. Therefore, if Grand Master of Flowers has six loyalty and you activate one of his abilities, he will be a 7/7 Dragon God with flying and indestructible before players can respond to the loyalty ability."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'While Grand Master of Flowers is a creature, he is not a planeswalker. He cannot be attacked and damage dealt to him while he is a creature will not reduce the number of loyalty counters he has. However, you may still activate his loyalty abilities as normal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can activate the last ability of Grand Master of Flowers even if there isn\'t a card named Monk of the Open Hand in your library or graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Hall of Storm Giants enters the battlefield at the same time as one or more other lands, it doesn\'t take those lands into consideration when determining how many other lands you control."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If an opponent casts a spell or ability that targets Hall of Storm Giants, and you activate the last ability in response, the ward ability Hall of Storm Giants gains won\'t trigger. (However, if it already had ward at the moment it became the target of the spell or ability, that instance of ward would trigger.)"}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you activate Hall of Storm Giants\'s last ability multiple times, it gains multiple instances of ward {3}. Each of those instances will trigger separately and ask the opponent who controls the spell or ability to pay {3}. If they don\'t for any of those instances, the spell or ability will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you turn Hall of Storm Giants into a creature but haven\'t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won\'t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Hive of the Eye Tyrant enters the battlefield at the same time as one or more other lands, it doesn\'t take those lands into consideration when determining how many other lands you control."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you activate Hive of the Eye Tyrant\'s last ability multiple times, it gains multiple instances of the triggered ability that exiles cards. For example, if you activate it twice and attack, you will choose two target cards to exile (or the same card twice, if you want to)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you turn Hive of the Eye Tyrant into a creature but haven\'t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won\'t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Lair of the Hydra enters the battlefield at the same time as one or more other lands, it doesn\'t take those lands into consideration when determining how many other lands you control."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you turn Lair of the Hydra into a creature but haven\'t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won\'t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Magic Missile has one or more targets, and some (but not all) of them are illegal as Magic Missile tries to resolve, the amount of damage dealt to the remaining legal targets doesn\'t change. If all targets become illegal, Magic Missile won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You divide the damage as you cast Magic Missile. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Meteor Swarm has one or more targets, and some (but not all) of them are illegal as Meteor Swarm tries to resolve, the amount of damage dealt to the remaining legal targets doesn\'t change. If all targets become illegal, Meteor Swarm won\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You divide the damage as you cast Meteor Swarm. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. Because there is a maximum of eight targets, X can\'t be greater than 8."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Mind Flayer leaves the battlefield or you lose control of it before its Dominate Monster ability resolves, control of the target creature doesn\'t change at all."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a creature\'s power is less than 0 when it\'s doubled, instead that creature gets -X/-0, where X is how much less than 0 its power is. For example, if an effect has given a 2/2 creature -4/-0 so that it\'s a -2/2 creature, doubling its power and toughness gives it -2/+2, and it becomes a -4/4 creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to “double” a creature\'s power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is its power as that effect begins to apply. The same is true for toughness."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a permanent on the battlefield or a card in a graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0 when determining that card\'s mana value."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Purple Worm\'s first ability will never reduce its cost more than {2}, no matter how many creatures died this turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability an opponent controls targets Iymrith, Desert Doom while it is tapped, finding a way to untap it in response will not cause its ward ability to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you choose not to have Dancing Sword become a creature as its triggered ability resolves, it will remain an Equipment and can be equipped to another creature as normal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If each creature the defending player controls can\'t block for any reason (such as being tapped), then the affected creature isn\'t blocked. If there\'s a cost associated with blocking the affected creature, the defending player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to be blocked in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Only one creature is required to block the affected creature. Other creatures may also block it and are free to block other creatures or not block at all.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the Iron Golem can\'t attack or block for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn\'t attack or block. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack or block, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack or block in that case either."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the creature affected by the Bewitching Whispers ability is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t block, then it doesn\'t block. If there\'s a cost associated with having that creature block, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to block in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Shessra, Death\'s Whisper\'s last ability will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many creatures died this turn. However, if no creatures have died so far this turn as the end step begins, the ability won\'t trigger at all. It\'s not possible to cause a creature to die during the end step in time to have the ability trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the target of the emblem\'s ability becomes an illegal target by the time the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t get an additional combat phase."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you have more than one of Zariel\'s emblem, the abilities will each trigger at the end of the first combat phase on your turn. You can choose the same creature as the target of each ability. Those targets will untap before any additional combats. No creatures will untap between the first additional combat and the second additional combat (or between the second and third, and so on, and wow, how long was Zariel under your control?!)"}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The ability of the emblem can target any creature you control, not just one that\'s tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'There is no main phase between the combat phases. You move from the first combat phase directly into the second combat phase.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you control multiple copies of Xorn, you\'ll create that many additional Treasure tokens."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you target an opponent\'s creature with Dragon Turtle\'s Drag Below ability and that target is illegal as the ability tries to resolve, the entire ability is removed from the stack and does nothing. Dragon Turtle will remain untapped and will untap as normal during its controller\'s next untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If, however, there are no legal targets for the Drag Below ability when Dragon Turtle enters the battlefield (or you choose not to target anything), Dragon Turtle\'s ability will still resolve and cause it to be tapped and it won\'t untap during its controllers next untap step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If your Trickster\'s Talisman is somehow equipped to a creature another player controls, that player will not be able to sacrifice Trickster\'s Talisman as the triggered ability resolves as they don\'t control it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "In some strange cases, you might make something into a copy of the Eye and/or Hand of Vecna and then exile that copy to activate The Book of Vile Darkness\'s ability. The ability that creates Vecna will look at the cards in exile, not the permanents on the battlefield, so it\'s possible to have Vecna gain different triggered abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'In the vast majority of cases, Vecna will gain the triggered ability printed on Hand of Vecna and the two triggered abilities printed on Eye of Vecna.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The Book of Vile Darkness has received an update. The current Oracle text appears above. Specifically, the triggered abilities that Vecna gains are part of its copiable values. This means any enters-the-battlefield triggered abilities it gains (such as the one from Eye of Vecna) will trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Mordenkainen\'s Polymorph will overwrite any previous effects that set the creature\'s power and toughness to specific values. Effects that otherwise modify the target creature\'s power and toughness will still apply no matter when they took effect. The same is true for +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The creature doesn\'t lose any of its abilities."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Nadaar doesn\'t need to have been on the battlefield when you completed a dungeon for its last ability to function."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Putting a land onto the battlefield this way doesn\'t count as playing a land and can be done even if you\'ve played a land this turn or if it isn\'t your turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The Angel won\'t lose the ability it gains if it stops being an Angel after the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The enlightenment counter placed by the last ability serves as a memory aid. It isn\'t connected to the granted ability. The Angel keeps that ability even if it loses the counter. Similarly, if the counter is somehow moved to another permanent, that permanent doesn\'t gain the ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The cards put into your hand due to Mordenkainen\'s last ability aren\'t “drawn.” Anything that cares about you drawing cards won\'t notice your hand suddenly becoming very, very well-stocked."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The power and toughness of the Dog Illusion token will change as the number of cards in your hand changes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The equipped creature\'s power is checked only during the declare blockers step. If its power becomes greater than 3 after blockers are declared, it still can\'t be blocked. Similarly, if its power becomes 3 or less after it\'s been blocked, this won\'t make it unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The last ability will overwrite any previous effects that set Werewolf Pack Leader\'s power and toughness to specific numbers. Effects that otherwise modify its power and toughness will still apply no matter when they took effect. The same is true for +1/+1 counters. For example, if you cast a spell that gives Werewolf Pack Leader +1/+1, after that resolves it is a 4/4 creature. If you then activate its last ability, it will be a 6/4 creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The player that controls Split the Party chooses which creatures to return to their owner\'s hand as it resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "White Dragon\'s Cold Breath ability can target a tapped creature. That creature won\'t untap during its controller\'s next untap step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A Dragon creature card is a creature card with the creature type Dragon, not necessarily a creature card with the word “Dragon” in its name.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The creature card is already tapped and attacking as it\'s put onto the battlefield. Any abilities that trigger whenever a creature becomes tapped or whenever a creature attacks won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You choose which player or planeswalker the Dragon is attacking as you put it onto the battlefield. It doesn\'t have to be the same player or planeswalker Minion of the Mighty is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A creature that becomes a Bird this way loses all other creature types but does not lose any of its abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Eccentric Apprentice\'s last ability works even if it wasn\'t on the battlefield when you completed a dungeon and even if the dungeon was completed on a previous turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The last ability will overwrite any previous effects that set the creature\'s power and toughness to specific numbers. Effects that otherwise modify the target creature\'s power and toughness will still apply no matter when they took effect. The same is true for +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Activating the Climb Over ability after a Wall has blocked won\'t change or undo that block."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The Tie Up ability doesn\'t tap the creature, it just prevents it from untapping if it is already tapped or becomes tapped through some other means."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Barrowin of Clan Undurr\'s last ability works even if it wasn\'t on the battlefield when you completed a dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Cloister Gargoyle\'s last ability works even if it wasn\'t on the battlefield when you completed a dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Ellywick Tumblestrum\'s last ability counts all dungeons you\'ve completed, whether they were completed before or after the emblem was created."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The emblem grants trample and haste even if you haven\'t completed a dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Precipitous Drop does not need to be on the battlefield when you complete the dungeon in order for the enchanted creature to get -5/-5.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The controller of Precipitous Drop ventures into the dungeon, not the controller of the enchanted creature. Similarly, Precipitous Drop cares whether its controller has completed a dungeon, not whether the creature\'s controller has completed a dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Zombie Ogre doesn\'t need to have been on the battlefield at the time the creature died for its ability to function."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Zombie Ogre\'s ability will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many creatures died this turn. However, if no creatures have died so far this turn as the end step begins, the ability won\'t trigger at all. It\'s not possible to cause a creature to die during the end step in time to have the ability trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If Zalto is dealt damage by multiple sources at the same time (usually creatures blocking it), you will only venture into the dungeon once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If Zalto is dealt lethal damage, you will still get to venture into the dungeon.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Additional costs from Paladin Class cards are cumulative. For example, if you control two Paladin Class cards, spells your opponents cast cost {2} more to cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class has five abilities. The three in the major sections of its text box are class abilities. Class abilities can be static, activated, or triggered abilities. The other two are level abilities, one activated ability to advance the Class to level 2 and another to advance the Class to level 3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class starts with only the first of three class abilities. As the first level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 2 and gains the second class ability. As the second level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 3 and gains the third class ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Gaining a level is a normal activated ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Gaining a level won\'t remove abilities that a Class had at a previous level."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Paladin Class is level 3 and you attack with exactly one creature, it won\'t get a power and toughness bonus, but it will get double strike."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some Class cards have an effect that increases when more are under your control. For example, if you have multiple Barbarian Class cards, you roll that many additional dice and ignore that many of the lowest rolls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can multiclass or even control multiple Class enchantments of the same class. Each Class permanent tracks its own level separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate the first level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 1. Similarly, you can\'t activate the second level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Although the token is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Delina, Wild Mage has received an update to its Oracle text. The official text is listed above. Specifically, rolling again on a result of 15–20 is optional.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You declare which player or planeswalker the token is attacking as you put it onto the battlefield. It doesn\'t have to be the same player or planeswalker Delina, Wild Mage is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you choose to put the card into your hand, you don\'t need to reveal it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The “otherwise” in the last ability refers to whether or not you put it onto the battlefield, not whether or not it\'s an artifact card. You may put it into your hand even if it\'s an artifact card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you control multiple copies of Wizard\'s Spellbook, each one tracks the cards it has exiled separately."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If your result is 10–19, you may pay {1} instead of its mana cost. You cannot pay its regular mana cost or any alternative costs the copy has. You may pay any additional costs and must pay mandatory additional costs.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If your result is 1–9, you must still pay all costs to cast the copy. You may pay any additional or alternative costs the spell has. If it has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If your result is 20, you may cast the copies without paying their mana costs. You cannot pay their regular mana costs or any alternative costs the copies have. You may pay any additional costs and must pay mandatory additional costs. You may cast the copies in any order you choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "In all cases, any copies you don\'t cast cease to exist after the ability is finished resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Like all results tables, the one on The Deck of Many Things cares about the result of the die roll after any adjustments, such as subtracting the number of cards in your hand. This means it\'s usually not possible to get a result of 20 unless you have no cards in hand."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Players decide in turn order, starting with the active player (or the next opponent in turn order if the active player isn\'t sacrificing anything), which permanent(s) they will sacrifice. Players later in turn order will know which permanents were picked by earlier players while they make this choice. Once all choices have been made, all permanents are sacrificed simultaneously."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'If you do not play the exiled cards on the turn that they are exiled, they remain exiled indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Normal costs and timing permissions apply to cards played this way. Unless an effect says you can play additional lands during your turn, you cannot play a land exiled this way if you have already played one this turn.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'The cards are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers “whenever you gain life” triggers just once for each life gain event, no matter how much life you gain.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class has five abilities. The three in the major sections of its text box are class abilities. Class abilities can be static, activated, or triggered abilities. The other two are level abilities, one activated ability to advance the Class to level 2 and another to advance the Class to level 3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class starts with only the first of three class abilities. As the first level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 2 and gains the second class ability. As the second level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 3 and gains the third class ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life gain event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, you will gain 2 additional life from Cleric Class\'s first ability and its level 2 ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), you will only gain 1 additional life and the ability will trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Gaining a level is a normal activated ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Gaining a level won\'t remove abilities that a Class had at a previous level."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability will trigger only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you gain life at the same time a creature is dealt lethal damage, it dies before Cleric Class\'s level 2 ability can put a +1/+1 counter on it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some Class cards have an effect that increases when more are under your control. For example, if you have multiple Barbarian Class cards, you roll that many additional dice and ignore that many of the lowest rolls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "When Cleric Class\'s level 3 ability resolves, you gain life equal to the creature\'s toughness as it exists on battlefield, which may be different than its toughness in the graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can multiclass or even control multiple Class enchantments of the same class. Each Class permanent tracks its own level separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate the first level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 1. Similarly, you can\'t activate the second level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 2."}]', "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'An ability that triggers “whenever you gain life” triggers just once for each life gain event, no matter how much life you gain.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life gain event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, a “whenever you gain life” ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'If you gain life at the same time Celestial Unicorn is dealt lethal damage, it dies before its ability can put a +1/+1 counter on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'An ability that triggers “whenever you gain life” triggers just once for each life gain event, no matter how much life you gain.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life gain event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, a “whenever you gain life” ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'If you gain life at the same time Trelasarra, Moon Dancer is dealt lethal damage, it dies before its triggered ability can put a +1/+1 counter on it, but you will still scry 1.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An attacking or blocking creature that phases out is removed from combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Any continuous effects with a “for as long as” duration, such as that of Mind Flayer, ignore phased-out objects. If ignoring those objects causes the effect\'s conditions to no longer be met, the duration will expire."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "As Blink Dog phases out, Auras and Equipment attached to it also phase out at the same time. Those Auras and Equipment will phase in at the same time Blink Dog does, and they\'ll phase in still attached to Blink Dog."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choices made for permanents as they entered the battlefield are remembered when they phase in.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If an opponent gains control of your Blink Dog, activates its Teleport ability, and the duration of the control-change effect expires before it phases in, Blink Dog phases in under your control as that opponent\'s next untap step begins. If they leave the game before their next untap step, Blink Dog phases in as the next untap step begins after their turn would have begun."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Permanents phase back in during their controller\'s untap step, immediately before that player untaps their permanents. Creatures that phase in this way are able to attack and pay a cost of {T} during that turn. If a permanent had counters on it when it phased out, it will have those counters when it phases back in."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Phased out permanents are treated as though they don\'t exist. They can\'t be the target of spells or abilities, their static abilities have no effect on the game, their triggered abilities can\'t trigger, they can\'t attack or block, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Phasing out doesn\'t cause any “leaves the battlefield” abilities to trigger. Similarly, phasing in won\'t cause any “enters the battlefield” abilities to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An attacking or blocking creature that phases out is removed from combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Any continuous effects with a “for as long as” duration, such as that of Mind Flayer, ignore phased-out objects. If ignoring those objects causes the effect\'s conditions to no longer be met, the duration will expire."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "As a creature is phased out, Auras and Equipment attached to it also phase out at the same time. Those Auras and Equipment will phase in at the same time that creature does, and they\'ll phase in still attached to that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choices made for permanents as they entered the battlefield are remembered when they phase in.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If an opponent gains control of one of your creatures, that creature phases out, and the duration of the control-change effect expires before it phases back in, that creature phases in under your control as that opponent\'s next untap step begins. If they leave the game before their next untap step, it phases in as the next untap step begins after their turn would have begun."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Permanents phase back in during their controller\'s untap step, immediately before that player untaps their permanents. Creatures that phase in this way are able to attack and pay a cost of {T} during that turn. If a permanent had counters on it when it phased out, it will have those counters when it phases back in."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Phased out permanents are treated as though they don\'t exist. They can\'t be the target of spells or abilities, their static abilities have no effect on the game, their triggered abilities can\'t trigger, they can\'t attack or block, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Phasing out doesn\'t cause any “leaves the battlefield” abilities to trigger. Similarly, phasing in won\'t cause any “enters the battlefield” abilities to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An attacking or blocking creature that phases out is removed from combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Any continuous effects with a “for as long as” duration, such as that of Mind Flayer, ignore phased-out objects. If ignoring those objects causes the effect\'s conditions to no longer be met, the duration will expire."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "As a creature is phased out, Auras and Equipment attached to it also phase out at the same time. Those Auras and Equipment will phase in at the same time that creature does, and they\'ll phase in still attached to that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choices made for permanents as they entered the battlefield are remembered when they phase in.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If an opponent gains control of your nonblack creature, you phase it out with Divine Smite, and the duration of the control-change effect expires before it phases back in, your creature phases in under your control as that opponent\'s next untap step begins. If they leave the game before their next untap step, it phases in as the next untap step begins after their turn would have begun."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Permanents phase back in during their controller\'s untap step, immediately before that player untaps their permanents. Creatures that phase in this way are able to attack and pay a cost of {T} during that turn. If a permanent had counters on it when it phased out, it will have those counters when it phases back in."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Phased out permanents are treated as though they don\'t exist. They can\'t be the target of spells or abilities, their static abilities have no effect on the game, their triggered abilities can\'t trigger, they can\'t attack or block, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Phasing out doesn\'t cause any “leaves the battlefield” abilities to trigger. Similarly, phasing in won\'t cause any “enters the battlefield” abilities to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Casting Ebondeath, Dracolich from your graveyard follows the normal rules for casting that card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Ebondeath Dracolich cares what the creature\'s name was while it was last on the battlefield, not what it is in the graveyard. For example, if a creature with a different name becomes a copy of Ebondeath, Dracolich and then dies, you won\'t be able to cast Ebondeath, Dracolich from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Ebondeath, Dracolich\'s last ability cares only whether a creature not named Ebondeath, Dracolich died during the turn, even if Ebondeath, Dracolich wasn\'t in your graveyard when that happened. It doesn\'t matter if a creature named Ebondeath, Dracolich also died, and it doesn\'t matter what happens to the creature after it dies. For example, if the creature that died is a token or the creature card leaves the graveyard later in the turn, you can still cast Ebondeath, Dracolich."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class has five abilities. The three in the major sections of its text box are class abilities. Class abilities can be static, activated, or triggered abilities. The other two are level abilities, one activated ability to advance the Class to level 2 and another to advance the Class to level 3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class starts with only the first of three class abilities. As the first level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 2 and gains the second class ability. As the second level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 3 and gains the third class ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "For the last triggered ability, if the target creature is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t block, then it doesn\'t block. If there\'s a cost associated with having that creature block, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to block in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Gaining a level is a normal activated ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Gaining a level won\'t remove abilities that a Class had at a previous level."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the last triggered ability triggers more than once in the same combat, a single creature may be required to block more than one creature. As long as it doesn\'t have an ability that would allow that, its controller choose which attacking creature it blocks."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some Class cards have an effect that increases when more are under your control. For example, if you have multiple Barbarian Class cards, you roll that many additional dice and ignore that many of the lowest rolls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The discount to equip abilities applies only to generic mana requirements. If you control multiple Fighter Classes that are level 2 or higher, equip abilities cost {2} less for each one. This can\'t make an ability cost less than {0}."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can multiclass or even control multiple Class enchantments of the same class. Each Class permanent tracks its own level separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate the first level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 1. Similarly, you can\'t activate the second level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class has five abilities. The three in the major sections of its text box are class abilities. Class abilities can be static, activated, or triggered abilities. The other two are level abilities, one activated ability to advance the Class to level 2 and another to advance the Class to level 3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class starts with only the first of three class abilities. As the first level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 2 and gains the second class ability. As the second level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 3 and gains the third class ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'For the third ability, the power and toughness of the creature will change as the number of lands you control changes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Gaining a level is a normal activated ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Gaining a level won\'t remove abilities that a Class had at a previous level."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you have more than one Druid Class at level 2 or higher, you can play that many additional lands per turn. For example, with two Druid Classes at level 2, you can play three lands during your turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some Class cards have an effect that increases when more are under your control. For example, if you have multiple Barbarian Class cards, you roll that many additional dice and ignore that many of the lowest rolls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can multiclass or even control multiple Class enchantments of the same class. Each Class permanent tracks its own level separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate the first level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 1. Similarly, you can\'t activate the second level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class has five abilities. The three in the major sections of its text box are class abilities. Class abilities can be static, activated, or triggered abilities. The other two are level abilities, one activated ability to advance the Class to level 2 and another to advance the Class to level 3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class starts with only the first of three class abilities. As the first level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 2 and gains the second class ability. As the second level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 3 and gains the third class ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Gaining a level is a normal activated ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Gaining a level won\'t remove abilities that a Class had at a previous level."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Monk Class is the first spell you cast, the next spell is the second spell and costs {1} less. If Monk Class is the second (or later) spell you cast, its bonus won\'t apply until the next turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you have more than one Monk Class on the battlefield, their abilities are cumulative. For example, if you control two Monk Classes, the second spell you cast each turn costs {2} less to cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some Class cards have an effect that increases when more are under your control. For example, if you have multiple Barbarian Class cards, you roll that many additional dice and ignore that many of the lowest rolls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can multiclass or even control multiple Class enchantments of the same class. Each Class permanent tracks its own level separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate the first level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 1. Similarly, you can\'t activate the second level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class has five abilities. The three in the major sections of its text box are class abilities. Class abilities can be static, activated, or triggered abilities. The other two are level abilities, one activated ability to advance the Class to level 2 and another to advance the Class to level 3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class starts with only the first of three class abilities. As the first level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 2 and gains the second class ability. As the second level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 3 and gains the third class ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Gaining a level is a normal activated ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Gaining a level won\'t remove abilities that a Class had at a previous level."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Ranger Class is level 3, you can look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction; see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast a spell from the top of your library, you can\'t look at the next one until you\'re done paying for that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Ranger Class doesn\'t change when you can cast creature spells. Normally, this means during your main phase when the stack is empty, although flash may change this."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some Class cards have an effect that increases when more are under your control. For example, if you have multiple Barbarian Class cards, you roll that many additional dice and ignore that many of the lowest rolls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability Ranger Class gets at level 2 can trigger only once per combat, no matter how many creatures you attack with.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can multiclass or even control multiple Class enchantments of the same class. Each Class permanent tracks its own level separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate the first level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 1. Similarly, you can\'t activate the second level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 2."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for the spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class has five abilities. The three in the major sections of its text box are class abilities. Class abilities can be static, activated, or triggered abilities. The other two are level abilities, one activated ability to advance the Class to level 2 and another to advance the Class to level 3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class starts with only the first of three class abilities. As the first level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 2 and gains the second class ability. As the second level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 3 and gains the third class ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Gaining a level is a normal activated ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Gaining a level won\'t remove abilities that a Class had at a previous level."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you control multiple Bard Classes, legendary creatures you control enter the battlefield with that many additional +1/+1 counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you do not play the cards exiled with Bard Classes Level 3 ability on the turn they are exiled, they will remain exiled indefinitely and cannot be played on a later turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you exile a modal double-faced card this way, you may cast either face of that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some Class cards have an effect that increases when more are under your control. For example, if you have multiple Barbarian Class cards, you roll that many additional dice and ignore that many of the lowest rolls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Unlike most abilities that reduce the costs of spells, Bard Class\'s Level 2 ability cannot be applied to generic mana costs. For example, a spell that costs {2}{G} to cast would instead cost {2} to cast."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can multiclass or even control multiple Class enchantments of the same class. Each Class permanent tracks its own level separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate the first level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 1. Similarly, you can\'t activate the second level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class has five abilities. The three in the major sections of its text box are class abilities. Class abilities can be static, activated, or triggered abilities. The other two are level abilities, one activated ability to advance the Class to level 2 and another to advance the Class to level 3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class starts with only the first of three class abilities. As the first level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 2 and gains the second class ability. As the second level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 3 and gains the third class ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Gaining a level is a normal activated ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Gaining a level won\'t remove abilities that a Class had at a previous level."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you have more than one Rogue Class on the battlefield, they each track exiled cards individually.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some Class cards have an effect that increases when more are under your control. For example, if you have multiple Barbarian Class cards, you roll that many additional dice and ignore that many of the lowest rolls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can multiclass or even control multiple Class enchantments of the same class. Each Class permanent tracks its own level separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate the first level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 1. Similarly, you can\'t activate the second level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class has five abilities. The three in the major sections of its text box are class abilities. Class abilities can be static, activated, or triggered abilities. The other two are level abilities, one activated ability to advance the Class to level 2 and another to advance the Class to level 3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class starts with only the first of three class abilities. As the first level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 2 and gains the second class ability. As the second level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 3 and gains the third class ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Gaining a level is a normal activated ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Gaining a level won\'t remove abilities that a Class had at a previous level."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some Class cards have an effect that increases when more are under your control. For example, if you have multiple Barbarian Class cards, you roll that many additional dice and ignore that many of the lowest rolls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Warlock Class does not need to have been on the battlefield when the creature died for its first ability. For example, if a creature died in combat and you cast Warlock Class in your second main phase, the ability will trigger at the beginning of your end step.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Warlock Class\'s first ability will trigger only once during your end step, no matter how many creatures died this turn. However, if no creatures have died so far this turn as the end step begins, the ability won\'t trigger at all. It\'s not possible to cause a creature to die during the end step in time to have the ability trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can multiclass or even control multiple Class enchantments of the same class. Each Class permanent tracks its own level separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate the first level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 1. Similarly, you can\'t activate the second level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 2."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class has five abilities. The three in the major sections of its text box are class abilities. Class abilities can be static, activated, or triggered abilities. The other two are level abilities, one activated ability to advance the Class to level 2 and another to advance the Class to level 3.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Class starts with only the first of three class abilities. As the first level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 2 and gains the second class ability. As the second level ability resolves, the Class becomes level 3 and gains the third class ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Gaining a level is a normal activated ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Gaining a level won\'t remove abilities that a Class had at a previous level."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some Class cards have an effect that increases when more are under your control. For example, if you have multiple Barbarian Class cards, you roll that many additional dice and ignore that many of the lowest rolls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can multiclass or even control multiple Class enchantments of the same class. Each Class permanent tracks its own level separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate the first level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 1. Similarly, you can\'t activate the second level ability of a Class unless that Class is level 2."}]', "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'For example, if Ochre Jelly had five +1/+1 counters on it when it dies, the token you create will enter the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it. When that token dies, the next one you create will enter with one +1/+1 counter on it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'However, if you have a way to decrease its power, you can cause the triggered ability to trigger multiple times in a single turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "That triggered ability triggers only if the activated ability causes the power of Inferno of the Star Mounts to become exactly 20. If its power becomes 20 in any other way, the ability won\'t trigger. If its power becomes 21 or greater this way, the ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You don\'t choose a target when you activate the activated ability. You choose a target for the linked triggered ability only if it triggers because the power of Inferno of the Star Mounts became 20."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If Asmodeus the Archfiend leaves the battlefield before you activate its last ability, any cards exiled by its replacement effect remain exiled face down for the rest of the game. If you somehow return the same Asmodeus the Archfiend card to the battlefield, it will be a different object with no connection to those face-down cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If a card is exiled face-down and no player has been given permission to look at it, no player is allowed to look at it as long as it remains exiled face-down.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If your library is empty, no cards will be exiled but you won\'t lose the game due to drawing from an empty library."}]', "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'If Clever Conjurer somehow loses the name Clever Conjurer, perhaps because you mutated another creature on top of it or copied it with Sakashima the Impostor, it can target itself with its Mage Hand ability. How clever!'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If Monk of the Open Hand is the second spell you cast in a turn, spells you cast after that point in the same turn will not cause the Flurry of Blows ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Monk of the Open Hand doesn\'t need to have been on the battlefield as the first spell was cast. For example, if Monk of the Open Hand is the first spell you cast, and then you cast another spell after the Monk resolved, that spell would cause the Flurry of Blows ability to trigger."}]', "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'If a creature with ward is equipped with Leather Armor, becoming the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls will cause both ward abilities to trigger.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If a creature with ward is equipped with Plate Armor, becoming the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls will cause both ward abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If an effect begins to apply to the first target permanent before it becomes a copy of another permanent, that effect will continue to apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If either target is an illegal target for True Polymorph as it resolves, the spell will do nothing.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the first target becomes a creature the same turn it entered the battlefield, you can\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities unless it has haste."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the first target permanent copies a permanent that\'s copying something else, it will become whatever the second target is copying."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If the target permanent is an Equipment attached to a creature and it becomes a copy of a non-Equipment permanent, it becomes unattached. If it becomes a copy of an Equipment, it remains attached.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "True Polymorph causes the first target permanent to copy the printed values of the second target permanent, including any copy and mutate effects that have been applied to it. It won\'t copy counters on that permanent or effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "True Polymorph\'s effect does not have a duration. The copy effect it creates lasts as long as the first target remains on the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a Treasure, it means any Treasure artifact, not just a Treasure artifact token.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Mimic is still a Treasure after its last ability resolves, but Treasure is an artifact type, never a creature type.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If the enchanted creature is red (or if it becomes red), it loses all abilities that it had prior to the time Ray of Frost became attached to it. It will keep any abilities that were granted to it after Ray of Frost became attached to it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If the enchanted creature is red and has a characteristic-defining ability that specifies its power and/or toughness, that ability will not have its effect. In that case, its power and/or toughness (as appropriate) become 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the enchanted creature is red and has a characteristic-defining ability that specifies its types or colors, that ability will still have its effect because it\'s applied before the creature loses the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some noncreature permanents, such as Grand Master of Flowers, become creatures because of a static ability they have. If Ray of Frost becomes attached to such a creature and that creature is red or becomes red, that permanent will remain a creature even though it loses the ability that is making it a creature after that ability applies.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'If the target is not legal as Grim Bounty tries to resolve, perhaps because the creature or planeswalker is no longer on the battlefield, it will do nothing. You will not create a Treasure token.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'In a casual game, a card you choose from outside the game comes from your personal collection. In a tournament event, a card you choose from outside the game must come from your sideboard. In Limited events, your sideboard includes an arbitrary number of basic lands. You may look at your sideboard at any time.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'You choose the card to play from outside the game at the time you are playing it, not at the time Wish resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'You still need to pay all costs to play a card this way, and you must follow all normal timing rules.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, each opponent in turn order will choose which enchantment to sacrifice, and they get to know the choices made before them by other players. Once those decisions are made, the chosen enchantments are all sacrificed at the same time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Minsc has asked us (repeatedly) to let you know that Boo is the only miniature giant space hamster in the Realms.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The activated ability will overwrite any previous effects that set the creature\'s power and toughness to specific values. Effects that otherwise modify the target creature\'s power and toughness will still apply no matter when they took effect. The same is true for +1/+1 counters."}]', "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Setting your life total to a specific value counts as gaining or losing life, as appropriate.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'The first target will always get +2/+0 and first strike. If you target only one creature, you cannot choose to give it +0/+2 and lifelink.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'You cannot target the same creature twice.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The pack tactics ability goes on the stack without a target. If you sacrifice another creature as it resolves, the reflexive triggered ability will trigger and choose a target for it at that time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Use the sacrificed creature\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much damage is dealt."}]', "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'When the equipped creature attacks alone, it causes both abilities to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'You may cast Orcus, Prince of Undeath with X equal to 0. If you do, the triggered ability will do nothing as it resolves.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Drizzt Do\'Urden", \'text\': "Doppelschlag\\nWenn Drizzt Do\'Urden ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge Guenhwyvar, einen legendären 4/1 grünen Katze-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur stirbt und falls ihre Stärke größer war als die von Drizzt, lege so viele +1/+1-Marken auf Drizzt, wie die Differenz beträgt.", \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Waldläufer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527767&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b521d8ad-79e4-4062-8487-9ce985d51e85\', \'multiverseId\': 527767}, \'multiverseid\': 527767}, {\'name\': "Drizzt Do\'Urden", \'text\': "Daña dos veces.\\nCuando Drizzt Do\'Urden entre al campo de batalla, crea a Guenhwyvar, una ficha de criatura legendaria Felino verde 4/1 con la habilidad de arrollar.\\nSiempre que una criatura muera, si tenía una fuerza mayor que la fuerza de Drizzt, pon una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre Drizzt igual a la diferencia.", \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guardabosque elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feb84b6b-4d2d-4e66-b235-fab291994512\', \'multiverseId\': 528028}, \'multiverseid\': 528028}, {\'name\': "Drizzt Do\'Urden", \'text\': "Double initiative\\nQuand Drizzt Do\'Urden arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez Guenhwyvar, un jeton de créature légendaire 4/1 verte Chat avec le piétinement.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature meurt, si elle avait une force supérieure à la force de Drizzt, mettez sur Drizzt un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal à la différence.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et ranger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528289&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'167f7587-0461-4f42-af31-97f6e84ee629\', \'multiverseId\': 528289}, \'multiverseid\': 528289}, {\'name\': "Drizzt Do\'Urden", \'text\': "Doppio attacco\\nQuando Drizzt Do\'Urden entra nel campo di battaglia, crea Guenhwyvar, una pedina creatura leggendaria Felino 4/1 verde con travolgere.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura muore, se la sua forza era superiore a quella di Drizzt, metti su Drizzt un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari alla differenza.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Ranger Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d4414df-7b18-4c4c-b0c1-a8715740115e\', \'multiverseId\': 528550}, \'multiverseid\': 528550}, {\'name\': \'ドリッズト・ドゥアーデン\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\nドリッズト・ドゥアーデンが戦場に出たとき、「グエンワイヴァー」という名前でトランプルを持つ緑の４/１の伝説の猫・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、それがドリッズト・ドゥアーデンのパワーより大きいパワーを持っていた場合、ドリッズト・ドゥアーデンの上にその差に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・レインジャー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7c490dd-2330-4817-a85b-1602fde53938\', \'multiverseId\': 528811}, \'multiverseid\': 528811}, {\'name\': \'드리스트 두얼든\', \'text\': \'이단공격\\n드리스트 두얼든이 전장에 들어올 때, 이름이 그웨니바르이며 돌진을 가진 전설적 4/1 녹색 고양이 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n생물이 죽을 때마다, 그 생물의 공격력이 드리스트의 공격력보다 크다면, 그 차이만큼 드리스트에 +1/+1 카운터를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 엘프 레인저\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'826aa764-4a16-491d-a8f3-0a68fe4fa8ca\', \'multiverseId\': 529071}, \'multiverseid\': 529071}, {\'name\': "Drizzt Do\'Urden", \'text\': "Golpe duplo\\nQuando Drizzt Do\'Urden entrar no campo de batalha, crie Guenhwyvar, uma ficha de criatura lendária Felino verde 4/1 com atropelar.\\nToda vez que uma criatura morrer, se seu poder era maior que o de Drizzt, coloque em Drizzt um número de marcadores +1/+1 igual à diferença.", \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Guardião\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d3129a5-47fe-4a00-a1f9-6ecd89e41678\', \'multiverseId\': 529332}, \'multiverseid\': 529332}, {\'name\': "Дриззт До\'Урден", \'text\': "Двойной удар\\nКогда Дриззт До\'Урден выходит на поле битвы, создайте Гвенвивар, фишку легендарного существа 4/1 зеленая Кошка с Пробивным ударом.\\nКаждый раз, когда умирает существо, если его сила была больше, чем сила Дриззта, положите на Дриззта количество жетонов +1/+1, равное разнице.", \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльф Следопыт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efd8f399-e425-40d0-898d-6441d55dd019\', \'multiverseId\': 529593}, \'multiverseid\': 529593}, {\'name\': \'崔斯特杜垩登\', \'text\': \'连击\\n当崔斯特杜垩登进战场时，派出传奇衍生生物关海法，其为4/1绿色，具践踏异能的猫。\\n每当一个生物死去时，若其力量大于崔斯特，则在崔斯特上放置等同于该差距数量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／游侠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd0d0cd-5955-41b9-8bd7-06532f654724\', \'multiverseId\': 529853}, \'multiverseid\': 529853}, {\'name\': \'崔斯特杜堊登\', \'text\': \'連擊\\n當崔斯特杜堊登進戰場時，派出傳奇衍生生物關海法，其為4/1綠色，具踐踏異能的貓。\\n每當一個生物死去時，若其力量大於崔斯特，則在崔斯特上放置等同於該差距數量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～妖精／遊俠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc3b463e-e2f7-4bcc-ba22-521719097877\', \'multiverseId\': 530113}, \'multiverseid\': 530113}]', '[{\'name\': "Drizzt Do\'Urden", \'text\': "Doppelschlag\\nWenn Drizzt Do\'Urden ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge Guenhwyvar, einen legendären 4/1 grünen Katze-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur stirbt und falls ihre Stärke größer war als die von Drizzt, lege so viele +1/+1-Marken auf Drizzt, wie die Differenz beträgt.", \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Waldläufer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531023&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36191031-6bd4-4a64-adb3-da50c93abcd5\', \'multiverseId\': 531023}, \'multiverseid\': 531023}, {\'name\': "Drizzt Do\'Urden", \'text\': "Daña dos veces.\\nCuando Drizzt Do\'Urden entre al campo de batalla, crea a Guenhwyvar, una ficha de criatura legendaria Felino verde 4/1 con la habilidad de arrollar.\\nSiempre que una criatura muera, si tenía una fuerza mayor que la fuerza de Drizzt, pon una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre Drizzt igual a la diferencia.", \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guardabosque elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b475b50-58d8-4c08-b28c-b788f920eb32\', \'multiverseId\': 531074}, \'multiverseid\': 531074}, {\'name\': "Drizzt Do\'Urden", \'text\': "Double initiative\\nQuand Drizzt Do\'Urden arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez Guenhwyvar, un jeton de créature légendaire 4/1 verte Chat avec le piétinement.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature meurt, si elle avait une force supérieure à la force de Drizzt, mettez sur Drizzt un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal à la différence.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et ranger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67a20993-699e-42d4-ac55-8842db93f15e\', \'multiverseId\': 531125}, \'multiverseid\': 531125}, {\'name\': "Drizzt Do\'Urden", \'text\': "Doppio attacco\\nQuando Drizzt Do\'Urden entra nel campo di battaglia, crea Guenhwyvar, una pedina creatura leggendaria Felino 4/1 verde con travolgere.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura muore, se la sua forza era superiore a quella di Drizzt, metti su Drizzt un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari alla differenza.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Ranger Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab7fee08-897c-409b-b563-4c832fb2c6e0\', \'multiverseId\': 531176}, \'multiverseid\': 531176}, {\'name\': \'ドリッズト・ドゥアーデン\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\nドリッズト・ドゥアーデンが戦場に出たとき、「グエンワイヴァー」という名前 でトランプルを持ち緑の４/１の伝説の猫・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、それがドリッズト・ドゥアーデンのパワーより大きいパワーを持っていた場合、ドリッズト・ドゥアーデンの上にその差に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・レインジャー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cea129da-db89-4563-99c8-39fd3bdfd6eb\', \'multiverseId\': 531227}, \'multiverseid\': 531227}, {\'name\': \'드리스트 두얼든\', \'text\': \'이단공격\\n드리스트 두얼든이 전장에 들어올 때, 이름이 그웨니바르이며 돌진을 가진 전설적 4/1 녹색 고양이 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n생물이 죽을 때마다, 그 생물의 공격력이 드리스트의 공격력보다 크다면, 그 차이만큼 드리스트에 +1/+1 카운터를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 엘프 레인저\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5099cfc9-60e4-4a46-a67b-7a98b2d29d1d\', \'multiverseId\': 531278}, \'multiverseid\': 531278}, {\'name\': "Drizzt Do\'Urden", \'text\': "Golpe duplo\\nQuando Drizzt Do\'Urden entrar no campo de batalha, crie Guenhwyvar, uma ficha de criatura lendária Felino verde 4/1 com atropelar.\\nToda vez que uma criatura morrer, se seu poder era maior que o de Drizzt, coloque em Drizzt um número de marcadores +1/+1 igual à diferença.", \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Guardião\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6f9c46c-fff3-4a9d-814b-ecbca7e92cbc\', \'multiverseId\': 531329}, \'multiverseid\': 531329}, {\'name\': "Дриззт До\'Урден", \'text\': "Двойной удар\\nКогда Дриззт До\'Урден выходит на поле битвы, создайте Гвенвивар, фишку легендарного существа 4/1 зеленая Кошка с Пробивным ударом.\\nКаждый раз, когда умирает существо, если его сила была больше, чем сила Дриззта, положите на Дриззта количество жетонов +1/+1, равное разнице.", \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльф Следопыт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44634e8a-a7d8-4699-84e0-7ec6dc9e9708\', \'multiverseId\': 531380}, \'multiverseid\': 531380}, {\'name\': \'崔斯特杜垩登\', \'text\': \'连击\\n当崔斯特杜垩登进战场时，派出传奇衍生生物关海法，其为4/1绿色，具践踏异能的猫。\\n每当一个生物死去时，若其力量大于崔斯特，则在崔斯特上放置等同于该差距数量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／游侠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df2978e6-85b1-45cd-8904-b0b5030de140\', \'multiverseId\': 531431}, \'multiverseid\': 531431}, {\'name\': \'崔斯特杜堊登\', \'text\': \'連擊\\n當崔斯特杜堊登進戰場時，派出傳奇衍生生物關海法，其為4/1綠色，具踐踏異能的貓。\\n每當一個生物死去時，若其力量大於崔斯特，則在崔斯特上放置等同於該差距數量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～妖精／遊俠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beed7c1b-b418-4123-9eaf-2e0c737ad687\', \'multiverseId\': 531482}, \'multiverseid\': 531482}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgebrühte Söldnerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Abgebrühte Söldnerin ins Spiel kommt und falls Mana von einem Schatz ausgegeben wurde, um sie zu wirken, erhält sie Erstschlag und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Heute noch? Das kostet extra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527699&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47e3920e-cc2e-4881-af41-7c50d269b61a\', \'multiverseId\': 527699}, \'multiverseid\': 527699}, {\'name\': \'Sicaria cansada\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Sicaria cansada entre al campo de batalla, si se usó maná de un Tesoro para lanzarla, gana las habilidades de dañar primero y prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero dragón\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Hoy? Tendrás que pagarme más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbe41220-63bd-4738-935c-9f789a621b75\', \'multiverseId\': 527960}, \'multiverseid\': 527960}, {\'name\': \'Épée à louer désabusée\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Épée à louer désabusée arrive sur le champ de bataille, si du mana d\'un trésor a été dépensé pour la lancer, elle acquiert l\'initiative et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Aujourd\'hui ? Ça vous coûtera plus cher. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528221&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9158821-5c22-444f-8122-38d20270137c\', \'multiverseId\': 528221}, \'multiverseid\': 528221}, {\'name\': \'Prezzolata Impassibile\', \'text\': \'Quando la Prezzolata Impassibile entra nel campo di battaglia, se è stato speso mana da un Tesoro per lanciarla, ha attacco improvviso e rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Drago\', \'flavor\': \'"Oggi stesso? Ti costerà di più."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fe9a5f7-d3f6-466a-9082-63bda1f6e704\', \'multiverseId\': 528482}, \'multiverseid\': 528482}, {\'name\': \'疲れ切った売剣\', \'text\': \'疲れ切った売剣が戦場に出たとき、これを唱えるために宝物からのマナが支払われていた場合、ターン終了時まで、これは先制攻撃と速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「今日中に？ならば、割増料金だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8fadc8b-ec23-41a6-9933-3d456dda2b4a\', \'multiverseId\': 528743}, \'multiverseid\': 528743}, {\'name\': \'싫증난 용병\', \'text\': \'싫증난 용병이 전장에 들어올 때, 싫증난 용병을 발동하는 데 보물로 생성된 마나가 지불되었다면, 싫증난 용병은 턴종료까지 선제공격 및 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"오늘이라고? 그럼 추가 비용이 드는데."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'510e9043-a3a9-48c5-8688-540c8ab10d6b\', \'multiverseId\': 529003}, \'multiverseid\': 529003}, {\'name\': \'Mercenário Exausto\', \'text\': \'Quando Mercenário Exausto entra no campo de batalha, se o mana de um Tesouro foi gasto para conjurá-lo, ele ganha iniciativa e ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Hoje? Vai custar mais caro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dc5fcc0-1bf4-4346-a095-9610f767f654\', \'multiverseId\': 529264}, \'multiverseid\': 529264}, {\'name\': \'Усталая Наемница\', \'text\': \'Когда Усталая Наемница выходит на поле битвы, если на ее разыгрывание была потрачена мана от Клада, она получает Первый удар и Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Сегодня? За это придется заплатить отдельно».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'229245ad-c44f-47b9-b9e2-914797b4624f\', \'multiverseId\': 529525}, \'multiverseid\': 529525}, {\'name\': \'疲惫贷剑客\', \'text\': \'当疲惫贷剑客进战场时，若施放它时支付过来自珍宝的法术力，则它获得先攻与敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「今天？那你要加钱。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'016c2eed-ec0d-4a24-9150-7b2497dad9be\', \'multiverseId\': 529785}, \'multiverseid\': 529785}, {\'name\': \'疲憊貸劍客\', \'text\': \'當疲憊貸劍客進戰場時，若施放它時支付過來自珍寶的魔法力，則它獲得先攻與敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「今天？那你要加錢。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e97f90b-dcc6-43cf-a8e7-231b14c1281e\', \'multiverseId\': 530045}, \'multiverseid\': 530045}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgeschworener Paladin\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\n{1}{B}, {T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\\n{2}{B}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls Mana von einem Schatz ausgegeben wurde, um diese Fähigkeit zu aktivieren, erhält die Kreatur außerdem Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527651&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd2813fc-953f-4297-9d2a-548e680358a5\', \'multiverseId\': 527651}, \'multiverseid\': 527651}, {\'name\': \'Paladín renegada\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\n{1}{B}, {T}, pagar 1 vida: Crea una ficha de Tesoro.\\n{2}{B}: La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno. Si se usó maná de un Tesoro para activar esta habilidad, esa criatura también gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a788a12-68b8-4149-9134-f25cc6f35c7e\', \'multiverseId\': 527912}, \'multiverseid\': 527912}, {\'name\': \'Paladine parjure\', \'text\': "Menace\\n{1}{B}, {T}, payez 1 point de vie : Créez un jeton Trésor.\\n{2}{B} : Une créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si du mana d\'un trésor a été dépensé pour activer cette capacité, cette créature acquiert aussi le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faabe1d9-8a79-4ae1-8464-e98406d43900\', \'multiverseId\': 528173}, \'multiverseid\': 528173}, {\'name\': \'Paladina Rinnegata\', \'text\': \'Minacciare\\n{1}{B}, {T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Crea una pedina Tesoro.\\n{2}{B}: Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno. Se è stato speso mana da un Tesoro per attivare questa abilità, quella creatura ha anche tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97f7a2a7-4db8-433e-821c-8a0c7ca7b632\', \'multiverseId\': 528434}, \'multiverseid\': 528434}, {\'name\': \'偽りのパラディン\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n{1}{B}, {T}, １点のライフを支払う：宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n{2}{B}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。この能力を起動するために宝物からのマナが支払われていたなら、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは接死も得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'440547cc-2852-4617-82ce-f5be58f3659c\', \'multiverseId\': 528695}, \'multiverseid\': 528695}, {\'name\': \'단념한 성기사\', \'text\': \'호전적\\n{1}{B}, {T}, 생명 1점을 지불한다: 보물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{2}{B}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다. 이 능력을 활성화하는 데 보물로 생성한 마나가 지불되었다면, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 치명타도 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da6ba685-0aca-49b9-9336-940a94c399bc\', \'multiverseId\': 528955}, \'multiverseid\': 528955}, {\'name\': \'Paladina Perjura\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\n{1}{B}, {T}, pague 1 ponto de vida: Crie uma ficha de Tesouro.\\n{2}{B}: A criatura alvo recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno. Se o mana de um Tesouro foi gasto para ativar esta habilidade, aquela criatura também ganha toque mortífero até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25d23c30-c85d-45ef-80d4-f75385fd0505\', \'multiverseId\': 529216}, \'multiverseid\': 529216}, {\'name\': \'Поклявшийся Паладин\', \'text\': \'Угроза\\n{1}{B}, {T}, заплатите 1 жизнь: создайте одну фишку Клада.\\n{2}{B}: целевое существо получает +2/+0 до конца хода. Если на активацию этой способности была потрачена мана от Клада, то существо также получает Смертельное касание до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5071c92a-d0f4-4a8d-864c-616e8dd150ab\', \'multiverseId\': 529477}, \'multiverseid\': 529477}, {\'name\': \'弃誓圣武士\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n{1}{B}，{T}，支付1点生命：派出一个珍宝衍生物。\\n{2}{B}：目标生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。如果起动此异能时支付过来自珍宝的法术力，则该生物再获得死触异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f26b29fe-f05d-40fc-a298-a8de9c420aad\', \'multiverseId\': 529737}, \'multiverseid\': 529737}, {\'name\': \'棄誓聖武士\', \'text\': \'威懾\\n{1}{B}，{T}，支付1點生命：派出一個珍寶衍生物。\\n{2}{B}：目標生物得+2/+0直到回合結束。如果起動此異能時支付過來自珍寶的魔法力，則該生物再獲得死觸異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7abeaa69-06cd-4e1a-8210-801c5f6264e2\', \'multiverseId\': 529997}, \'multiverseid\': 529997}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgeschworener Paladin\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\n{1}{B}, {T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\\n{2}{B}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls Mana von einem Schatz ausgegeben wurde, um diese Fähigkeit zu aktivieren, erhält die Kreatur außerdem Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33cb339f-0534-420d-9624-f076836b0bc8\', \'multiverseId\': 530533}, \'multiverseid\': 530533}, {\'name\': \'Paladín renegada\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\n{1}{B}, {T}, pagar 1 vida: Crea una ficha de Tesoro.\\n{2}{B}: La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno. Si se usó maná de un Tesoro para activar esta habilidad, esa criatura también gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f413a1d-dee0-4dd8-b131-b8ed2536754f\', \'multiverseId\': 530570}, \'multiverseid\': 530570}, {\'name\': \'Paladine parjure\', \'text\': "Menace\\n{1}{B}, {T}, payez 1 point de vie : Créez un jeton Trésor.\\n{2}{B} : Une créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si du mana d\'un trésor a été dépensé pour activer cette capacité, cette créature acquiert aussi le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530607&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'723f3d93-dfa5-48a8-8365-f6eaaf633c34\', \'multiverseId\': 530607}, \'multiverseid\': 530607}, {\'name\': \'Paladina Rinnegata\', \'text\': \'Minacciare\\n{1}{B}, {T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Crea una pedina Tesoro.\\n{2}{B}: Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno. Se è stato speso mana da un Tesoro per attivare questa abilità, quella creatura ha anche tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06bbcbbc-91ad-498c-89e3-144153a3b5df\', \'multiverseId\': 530644}, \'multiverseid\': 530644}, {\'name\': \'偽りのパラディン\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n{1}{B}, {T}, １点のライフを支払う：宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n{2}{B}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。この能力を起動するために宝物からのマナが支払われたなら、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは接死も得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b29f131-f3a3-448b-9dc7-86fd15979b42\', \'multiverseId\': 530681}, \'multiverseid\': 530681}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abkürzungssucher\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Abkürzungssucher einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, wage dich ins Gewölbe. (Betritt den ersten Raum oder rücke in den nächsten Raum vor.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ah, der alte Trick mit der Falltür unter dem Teppich. Das ist schon fast zu einfach."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527620&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c8497e2-c373-4893-b952-d6b3680ebcf2\', \'multiverseId\': 527620}, \'multiverseid\': 527620}, {\'name\': \'Buscador de atajos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Buscador de atajos haga daño de combate a un jugador, adéntrate en la mazmorra. (Entra en la primera sala o avanza a la siguiente.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah, el típico truco de la trampilla debajo de una alfombra. Esto es prácticamente coser y cantar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a88a165-ce8f-472e-818b-4b49b5ee96d1\', \'multiverseId\': 527881}, \'multiverseid\': 527881}, {\'name\': \'Chercheur de raccourcis\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Chercheur de raccourcis inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, aventurez-vous dans le donjon. (Entrez dans la première pièce ou avancez jusqu\'à la pièce suivante.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Ah, le bon vieux coup de la trappe sous le tapis. C\'est presque trop facile. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528142&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95aa44cd-ba02-4c7e-94a5-17b2ef6ad4e6\', \'multiverseId\': 528142}, \'multiverseid\': 528142}, {\'name\': \'Cercatore di Scorciatoie\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Cercatore di Scorciatoie infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esplora il dungeon. (Entra nella prima stanza o avanza a quella successiva.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah, il vecchio trucchetto della botola sotto il tappeto. Fin troppo facile."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a15e7df9-d25d-4678-821d-df44a6c5e9b8\', \'multiverseId\': 528403}, \'multiverseid\': 528403}, {\'name\': \'近道探し\', \'text\': \'近道探しがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、ダンジョン探索をする。（ダンジョン探索をするとは、最初の部屋へ入るか、次の部屋へ進むことである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「ほう、古典的な『絨毯の下の隠し扉』か。簡単すぎるくらいだな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f96433f8-8995-4fe3-a811-ac22dc150714\', \'multiverseId\': 528664}, \'multiverseid\': 528664}, {\'name\': \'지름길 탐색꾼\', \'text\': \'지름길 탐색꾼이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 던전에 진입한다. (첫 번째 방에 들어가거나 다음 방으로 전진한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 도적\', \'flavor\': \'"아, 케케묵은 \\\'깔개 밑에 함정\\\' 트릭이로군. 이건 너무 쉬운데."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'195e84d8-0563-44da-9ccf-c850db03bc84\', \'multiverseId\': 528924}, \'multiverseid\': 528924}, {\'name\': \'Buscador de Atalhos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Buscador de Atalhos causar dano de combate a um jogador, aventure-se na masmorra. (Entre na primeira sala ou prossiga para a próxima.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah, o velho truque do alçapão embaixo do tapete. Tá fácil até demais."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b7da207-1fe3-44a1-96e6-8ed03c33da03\', \'multiverseId\': 529185}, \'multiverseid\': 529185}, {\'name\': \'Искатель Проходов\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Искатель Проходов наносит боевые повреждения игроку, углубитесь в подземелье. (Войдите в первую комнату или перейдите в следующую комнату.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«А, старый трюк с люком под ковром... Это слишком уж просто».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae9cbc12-8939-426d-a594-8ca668f1e280\', \'multiverseId\': 529446}, \'multiverseid\': 529446}, {\'name\': \'捷径探寻者\', \'text\': \'每当捷径探寻者对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，深入地城。（进入第一个房间，或前进至下一个房间。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「啊，『地毯下活板门』的老把戏。这个太简单了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92ce085f-98f9-4746-b895-a9890337c181\', \'multiverseId\': 529706}, \'multiverseid\': 529706}, {\'name\': \'捷徑探尋者\', \'text\': \'每當捷徑探尋者對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，深入地城。（進入第一個房間，或前進至下一個房間。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「啊，『地毯下活板門』的老把戲。這個太簡單了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ae1cb01-0c48-4deb-8d2f-7026eac91620\', \'multiverseId\': 529966}, \'multiverseid\': 529966}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abnorme Gedankenzauberin\', \'text\': \'Gedankenzauber — Wenn die Abnorme Gedankenzauberin ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof und würfle dann einen W20.\\n1—9 | Du kannst die Karte oben auf deine Bibliothek legen.\\n10—20 | Bringe die Karte auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527591&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7b86cfb-5b01-4d90-975b-74909ac9bfb2\', \'multiverseId\': 527591}, \'multiverseid\': 527591}, {\'name\': \'Hechicera de mente extraña\', \'text\': \'Conjuros psiónicos — Cuando la Hechicera de mente extraña entre al campo de batalla, elige la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo en tu cementerio y luego tira 1d20.\\n1—9 | Puedes poner esa carta en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\n10—20 | Regresa esa carta a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a266874e-2236-459c-9668-f0fdab32c93c\', \'multiverseId\': 527852}, \'multiverseid\': 527852}, {\'name\': "Ensorceleuse à l\'esprit aberrant", \'text\': "Sorts psioniques — Quand l\'Ensorceleuse à l\'esprit aberrant arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée dans votre cimetière, puis lancez un d20.\\n1—9 | Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessus de votre bibliothèque\\n10-20 | Renvoyez cette carte dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528113&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c19f4474-609f-4220-b696-1badf3ac15e2\', \'multiverseId\': 528113}, \'multiverseid\': 528113}, {\'name\': \'Stregona della Mente Aberrante\', \'text\': \'Magia Psionica — Quando la Stregona della Mente Aberrante entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio nel tuo cimitero, poi tira un d20.\\n1—9 | Puoi mettere quella carta in cima al tuo grimorio.\\n10—20 | Riprendi in mano quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a8065a1-55b2-4a51-a028-435bf773312c\', \'multiverseId\': 528374}, \'multiverseid\': 528374}, {\'name\': \'精神異常のソーサラー\', \'text\': \'サイオニック呪文 — 精神異常のソーサラーが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。１個のd20を振る。\\n１—９ | あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置いてもよい。\\n10—20 | そのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a455f3d-b813-43a3-a726-134415e90b2c\', \'multiverseId\': 528635}, \'multiverseid\': 528635}, {\'name\': \'특이한 정신 마술사\', \'text\': \'심령 주문 — 특이한 정신 마술사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드를 목표로 정한 후, 20면체를 굴린다.\\n1—9 | 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 위에 놓을 수 있다.\\n10—20 | 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 엘프 주술사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cbd56bc-67f4-4415-b9bf-78bcf55119fe\', \'multiverseId\': 528895}, \'multiverseid\': 528895}, {\'name\': \'Feiticeira da Mente Aberrante\', \'text\': \'Magias psiônicas — Quando Feiticeira da Mente Aberrante entrar no campo de batalha, escolha o card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo em seu cemitério e depois role um d20.\\n1—9 | Você pode colocar aquele card no topo de seu grimório.\\n10—20 | Devolva aquele card para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1816a5b1-7d6c-48f4-b4e4-caf2360e805c\', \'multiverseId\': 529156}, \'multiverseid\': 529156}, {\'name\': \'Чародейка Отклоняющегося Разума\', \'text\': \'Псионические заклинания — Когда Чародейка Отклоняющегося Разума выходит на поле битвы, выберите целевую карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства на вашем кладбище, затем бросьте d20.\\n1—9 | Вы можете положить ту карту на верх вашей библиотеки.\\n10—20 | Верните ту карту в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Эльф Шаман\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0bb5460-4f15-4e19-977c-9c367ce82337\', \'multiverseId\': 529417}, \'multiverseid\': 529417}, {\'name\': \'奇异心境术士\', \'text\': \'灵能咒语～当奇异心境术士进战场时，选择目标在你坟墓场中的瞬间或法术牌，然后掷一颗d20。\\n1～9 | 你可以将该牌置于你的牌库顶。\\n10～20 | 将该牌移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／妖精／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3215c243-ba72-45e1-9808-1324a638134e\', \'multiverseId\': 529677}, \'multiverseid\': 529677}, {\'name\': \'奇異心境術士\', \'text\': \'靈能咒語～當奇異心境術士進戰場時，選擇目標在你墳墓場中的瞬間或巫術牌，然後擲一顆d20。\\n1～9 | 你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫頂。\\n10～20 | 將該牌移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／妖精／祭師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c322a2ac-1ac3-4e2f-9128-f117cbc0ccf2\', \'multiverseId\': 529937}, \'multiverseid\': 529937}]', '[{\'name\': \'Absturz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Der giftige Odem des Drachen ließ den Wald welken. Das Pfeifen von hundert Pfeilen erfüllte die Luft. Der Boden erzitterte wie bei einem Erdbeben. Der Tyrann stürzte vom Himmel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527746&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11d91a7a-393e-442f-a26f-1908ffe8fb1e\', \'multiverseId\': 527746}, \'multiverseid\': 527746}, {\'name\': \'En picado\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El aliento tóxico del dragón secó el bosque. El silbido de cientos de flechas resonó en el aire. El suelo se agitó como si lo sacudiese un terremoto. El tirano cayó del cielo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4fad86d-bcc3-4b51-81d2-3745439b50c9\', \'multiverseId\': 528007}, \'multiverseid\': 528007}, {\'name\': \'Tomber à pic\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec le vol ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le souffle nocif du dragon flétrit la forêt. Le sifflement de cent flèches emplit l\'air. Le sol trembla comme secoué par un séisme. Le tyran tomba du ciel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528268&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'691f0a2f-3b2d-4eff-8dd8-1bd4b98e71ee\', \'multiverseId\': 528268}, \'multiverseid\': 528268}, {\'name\': \'Cadere a Picco\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Il soffio nocivo del drago avvizzì la foresta. Il fischio di cento frecce riempì l\'aria. La terra tremò come colpita da un terremoto. Il tiranno cadde dal cielo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b74d6279-2cc2-4cc0-b8e5-42c59595e068\', \'multiverseId\': 528529}, \'multiverseid\': 528529}, {\'name\': \'垂直落下\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ドラゴンの有毒なブレスが森を枯らす。空を切る数百の矢の音が響き渡る。地震に揺らされたように地面が乱動する。暴君が宙から墜ちたのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a409b92-cb74-42da-9356-0056ecc3bb04\', \'multiverseId\': 528790}, \'multiverseid\': 528790}, {\'name\': \'급추락\', \'text\': \'비행을 가진 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'용의 유독한 숨결이 숲을 시들게 했다. 수백 발의 화살 소리가 허공을 울렸다. 땅바닥은 마치 지진이 일어난 것처럼 들썩거렸다. 폭군이 하늘에서 추락했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9aea5fc7-840b-4284-ab0f-452989456075\', \'multiverseId\': 529050}, \'multiverseid\': 529050}, {\'name\': \'Tombar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O sopro nóxio do dragão fez definhar a floresta. O sibilo de cem flechas encheu o ar. O chão oscilou como se abalado por um terremoto. O tirano caiu do céu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b42b6092-78d9-4902-97c5-679d31d9c37a\', \'multiverseId\': 529311}, \'multiverseid\': 529311}, {\'name\': \'Стремительное Падение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'От ядовитого дыхания дракона высох лес. В воздухе свистели сотни стрел, а земля дрожала, будто от землетрясения. Тиран рухнул с неба.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b571cbe7-0d0b-4827-9398-1781df05f516\', \'multiverseId\': 529572}, \'multiverseid\': 529572}, {\'name\': \'铅直落下\', \'text\': \'消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'巨龙毒息焦炙树林。箭支成百呼啸天空。震波轰响传遍大地。天际暴君已然坠落。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d9146bd-7c6a-4fb3-8a8e-d10155903124\', \'multiverseId\': 529832}, \'multiverseid\': 529832}, {\'name\': \'鉛直落下\', \'text\': \'消滅目標具飛行異能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'巨龍毒息焦炙樹林。箭支成百呼嘯天空。震波轟響傳遍大地。天際暴君已然墜落。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbf37428-b3fb-4d13-bb53-46bb1938a273\', \'multiverseId\': 530092}, \'multiverseid\': 530092}]', '[{\'name\': \'Acererak der Erzlich\', \'text\': \'Wenn Acererak der Erzlich ins Spiel kommt und falls du das Grabmal der Vernichtung nicht absolviert hast, bringe Acererak den Erzlich auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück und wage dich ins Gewölbe.\\nImmer wenn Acererak der Erzlich angreift, erzeugst du für jeden Gegner einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein, es sei denn, jener Spieler opfert eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zombie, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527634&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b09d07ba-930b-4c28-9f8a-f413c5831a00\', \'multiverseId\': 527634}, \'multiverseid\': 527634}, {\'name\': \'Acererak, el Archiliche\', \'text\': \'Cuando Acererak, el Archiliche entre al campo de batalla, si no completaste La Tumba de la Aniquilación, regresa a Acererak, el Archiliche a la mano de su propietario y adéntrate en la mazmorra.\\nSiempre que Acererak, el Archiliche ataque, por cada oponente, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2 a menos que ese jugador sacrifique una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'400c2458-c79f-4ca1-a406-fe120ec1951c\', \'multiverseId\': 527895}, \'multiverseid\': 527895}, {\'name\': "Acérérak l\'archiliche", \'text\': "Quand Acérérak l\'archiliche arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous n\'avez pas terminé la Tombe de l\'annihilation, renvoyez Acérérak l\'archiliche dans la main de son propriétaire et aventurez-vous dans le donjon.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Acérérak l\'archiliche attaque, pour chaque adversaire, vous créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie à moins que ce joueur ne sacrifie une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : zombie et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528156&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06242abc-aa39-4c15-a293-932dbe214ac2\', \'multiverseId\': 528156}, \'multiverseid\': 528156}, {\'name\': "Acererak l\'Arcilich", \'text\': "Quando Acererak l\'Arcilich entra nel campo di battaglia, se non hai completato la Tomba dell\'Annientamento, fai tornare Acererak l\'Arcilich in mano al suo proprietario ed esplora il dungeon.\\nOgniqualvolta Acererak l\'Arcilich attacca, per ogni avversario, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera a meno che quel giocatore non sacrifichi una creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'803ac20f-7fbd-4d7c-9d4c-618c2a14a53f\', \'multiverseId\': 528417}, \'multiverseid\': 528417}, {\'name\': \'アーチリッチ、アサーラック\', \'text\': \'アーチリッチ、アサーラックが戦場に出たとき、あなたが魂を喰らう墓を踏破していない場合、アーチリッチ、アサーラックをオーナーの手札に戻し、ダンジョン探索をする。\\nアーチリッチ、アサーラックが攻撃するたび、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げないかぎり、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゾンビ・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f52a5af-7146-49f7-8bff-1611e24664bb\', \'multiverseId\': 528678}, \'multiverseid\': 528678}, {\'name\': \'대 리치 에이서리락\', \'text\': \'대 리치 에이서리락이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 전멸의 무덤을 완료하지 않았다면, 대 리치 에이서리락을 소유자의 손으로 되돌리고 던전에 진입한다.\\n대 리치 에이서리락이 공격할 때마다, 각 상대마다, 그 플레이어가 생물 한 개를 희생하지 않는 한 당신은 2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 좀비 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64fc7460-6969-4488-b6be-7c20ca7d9e63\', \'multiverseId\': 528938}, \'multiverseid\': 528938}, {\'name\': \'Acererak, o Arquilich\', \'text\': \'Quando Acererak, o Arquilich, entrar no campo de batalha, se você não completou a Tumba da Aniquilação, devolva Acererak, o Arquilich, para a mão de seu dono e aventure-se na masmorra.\\nToda vez que Acererak, o Arquilich, ataca, para cada oponente, você cria uma ficha de criatura Zumbi preta 2/2, a menos que aquele jogador sacrifique uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Zumbi Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bfd2ae7-47f4-48e4-9b0f-5244f1bfa53e\', \'multiverseId\': 529199}, \'multiverseid\': 529199}, {\'name\': \'Архилич Асерерак\', \'text\': \'Когда Архилич Асерерак выходит на поле битвы, если вы не прошли Гробницу Истребления, верните Архилича Асерерака в руку его владельца и углубитесь в подземелье.\\nКаждый раз, когда Архилич Асерерак атакует, за каждого оппонента создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби, если тот игрок не пожертвует существо.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Зомби Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abff8086-1a0e-40f3-be34-4f32add07c37\', \'multiverseId\': 529460}, \'multiverseid\': 529460}, {\'name\': \'高阶巫妖阿瑟瑞拉克\', \'text\': \'当高阶巫妖阿瑟瑞拉克进战场时，若你未曾完成湮灭之墓，则将高阶巫妖阿瑟瑞拉克移回其拥有者手上并深入地城。\\n每当高阶巫妖阿瑟瑞拉克攻击时，对每位对手而言，除非该牌手牺牲一个生物，否则你派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～灵俑／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ca14c44-a2dc-4f03-b04b-1181c82dfdcb\', \'multiverseId\': 529720}, \'multiverseid\': 529720}, {\'name\': \'高階巫妖阿瑟瑞拉克\', \'text\': \'當高階巫妖阿瑟瑞拉克進戰場時，若你未曾完成湮滅之墓，則將高階巫妖阿瑟瑞拉克移回其擁有者手上並深入地城。\\n每當高階巫妖阿瑟瑞拉克攻擊時，對每位對手而言，除非該玩家犧牲一個生物，否則你派出一個2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～殭屍／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3383eca6-5bf3-4c3a-85b9-5adbfc0f04a3\', \'multiverseId\': 529980}, \'multiverseid\': 529980}]', '[{\'name\': \'Acererak der Erzlich\', \'text\': \'Wenn Acererak der Erzlich ins Spiel kommt und falls du das Grabmal der Vernichtung nicht absolviert hast, bringe Acererak den Erzlich auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück und wage dich ins Gewölbe.\\nImmer wenn Acererak der Erzlich angreift, erzeugst du für jeden Gegner einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein, es sei denn, jener Spieler opfert eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zombie, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530530&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'492d963f-f4cd-4ec8-86f4-2518f62c94bf\', \'multiverseId\': 530530}, \'multiverseid\': 530530}, {\'name\': \'Acererak, el Archiliche\', \'text\': \'Cuando Acererak, el Archiliche entre al campo de batalla, si no completaste La Tumba de la Aniquilación, regresa a Acererak, el Archiliche a la mano de su propietario y adéntrate en la mazmorra.\\nSiempre que Acererak, el Archiliche ataque, por cada oponente, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2 a menos que ese jugador sacrifique una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a1b013c-fb80-4f80-8338-6f8052fa1b0e\', \'multiverseId\': 530567}, \'multiverseid\': 530567}, {\'name\': "Acérérak l\'archiliche", \'text\': "Quand Acérérak l\'archiliche arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous n\'avez pas terminé la Tombe de l\'annihilation, renvoyez Acérérak l\'archiliche dans la main de son propriétaire et aventurez-vous dans le donjon.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Acérérak l\'archiliche attaque, pour chaque adversaire, vous créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie à moins que ce joueur ne sacrifie une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : zombie et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530604&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a699bc77-5180-4a3a-addb-342eac6a74d8\', \'multiverseId\': 530604}, \'multiverseid\': 530604}, {\'name\': "Acererak l\'Arcilich", \'text\': "Quando Acererak l\'Arcilich entra nel campo di battaglia, se non hai completato la Tomba dell\'Annientamento, fai tornare Acererak l\'Arcilich in mano al suo proprietario ed esplora il dungeon.\\nOgniqualvolta Acererak l\'Arcilich attacca, per ogni avversario, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera a meno che quel giocatore non sacrifichi una creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83e26881-05f8-491a-a651-fd835653c164\', \'multiverseId\': 530641}, \'multiverseid\': 530641}, {\'name\': \'アーチリッチ、アサーラック\', \'text\': \'アーチリッチ、アサーラックが戦場に出たとき、魂を喰らう墓を踏破していない場合、アーチリッチ、アサーラックをオーナーの手札に戻し、ダンジョン探索をする。\\nアーチリッチ、アサーラックが攻撃するたび、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げないかぎり、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゾンビ・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa6dce6f-e459-49f6-be0a-20640e6abd63\', \'multiverseId\': 530678}, \'multiverseid\': 530678}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alter Knochennager\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge entsprechend viele Schatz-Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Der uralte grüne Drache Claugiyliamatar ist häufig mit einer geschundenen Leiche im Maul zu sehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527744&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ca7e64e-39a1-4f72-9fb8-0eaff4a26a9b\', \'multiverseId\': 527744}, \'multiverseid\': 527744}, {\'name\': \'Vieja Roehuesos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'La dragona verde anciana Claugiyliamatar se suele dejar ver con un cadáver mutilado colgando de la boca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03284f3f-f6cf-4228-9c06-be29c79aa5bc\', \'multiverseId\': 528005}, \'multiverseid\': 528005}, {\'name\': \'La Vieille Ronge-os\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez autant de jetons Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon\', \'flavor\': "L\'ancêtre dragon vert Claugiyliamatar a souvent un cadavre dépecé qui pendouille de sa mâchoire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528266&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cebb5d18-2988-4c26-a6e2-fedcf418d41a\', \'multiverseId\': 528266}, \'multiverseid\': 528266}, {\'name\': \'Vecchia Mascella\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea altrettante pedine Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Drago\', \'flavor\': "L\'antico drago verde Claugiyliamatar viene spesso visto con resti di cadaveri che pendono dalla bocca.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8b7de6e-8942-4c61-85ff-fd2eaceb2754\', \'multiverseId\': 528527}, \'multiverseid\': 528527}, {\'name\': \'年老いた骨齧り\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、その点数に等しい数の宝物・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'古代のグリーン・ドラゴン、クローギリャマタールはしばしば、口から原形を留めない死体を垂れ下げているところを目撃される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc048376-7e44-48cd-8d61-1d9fed0f3875\', \'multiverseId\': 528788}, \'multiverseid\': 528788}, {\'name\': \'늙은 뼈갉기\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신이 조종하는 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 보물 토큰을 그만큼 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': \'고대의 녹색 용 클로길리아마타르는 종종 그녀의 입에 심하게 훼손된 시체를 매달고 있는 모습으로 목격된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0c62be4-758b-4807-8f78-ae0fb7802b63\', \'multiverseId\': 529048}, \'multiverseid\': 529048}, {\'name\': \'Velha Rói-osso\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie aquela quantidade de fichas de Tesouro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'A dragonesa ancestral Claugiyliamatar é vista com frequência com um cadáver dilacerado pendurado na boca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcefe75c-4953-4ce9-875d-00faac2ef3d9\', \'multiverseId\': 529309}, \'multiverseid\': 529309}, {\'name\': \'Старая Костегрызка\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем наносит боевые повреждения игроку, создайте такое же количество фишек Клада.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'Древнюю зеленую драконицу Клаугильяматар часто видят с изувеченным трупом, болтающимся в пасти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'471b3a72-2bfb-4597-ba28-08d5ef785002\', \'multiverseId\': 529570}, \'multiverseid\': 529570}, {\'name\': \'老啮骨\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一个由你操控的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出等量的珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'远古绿龙克劳吉丽娅玛塔经常被人看到嘴边挂着尸体碎片。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'740eedf2-84d9-4c12-8f5d-38afe69b8e87\', \'multiverseId\': 529830}, \'multiverseid\': 529830}, {\'name\': \'老嚙骨\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當一個由你操控的生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，派出等量的珍寶衍生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'遠古綠龍克勞吉麗婭瑪塔經常被人看到嘴邊掛著屍體碎片。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9770544-d1dd-4a2b-8a5f-f360f241a96e\', \'multiverseId\': 530090}, \'multiverseid\': 530090}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alter Knochennager\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge entsprechend viele Schatz-Spielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530723&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61f5cc6f-aea3-4788-ae9e-689c987e9166\', \'multiverseId\': 530723}, \'multiverseid\': 530723}, {\'name\': \'Vieja Roehuesos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c4c173e-c28a-4818-beea-1a40e04cb6e5\', \'multiverseId\': 530735}, \'multiverseid\': 530735}, {\'name\': \'La Vieille Ronge-os\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez autant de jetons Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530747&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c935f4d-fad4-48ed-a3ec-72ffbda45952\', \'multiverseId\': 530747}, \'multiverseid\': 530747}, {\'name\': \'Vecchia Mascella\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea altrettante pedine Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06668def-81f7-4d0f-81b6-9887fa7f622a\', \'multiverseId\': 530759}, \'multiverseid\': 530759}, {\'name\': \'年老いた骨齧り\', \'text\': \'飛行、\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、その点数に等しい数の宝物・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cace7415-6540-456f-abd0-252cb1d506c3\', \'multiverseId\': 530771}, \'multiverseid\': 530771}, {\'name\': \'늙은 뼈갉기\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신이 조종하는 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 보물 토큰을 그만큼 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd9be05-b696-4b48-a05e-b68d1ccf3be6\', \'multiverseId\': 530783}, \'multiverseid\': 530783}, {\'name\': \'Velha Rói-osso\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie aquela quantidade de fichas de Tesouro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850a678a-9411-4361-90b4-ed5c95a403a7\', \'multiverseId\': 530795}, \'multiverseid\': 530795}, {\'name\': \'Старая Костегрызка\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем наносит боевые повреждения игроку, создайте такое же количество фишек Клада.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0465b928-0adc-45b0-b97f-5508406e66fe\', \'multiverseId\': 530807}, \'multiverseid\': 530807}, {\'name\': \'老啮骨\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一个由你操控的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出等量的珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4248dd1d-8099-47c1-9d37-6d7905291255\', \'multiverseId\': 530819}, \'multiverseid\': 530819}, {\'name\': \'老嚙骨\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當一個由你操控的生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，派出等量的珍寶衍生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61d6df97-a2bd-4916-87f8-7ea95d25829d\', \'multiverseId\': 530831}, \'multiverseid\': 530831}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angeheuerte Fluchklinge\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Angeheuerte Fluchklinge ins Spiel kommt und falls Mana von einem Schatz ausgegeben wurde, um sie zu wirken, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kümmere mich darum. Denk du nur daran, deinen Teil der Abmachung zu erfüllen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527656&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8101f498-b187-4377-be52-caed6ad6617a\', \'multiverseId\': 527656}, \'multiverseid\': 527656}, {\'name\': \'Filo maléfico a sueldo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Filo maléfico a sueldo entre al campo de batalla, si se usó maná de un Tesoro para lanzarlo, robas una carta y pierdes 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo me ocupo. Tú asegúrate de cumplir tu parte del trato".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5db3488a-1201-4431-8d91-65228fa3ed8b\', \'multiverseId\': 527917}, \'multiverseid\': 527917}, {\'name\': \'Tourmenteur à gages\', \'text\': "Quand le Tourmenteur à gages arrive sur le champ de bataille, si du mana d\'un trésor a été dépensé pour le lancer, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': "« Je vais m\'en occuper. Mais assurez-vous de tenir votre part du marché. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528178&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7546efc9-354c-4260-88dc-3fcbc38c2832\', \'multiverseId\': 528178}, \'multiverseid\': 528178}, {\'name\': \'Lama del Sortilegio Mercenaria\', \'text\': \'Quando la Lama del Sortilegio Mercenaria entra nel campo di battaglia, se è stato speso mana da un Tesoro per lanciarla, peschi una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci penso io. Ma ricorda di rispettare la tua parte dell\\\'accordo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5dbafb4-386a-4c2b-88cd-c2069ada1379\', \'multiverseId\': 528439}, \'multiverseid\': 528439}, {\'name\': \'雇われた魔剣士\', \'text\': \'雇われた魔剣士が戦場に出たとき、これを唱えるために宝物からのマナが支払われていた場合、あなたはカード１枚を引き、１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「任せてくれ。その代わり、取り引きは守ってくれよ？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b10bd733-cdf4-441a-946b-3e972712beb9\', \'multiverseId\': 528700}, \'multiverseid\': 528700}, {\'name\': \'고용된 저주검\', \'text\': \'고용된 저주검이 전장에 들어올 때, 고용된 저주검을 발동하는 데 보물로 생성된 마나가 지불되었다면, 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑고 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 흑마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"그건 내가 맡지. 넌 네가 맡은 일이나 잘 챙기라고."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e45eea2e-9a44-48c1-bf32-7c62cabdbb86\', \'multiverseId\': 528960}, \'multiverseid\': 528960}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina Maldita de Aluguel\', \'text\': \'Quando Lâmina Maldita de Aluguel entra no campo de batalha, se o mana de um Tesouro foi gasto para conjurá-lo, você compra um card e perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Bruxo\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu cuido disso. Só não deixe de cumprir sua parte do acordo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'394a60c3-92c5-4e74-8d0c-77deeef92d0d\', \'multiverseId\': 529221}, \'multiverseid\': 529221}, {\'name\': \'Наемный Колдовской Клинок\', \'text\': \'Когда Наемный Колдовской Клинок выходит на поле битвы, если на его разыгрывание была потрачена мана от Клада, вы берете карту и теряете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Колдун\', \'flavor\': \'«Я с этим разберусь. Ты, главное, выполни свою часть сделки».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52ba41a5-d56a-4070-ba06-9c2f1af7ffd5\', \'multiverseId\': 529482}, \'multiverseid\': 529482}, {\'name\': \'受雇咒剑士\', \'text\': \'当受雇咒剑士进战场时，若施放它时支付过来自珍宝的法术力，则你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我会处理好这件事。你只管准备好你要付的那部分。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'666d8800-a3d9-4a8d-a499-8153125cfa40\', \'multiverseId\': 529742}, \'multiverseid\': 529742}, {\'name\': \'受雇咒劍士\', \'text\': \'當受雇咒劍士進戰場時，若施放它時支付過來自珍寶的魔法力，則你抽一張牌且失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「我會處理好這件事。你只管準備好你要付的那部分。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa150e73-fbcc-4914-9811-6ec8aef4ce52\', \'multiverseId\': 530002}, \'multiverseid\': 530002}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arborea-Pegasus\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Arborea-Pegasus ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +1/+1 und Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pegasus\', \'flavor\': \'Die edlen Reittiere der elfischen Götter lassen sich manchmal überreden, bloße Sterbliche auf ihren Rücken zu akzeptieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527549&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a93b6758-a483-42bc-8edc-b9a708fa7104\', \'multiverseId\': 527549}, \'multiverseid\': 527549}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso de Arbórea\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Pegaso de Arbórea entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': \'En ocasiones, los meros mortales pueden persuadir a los nobles corceles de los dioses élficos para montar en sus lomos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f50bd7b-7e65-4b3a-8e34-592573916fe9\', \'multiverseId\': 527810}, \'multiverseid\': 527810}, {\'name\': "Pégase d\'Arborée", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Pégase d\'Arborée arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 et acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : pégase\', \'flavor\': \'Les nobles destriers des dieux elfes peuvent parfois être persuadés de se laisser monter par de simples mortels.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528071&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43ced358-fefa-450c-8370-7038fb9fc6f5\', \'multiverseId\': 528071}, \'multiverseid\': 528071}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso di Arborea\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Pegaso di Arborea entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 e ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': \'I nobili destrieri delle divinità elfiche possono talvolta accettare di essere cavalcati da semplici mortali.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf9b3e9d-e6b1-4953-a7bb-501c76c12e77\', \'multiverseId\': 528332}, \'multiverseid\': 528332}, {\'name\': \'アルボレーアのペガサス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nアルボレーアのペガサスが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受け飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ペガサス\', \'flavor\': \'エルフの神々の神聖なる馬は、場合によっては定命の者も乗せることを許す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eda7a39-dd80-4fcc-b077-c47bba65d2df\', \'multiverseId\': 528593}, \'multiverseid\': 528593}, {\'name\': \'아르보레아 페가수스\', \'text\': \'비행\\n아르보레아 페가수스가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 비행을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 페가수스\', \'flavor\': \'엘프 신들의 고귀한 군마는 때때로 등에 필멸자들을 태우도록 설득되기도 한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeee7573-fe59-4660-891e-5f4d1025412c\', \'multiverseId\': 528853}, \'multiverseid\': 528853}, {\'name\': \'Pégaso de Arbórea\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Pégaso de Arbórea entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 e ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pégaso\', \'flavor\': \'Algumas vezes é possível convencer os nobres corcéis das divindades élficas a cavalgar com os simples mortais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e8825c4-6116-4011-b55c-b440e1c521e6\', \'multiverseId\': 529114}, \'multiverseid\': 529114}, {\'name\': \'Пегас из Арбореи\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Пегас из Арбореи выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо получает +1/+1 и Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пегас\', \'flavor\': \'Благородных скакунов эльфийских богов порой можно убедить пустить себе на спину простого смертного.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0f7d980-0d26-416e-b926-96a75fbd8e3a\', \'multiverseId\': 529375}, \'multiverseid\': 529375}, {\'name\': \'奥林界飞马\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当奥林界飞马进战场时，直到回合结束，目标生物得+1/+1且获得飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～飞马\', \'flavor\': \'有时你甚至能说服精灵诸神的尊贵坐骑，让它们允许一介凡人骑上背端。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29914873-6d90-4ac9-af74-b2d8dacd08d4\', \'multiverseId\': 529635}, \'multiverseid\': 529635}, {\'name\': \'奧林界飛馬\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當奧林界飛馬進戰場時，直到回合結束，目標生物得+1/+1且獲得飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～飛馬\', \'flavor\': \'有時你甚至能說服精靈諸神的尊貴坐騎，讓牠們允許一介凡人騎上背端。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e8a74d8-a765-4dfc-996e-848e428aaebf\', \'multiverseId\': 529895}, \'multiverseid\': 529895}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arborea-Pegasus\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Arborea-Pegasus ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +1/+1 und Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pegasus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530984&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b957115d-80b5-4ddd-bac9-2f50cce0823c\', \'multiverseId\': 530984}, \'multiverseid\': 530984}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso de Arbórea\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Pegaso de Arbórea entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8e97287-7c13-426a-9253-e69c094aa815\', \'multiverseId\': 531035}, \'multiverseid\': 531035}, {\'name\': "Pégase d\'Arborée", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Pégase d\'Arborée arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 et acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : pégase\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531086&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8415484c-097c-4ed6-841b-3b74efd596a5\', \'multiverseId\': 531086}, \'multiverseid\': 531086}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso di Arborea\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Pegaso di Arborea entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 e ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d42c318f-cf75-4fb7-8454-71b7f4d8c56f\', \'multiverseId\': 531137}, \'multiverseid\': 531137}, {\'name\': \'アルボレーアのペガサス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nアルボレーアのペガサスが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ペガサス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cede3a4d-24cf-4fe0-b038-d982125301fa\', \'multiverseId\': 531188}, \'multiverseid\': 531188}, {\'name\': \'아르보레아 페가수스\', \'text\': \'비행\\n아르보레아 페가수스가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 비행을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 페가수스\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddd98ae8-e59e-43ed-b11a-59c467ad7a52\', \'multiverseId\': 531239}, \'multiverseid\': 531239}, {\'name\': \'Pégaso de Arbórea\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Pégaso de Arbórea entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 e ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pégaso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f33aad3-0655-4fc3-acb7-a95a0b509e01\', \'multiverseId\': 531290}, \'multiverseid\': 531290}, {\'name\': \'Пегас из Арбореи\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Пегас из Арбореи выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо получает +1/+1 и Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пегас\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b8b42d-798b-48ba-84a8-b03db34a1d3b\', \'multiverseId\': 531341}, \'multiverseid\': 531341}, {\'name\': \'奥林界飞马\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当奥林界飞马进战场时，直到回合结束，目标生物得+1/+1且获得飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～飞马\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22c15b1b-9ea9-43a6-9b8d-8f060d39e771\', \'multiverseId\': 531392}, \'multiverseid\': 531392}, {\'name\': \'奧林界飛馬\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當奧林界飛馬進戰場時，直到回合結束，目標生物得+1/+1且獲得飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～飛馬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d67c87c-4d88-4ae4-8537-c8aa58353dde\', \'multiverseId\': 531443}, \'multiverseid\': 531443}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkaner Ermittler\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche den Raum — {5}{U}: Würfle einen W20.\\n1—9 | Ziehe eine Karte.\\n10—20 | Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527593&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'801211e4-03e7-4275-88f1-b82c921cb58e\', \'multiverseId\': 527593}, \'multiverseid\': 527593}, {\'name\': \'Investigador arcano\', \'text\': \'Registrar la sala — {5}{U}: Tira 1d20.\\n1—9 | Roba una carta.\\n10—20 | Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d06528dd-a473-47f4-8d8d-d2b3bc606ca2\', \'multiverseId\': 527854}, \'multiverseid\': 527854}, {\'name\': \'Enquêteur arcanique\', \'text\': "Fouille de la pièce — {5}{U} : Lancez un d20.\\n1—9 | Piochez une carte.\\n10—20 | Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528115&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c68090e-f05b-4277-b77c-eba089ce7489\', \'multiverseId\': 528115}, \'multiverseid\': 528115}, {\'name\': \'Investigatore Arcano\', \'text\': \'Perlustra la Stanza — {5}{U}: Tira un d20.\\n1—9 | Pesca una carta.\\n10—20 | Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine una alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0486758d-f0b0-4922-9b52-80ca77b6b194\', \'multiverseId\': 528376}, \'multiverseid\': 528376}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の調査員\', \'text\': \'部屋を捜索する — {5}{U}：１個のd20を振る。\\n１—９ | カード１枚を引く。\\n10—20 | あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2a2d871-4f27-4300-a467-7df95b6488e8\', \'multiverseId\': 528637}, \'multiverseid\': 528637}, {\'name\': \'비전 수사관\', \'text\': \'방 수색 — {5}{U}: 20면체를 굴린다.\\n1—9 | 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n10—20 | 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 그중 한 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 원하는 순서로 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f563762-da6f-4d14-ae9a-587c39ba80c7\', \'multiverseId\': 528897}, \'multiverseid\': 528897}, {\'name\': \'Investigador Arcano\', \'text\': \'Vasculhar a sala — {5}{U}: Role um D20.\\n1—9 | Compre um card.\\n10—20 | Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um deles na sua mão e os restantes no fundo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eb59b9c-fd9e-4775-950c-73d34a63d6da\', \'multiverseId\': 529158}, \'multiverseid\': 529158}, {\'name\': \'Волшебный Дознаватель\', \'text\': \'Обыскать помещение — {5}{U}: бросьте d20.\\n1—9 | Возьмите карту.\\n10—20 | Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из них в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aea3dd0-5305-455a-a347-89a78398987d\', \'multiverseId\': 529419}, \'multiverseid\': 529419}, {\'name\': \'秘法调查专家\', \'text\': \'搜索房间～{5}{U}：掷一颗d20。\\n1～9 | 抓一张牌。\\n10～20 | 检视你牌库顶的三张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，其余的牌则以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'125395a6-873f-4073-aa88-968edd6b719c\', \'multiverseId\': 529679}, \'multiverseid\': 529679}, {\'name\': \'秘法調查專家\', \'text\': \'搜索房間～{5}{U}：擲一顆d20。\\n1～9 | 抽一張牌。\\n10～20 | 檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。將其中一張置於你手上，其餘的牌則以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83f1a27e-f7cc-4ada-b8f8-61b4887929df\', \'multiverseId\': 529939}, \'multiverseid\': 529939}]', '[{\'name\': \'Asmodeus der Erzunhold\', \'text\': \'Bindender Vertrag — Falls du eine Karte ziehen würdest, schicke stattdessen die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek verdeckt ins Exil.\\n{B}{B}{B}: Ziehe sieben Karten.\\n{B}: Bringe alle Karten, die von Asmodeus dem Erzunhold ins Exil geschickt wurden, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück. Du verlierst entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Teufel, Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527635&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d7957f1-1ad2-43a8-bc49-6dac2f98efc5\', \'multiverseId\': 527635}, \'multiverseid\': 527635}, {\'name\': \'Asmodeo, el Archinfernal\', \'text\': \'Contrato vinculante — Si fueras a robar una carta, en vez de eso, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca boca abajo.\\n{B}{B}{B}: Roba siete cartas.\\n{B}: Regresa todas las cartas exiliadas con Asmodeo, el Archinfernal a la mano de su propietario y pierdes esa misma cantidad de vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Deidad diablo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'993c10e2-6167-4b67-90e8-e7e1519670ac\', \'multiverseId\': 527896}, \'multiverseid\': 527896}, {\'name\': "Asmodée l\'archifiélon", \'text\': "Pacte — Si vous deviez piocher une carte, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque face cachée à la place.\\n{B}{B}{B} : Piochez sept cartes.\\n{B} : Renvoyez toutes les cartes exilées par Asmodée, l\'archifiélon dans la main de leur propriétaire et vous perdez autant de points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : diable et dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528157&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2111e120-5260-41fa-bbe0-66743829f7e1\', \'multiverseId\': 528157}, \'multiverseid\': 528157}, {\'name\': "Asmodeus l\'Arcidiavolo", \'text\': "Contratto Vincolante — Se stai per pescare una carta, esilia invece la prima carta del tuo grimorio a faccia in giù.\\n{B}{B}{B}: Pesca sette carte.\\n{B}: Fai tornare tutte le carte esiliate con Asmodeus l\'Arcidiavolo in mano ai rispettivi proprietari e perdi altrettanti punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Diavolo Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f3b1138-ec64-4886-ab96-e36501825916\', \'multiverseId\': 528418}, \'multiverseid\': 528418}, {\'name\': \'アーチフィーンド、アスモデウス\', \'text\': \'バインディング・コントラクト — あなたがカード１枚を引くなら、代わりにライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を裏向きに追放する。\\n{B}{B}{B}：カード７枚を引く。\\n{B}：アーチフィーンド、アスモデウスによって追放されているすべてのカードをオーナーの手札に戻し、あなたはその枚数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 悪魔・神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54a70792-de10-43e4-8f1c-92b9b0cd9670\', \'multiverseId\': 528679}, \'multiverseid\': 528679}, {\'name\': \'대마귀 아스모데우스\', \'text\': \'구속력 있는 계약 — 당신이 카드를 뽑으려 한다면, 대신 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 뒷면 상태로 추방한다.\\n{B}{B}{B}: 카드 일곱 장을 뽑는다.\\n{B}: 대마귀 아스모데우스로 추방한 모든 카드를 소유자의 손으로 되돌리고 당신은 그만큼 생명점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 악령 신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b8b3439-f8c2-40a7-a0f6-4837bc46e7f2\', \'multiverseId\': 528939}, \'multiverseid\': 528939}, {\'name\': \'Asmodeus, o Arquidemônio\', \'text\': \'Contrato vinculante — Se você compraria um card, em vez isso, exile o card do topo de seu grimório com a face voltada para baixo.\\n{B}{B}{B}: Compre sete cards.\\n{B}: Devolva todos os cards exilados com Asmodeus, o Arquidemônio, para as mãos de seus donos. Você perde aquela quantidade de pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Diabo Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b60f0965-a16d-462c-8b5b-150f0a12de10\', \'multiverseId\': 529200}, \'multiverseid\': 529200}, {\'name\': \'Архидемон Асмодей\', \'text\': \'Нерушимый договор — Если вы должны взять карту, вместо этого изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки рубашкой вверх.\\n{B}{B}{B}: возьмите семь карт.\\n{B}: верните все изгнанные Архидемоном Асмодеем карты в руки их владельцев, и вы теряете такое же количество жизней.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Дьявол Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9be5f849-cbaa-4861-acd6-6e7e619e2482\', \'multiverseId\': 529461}, \'multiverseid\': 529461}, {\'name\': \'魔王阿斯摩蒂尔斯\', \'text\': \'魔鬼契约～如果你将抓一张牌，改为牌面朝下地放逐你的牌库顶牌。\\n{B}{B}{B}：抓七张牌。\\n{B}：将所有以魔王阿斯摩蒂尔斯放逐的牌移回其拥有者手上，且你失去等量的生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～魔鬼／神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a89c9430-aa72-4872-bb49-b575efc12d89\', \'multiverseId\': 529721}, \'multiverseid\': 529721}, {\'name\': \'魔王阿斯摩蒂爾斯\', \'text\': \'魔鬼契約～如果你將抽一張牌，改為牌面朝下地放逐你的牌庫頂牌。\\n{B}{B}{B}：抽七張牌。\\n{B}：將所有以魔王阿斯摩蒂爾斯放逐的牌移回其擁有者手上，且你失去等量的生命。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～魔鬼／神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c700d95-a621-42e0-bf28-b858515e2448\', \'multiverseId\': 529981}, \'multiverseid\': 529981}]', '[{\'name\': \'Asmodeus der Erzunhold\', \'text\': \'Bindender Vertrag — Falls du eine Karte ziehen würdest, schicke stattdessen die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek verdeckt ins Exil.\\n{B}{B}{B}: Ziehe sieben Karten.\\n{B}: Bringe alle Karten, die von Asmodeus dem Erzunhold ins Exil geschickt wurden, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück. Du verlierst entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Teufel, Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530531&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a580d7a-da50-48d5-bc26-26cbfb75b79d\', \'multiverseId\': 530531}, \'multiverseid\': 530531}, {\'name\': \'Asmodeo, el Archinfernal\', \'text\': \'Contrato vinculante — Si fueras a robar una carta, en vez de eso, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca boca abajo.\\n{B}{B}{B}: Roba siete cartas.\\n{B}: Regresa todas las cartas exiliadas con Asmodeo, el Archinfernal a la mano de su propietario y pierdes esa misma cantidad de vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Deidad diablo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0edea8b7-39d4-467b-aec7-952836a6afc3\', \'multiverseId\': 530568}, \'multiverseid\': 530568}, {\'name\': "Asmodée l\'archifiélon", \'text\': "Pacte — Si vous deviez piocher une carte, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque face cachée à la place.\\n{B}{B}{B} : Piochez sept cartes.\\n{B} : Renvoyez toutes les cartes exilées par Asmodée, l\'archifiélon dans la main de leur propriétaire et vous perdez autant de points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : diable et dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530605&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bdf4f94-4bc7-4fc0-a691-b72ce2c74a37\', \'multiverseId\': 530605}, \'multiverseid\': 530605}, {\'name\': "Asmodeus l\'Arcidiavolo", \'text\': "Contratto Vincolante — Se stai per pescare una carta, esilia invece la prima carta del tuo grimorio a faccia in giù.\\n{B}{B}{B}: Pesca sette carte.\\n{B}: Fai tornare tutte le carte esiliate con Asmodeus l\'Arcidiavolo in mano ai rispettivi proprietari e perdi altrettanti punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Diavolo Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65bb7dd9-4537-424b-a882-992a99eacb10\', \'multiverseId\': 530642}, \'multiverseid\': 530642}, {\'name\': \'アーチフィーンド、アスモデウス\', \'text\': \'バインディング・コントラクト — あなたがカード１枚を引くなら、代わりにライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を裏向きに追放する。\\n{B}{B}{B}：カード７枚を引く。\\n{B}：アーチフィーンド、アスモデウスによって追放されているすべてのカードをそのオーナーの手札に戻し、あなたはその枚数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 悪魔・神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25e09e7b-f3af-4c37-9580-f6a5bfdc289d\', \'multiverseId\': 530679}, \'multiverseid\': 530679}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf Fallen prüfen\', \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl zeigt die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor. Du bestimmst davon eine Nichtland-Karte. Schicke die bestimmte Karte ins Exil. Falls auf diese Weise eine Spontanzauberkarte oder eine Karte mit Aufblitzen ins Exil geschickt wurde, verliert der Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt. Anderenfalls verlierst du 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ganz ruhig. Ich bin ein Profi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527639&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a148d090-baa0-44d8-84af-c07960f67c2a\', \'multiverseId\': 527639}, \'multiverseid\': 527639}, {\'name\': \'Buscar trampas\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo muestra su mano. Tú eliges de ahí una carta que no sea tierra. Exilia esa carta. Si una carta de instantáneo o una carta con la habilidad de destello se exilia de esta manera, tu oponente pierde 1 vida. De lo contrario, tú pierdes 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Calma. Soy una profesional".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9309d072-b032-4b88-82ab-9259b5d1fc0d\', \'multiverseId\': 527900}, \'multiverseid\': 527900}, {\'name\': \'Déceler les pièges\', \'text\': "Un adversaire ciblé révèle sa main. Vous y choisissez une carte non-terrain. Exilez cette carte. Si une carte d\'éphémère ou une carte avec le flash est exilée de cette manière, il perd 1 point de vie. Sinon, vous perdez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Détendez-vous. Laissez faire la spécialiste. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11aa96c0-3b39-43dd-948e-7438f6fe0376\', \'multiverseId\': 528161}, \'multiverseid\': 528161}, {\'name\': \'Cercare Trappole\', \'text\': "Un avversario bersaglio rivela la sua mano. Scegli una carta non terra da quella mano. Esilia quella carta. Se una carta istantaneo o una carta con lampo viene esiliata in questo modo, quell\'avversario perde 1 punto vita. Altrimenti, tu perdi 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Rilassati, sono una professionista."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c346a54b-b54c-40ed-87c1-e19a164a39e8\', \'multiverseId\': 528422}, \'multiverseid\': 528422}, {\'name\': \'罠を探す\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中から土地でないカード１枚を選び、追放する。これによりインスタント・カードや瞬速を持つカードが追放されたなら、そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失う。そうでないなら、あなたは１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「落ち着いて。私はプロフェッショナルよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9234bf04-851e-4583-92cc-79fc8406db1c\', \'multiverseId\': 528683}, \'multiverseid\': 528683}, {\'name\': \'함정 확인\', \'text\': \'상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 손을 공개한다. 그중 대지가 아닌 카드 한 장을 선택한다. 그 카드를 추방한다. 이런 식으로 순간마법 카드 또는 섬광을 가진 카드가 추방되었다면, 그 플레이어는 생명 1점을 잃는다. 그렇지 않다면, 당신은 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"진정해. 난 전문가니까."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca19a1b-90c5-4cee-b259-2a70af9e320f\', \'multiverseId\': 528943}, \'multiverseid\': 528943}, {\'name\': \'Procurar Armadilhas\', \'text\': \'O oponente alvo revela a própria mão. Você escolhe um card não de terreno da mão dele. Exile aquele card. Se um card de mágica instantânea ou um card com lampejo for exilado dessa forma, aquele jogador perde 1 ponto de vida. Caso contrário, você perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Relaxa. Eu sou uma profissional."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b4d960-c495-46b6-9a58-768f26c69040\', \'multiverseId\': 529204}, \'multiverseid\': 529204}, {\'name\': \'Поиск Ловушек\', \'text\': \'Целевой оппонент показывает свою руку. Вы выбираете из нее карту, не являющуюся землей. Изгоните ту карту. Если таким образом изгоняется карта мгновенного заклинания или карта с Мигом, тот оппонент теряет 1 жизнь. В противном случае, вы теряете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Спокойно. Я в этом деле мастерица».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b33576e-417c-4adb-b427-bdc4a3de8011\', \'multiverseId\': 529465}, \'multiverseid\': 529465}, {\'name\': \'检查陷阱\', \'text\': \'目标对手展示其手牌。你选择其中一张非地牌。放逐该牌。如果以此法放逐一张瞬间牌或一张具闪现异能的牌，则该对手失去1点生命。若否，则你失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「别紧张。我是专业的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2e24e9b-5dd6-4100-854e-b75edcc274e4\', \'multiverseId\': 529725}, \'multiverseid\': 529725}, {\'name\': \'檢查陷阱\', \'text\': \'目標對手展示其手牌。你選擇其中一張非地牌。放逐該牌。如果以此法放逐一張瞬間牌或一張具閃現異能的牌，則該對手失去1點生命。若否，則你失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「別緊張。我是專業的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c6cc9d6-6107-4e77-bd84-84591d6aa48d\', \'multiverseId\': 529985}, \'multiverseid\': 529985}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auge des Vecna\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Auge des Vecna ins Spiel kommt, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich sehe alle Dinge, wie sie wirklich sind! Ich sehe … Verfall in allem Fleisch und Verrat in jedem Herzen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527790&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'788ad4d7-5893-46a1-8502-0065a50d8e4b\', \'multiverseId\': 527790}, \'multiverseid\': 527790}, {\'name\': \'Ojo de Vecna\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ojo de Vecna entre al campo de batalla, robas una carta y pierdes 2 vidas.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, robas una carta y pierdes 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Lo veo todo como realmente es! Veo... deterioro en toda carne y traición en cada corazón".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'178ed14b-ff9b-45d7-8b03-223f2d3b7409\', \'multiverseId\': 528051}, \'multiverseid\': 528051}, {\'name\': \'Œil de Vecna\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Œil de Vecna arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 2 points de vie.\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'« Je vois les choses comme elles le sont réellement ! Je vois... la putréfaction dans toute chair et la trahison dans tous les cœurs. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528312&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94faca19-b115-4e0c-a032-b096e8bee30e\', \'multiverseId\': 528312}, \'multiverseid\': 528312}, {\'name\': \'Occhio di Vecna\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Occhio di Vecna entra nel campo di battaglia, peschi una carta e perdi 2 punti vita.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, peschi una carta e perdi 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Io vedo le cose come sono davvero! Vedo... decomposizione in ogni carne e tradimento in ogni cuore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d37a9575-403e-423d-8185-9fd3bbb5a4fd\', \'multiverseId\': 528573}, \'multiverseid\': 528573}, {\'name\': \'アイ・オヴ・ヴェクナ\', \'text\': \'アイ・オヴ・ヴェクナが戦場に出たとき、あなたはカード１枚を引き、２点のライフを失う。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは「{2}を支払い、カード1枚を引き、１点のライフを失う。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「私は万物のありのままの状態を見ることができるのだ！見えるぞ…すべての肉体に腐敗が、すべて心に裏切りが見えるぞ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d275afa7-9883-4ccd-bc4d-0399561f3c1a\', \'multiverseId\': 528834}, \'multiverseid\': 528834}, {\'name\': \'베크나의 눈\', \'text\': \'베크나의 눈이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑고 생명 2점을 잃는다.\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신은 {2}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑고 생명 2점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"만물의 진정한 모습이 보인다! 보인다 . . . 모든 육신에는 부패가, 모든 마음에는 배신이 깃든 것이."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e842610f-43fe-4cf0-b0c6-625f0637928e\', \'multiverseId\': 529094}, \'multiverseid\': 529094}, {\'name\': \'Olho de Vecna\', \'text\': \'Quando Olho de Vecna entra no campo de batalha, você compra um card e perde 2 pontos de vida.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, você pode pagar {2}. Se fizer isso, você compra um card e perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu vejo tudo como realmente é! Eu vejo... putrefação em cada carne e traição em cada coração."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7501134c-486c-4bdc-8dd3-79acdb6c13d7\', \'multiverseId\': 529355}, \'multiverseid\': 529355}, {\'name\': \'Глаз Векны\', \'text\': \'Когда Глаз Векны выходит на поле битвы, вы берете карту и теряете 2 жизни.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки вы можете заплатить {2}. Если вы это делаете, то берете карту и теряете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Я вижу вещи такими, каковы они есть на самом деле! Я вижу... гниль в каждой плоти и предательство в каждом сердце».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9a14d41-5651-46d7-91d8-06b096374e76\', \'multiverseId\': 529616}, \'multiverseid\': 529616}, {\'name\': \'威可那法眼\', \'text\': \'当威可那法眼进战场时，你抓一张牌且失去2点生命。\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，则你抓一张牌且失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我看到了万物真实样貌！我看到了…所有肉体内的腐朽，以及所有心中的背叛。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05159467-fa18-47c4-8b6d-6c6148760df8\', \'multiverseId\': 529876}, \'multiverseid\': 529876}, {\'name\': \'威可那法眼\', \'text\': \'當威可那法眼進戰場時，你抽一張牌且失去2點生命。\\n在你的維持開始時，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，則你抽一張牌且失去2點生命。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我看到了萬物真實樣貌！我看到了…所有肉體內的腐朽，以及所有心中的背叛。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc624a0a-92ce-4469-8cd3-5d14a2318e5c\', \'multiverseId\': 530136}, \'multiverseid\': 530136}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auge des Vecna\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Auge des Vecna ins Spiel kommt, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52021882-74d8-4a9e-ab2b-fca315bf84d1\', \'multiverseId\': 530551}, \'multiverseid\': 530551}, {\'name\': \'Ojo de Vecna\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ojo de Vecna entre al campo de batalla, robas una carta y pierdes 2 vidas.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, robas una carta y pierdes 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1fab14c-8f44-4697-ba22-15be6306d7e3\', \'multiverseId\': 530588}, \'multiverseid\': 530588}, {\'name\': \'Œil de Vecna\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Œil de Vecna arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 2 points de vie.\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530625&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f266583d-c6ae-4b62-b69e-8e885a390175\', \'multiverseId\': 530625}, \'multiverseid\': 530625}, {\'name\': \'Occhio di Vecna\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Occhio di Vecna entra nel campo di battaglia, peschi una carta e perdi 2 punti vita.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, peschi una carta e perdi 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85fc6f6e-e2e8-4686-bd4b-c01da4668ed2\', \'multiverseId\': 530662}, \'multiverseid\': 530662}, {\'name\': \'アイ・オヴ・ヴェクナ\', \'text\': \'アイ・オヴ・ヴェクナが戦場に出たとき、あなたはカード１枚を引き、２点のライフを失う。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは「{2}を支払い、カード１枚を引き、２点のライフを失う。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3813c666-2bdd-4331-9340-b60ebfb832ea\', \'multiverseId\': 530699}, \'multiverseid\': 530699}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augen des Betrachters\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -11/-11 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Am Ende war nichts Schönes mehr zu sehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527648&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92d2cb05-5ab4-496b-b376-366b7efd155d\', \'multiverseId\': 527648}, \'multiverseid\': 527648}, {\'name\': \'Ojos del contemplador\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -11/-11 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Al final, no había nada bello que ver.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'924db693-5847-47fb-9354-1326181ea7cd\', \'multiverseId\': 527909}, \'multiverseid\': 527909}, {\'name\': \'Regard du tyrannœil\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -11/-11 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "À vrai dire, ce n\'est pas beau à voir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528170&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41b3f38e-c8e6-47b0-ba24-ae5d501d256b\', \'multiverseId\': 528170}, \'multiverseid\': 528170}, {\'name\': \'Occhi del Beholder\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -11/-11 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Ciò che rimase non era un bel vedere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c35d3b90-18a0-4996-b2a5-ff803b3a0580\', \'multiverseId\': 528431}, \'multiverseid\': 528431}, {\'name\': \'ビホルダーの眼\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－11/－11の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'最終的には、美しいものが見えなくなった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb9184e2-a8ee-40c1-ba55-68c730e28a0a\', \'multiverseId\': 528692}, \'multiverseid\': 528692}, {\'name\': \'비홀더의 눈\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -11/-11을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'결국, 아름답다고 할 만한 것은 전혀 없었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99c44f6e-8bf8-44ac-8076-c785d74443b7\', \'multiverseId\': 528952}, \'multiverseid\': 528952}, {\'name\': \'Olhos do Observador\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -11/-11 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'No fim, não havia nada de belo para ver.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f5c5a50-9914-47d3-8213-cfc86d366c8d\', \'multiverseId\': 529213}, \'multiverseid\': 529213}, {\'name\': \'Глаза Злобоглаза\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -11/-11 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'В самом конце не осталось ничего красивого, на что можно было бы взглянуть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc1ef2df-f8ac-4583-86be-d4dcc52f6dca\', \'multiverseId\': 529474}, \'multiverseid\': 529474}, {\'name\': \'魔眼杀机\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-11/-11直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'最后剩下的东西可不美丽。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b751b423-f772-4b04-ab64-28a69fbb5f4e\', \'multiverseId\': 529734}, \'multiverseid\': 529734}, {\'name\': \'魔眼殺機\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-11/-11直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'最後剩下的東西可不美麗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c884e25-e305-47e7-bb2b-fababaf90663\', \'multiverseId\': 529994}, \'multiverseid\': 529994}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgewachsener Golddrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung, Eile\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Golddrachen sind die größten, mächtigsten und weisesten der Metalldrachen und übernehmen häufig die Aufgabe, Gemeinschaften der Sterblichen vor Übeln zu schützen, die sie bedrohen könnten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527763&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f393ad9-2e73-4815-b890-58efaaaab405\', \'multiverseId\': 527763}, \'multiverseid\': 527763}, {\'name\': \'Dragón de oro adulto\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital, prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Los dragones de oro son los dragones metálicos más grandes, fuertes y sabios. Suelen asumir la responsabilidad de salvaguardar las comunidades mortales de los males que podrían amenazarlas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f127c1ee-f2af-463f-b6f8-000af67fed84\', \'multiverseId\': 528024}, \'multiverseid\': 528024}, {\'name\': "Dragon d\'or adulte", \'text\': \'Vol, lien de vie, célérité\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "Les dragons d\'or sont les plus grands des dragons métalliques, que ce soit en taille, en puissance ou en sagesse, et ils décident souvent de protéger des communautés mortelles contre tout mal qui pourrait les menacer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528285&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eb5b834-0cb7-403b-b5ae-dcfff2d7274c\', \'multiverseId\': 528285}, \'multiverseid\': 528285}, {\'name\': "Drago d\'Oro Adulto", \'text\': \'Volare, legame vitale, rapidità\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': "I draghi d\'oro sono i primi di tutti i draghi metallici in taglia, potere e saggezza e spesso si assumono la responsabilità di proteggere comunità di mortali dalle minacce malvagie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d48fe37e-be41-4408-af2a-fe458ddcc6eb\', \'multiverseId\': 528546}, \'multiverseid\': 528546}, {\'name\': \'アダルト・ゴールド・ドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂、速攻\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'ゴールド・ドラゴンはメタリック・ドラゴンの中でも最大級の大きさと力と知恵を持ち、しばしば定命の者の一族を脅かす悪から守る保護者役を担う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57576159-d077-4223-a76c-3821eebaa750\', \'multiverseId\': 528807}, \'multiverseid\': 528807}, {\'name\': \'다 자란 황금용\', \'text\': \'비행, 생명연결, 신속\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': \'황금용은 크기, 힘, 지혜 면에서 금속 용들 중 가장 위대한 존재이며, 종종 인간들에게 위협이 될 수도 있는 악으로부터 인간들을 보호하기 위해 스스로 나서기도 한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17194983-aa84-47bd-88e9-a5d09b5fed47\', \'multiverseId\': 529067}, \'multiverseid\': 529067}, {\'name\': \'Dragão de Ouro Adulto\', \'text\': \'Voar, vínculo com a vida, ímpeto\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Os dragões de ouro são os maiores dragões metálicos em tamanho, poder e sabedoria. Eles geralmente assumem a responsabilidade pela proteção de comunidades mortais contra os males que podem ameaçá-las.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'664bf74f-f04e-45fb-a1d5-228878343adf\', \'multiverseId\': 529328}, \'multiverseid\': 529328}, {\'name\': \'Взрослый Золотой Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет, Цепь жизни, Ускорение\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'Золотые драконы — величайшие из металлических драконов и по размерам, и по силе и мудрости. Зачастую они принимают на себя роль защитников смертных от зла, которое могло бы угрожать им.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df11126-1665-491e-8500-c511dd640236\', \'multiverseId\': 529589}, \'multiverseid\': 529589}, {\'name\': \'成年金龙\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命，敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'金龙在金属龙里体型、力量与智慧均为上乘，通常自愿担起责任守护凡人社群不受邪恶威胁。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d42cef5c-a074-44da-bfc2-3dd6250ea800\', \'multiverseId\': 529849}, \'multiverseid\': 529849}, {\'name\': \'成年金龍\', \'text\': \'飛行，繫命，敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'金龍在金屬龍裡體型、力量與智慧均為上乘，通常自願擔起責任守護凡人社群不受邪惡威脅。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d74cc92e-0f00-4b35-b10b-d1c61889263c\', \'multiverseId\': 530109}, \'multiverseid\': 530109}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgewachsener Golddrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung, Eile\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530724&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'593f228d-73e1-47f1-ad75-e0dc91278123\', \'multiverseId\': 530724}, \'multiverseid\': 530724}, {\'name\': \'Dragón de oro adulto\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital, prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5571a2cd-e03d-4ee5-af45-d165ea8d75fa\', \'multiverseId\': 530736}, \'multiverseid\': 530736}, {\'name\': "Dragon d\'or adulte", \'text\': \'Vol, lien de vie, célérité\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530748&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a18aa9d0-7f27-43a1-af3b-205545533d62\', \'multiverseId\': 530748}, \'multiverseid\': 530748}, {\'name\': "Drago d\'Oro Adulto", \'text\': \'Volare, legame vitale, rapidità\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1ef0112-6d8d-4d9a-8e4c-43b9d952fdd8\', \'multiverseId\': 530760}, \'multiverseid\': 530760}, {\'name\': \'アダルト・ゴールド・ドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂、速攻\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e8c2a5d-c0c9-4648-8187-b367f4bceb17\', \'multiverseId\': 530772}, \'multiverseid\': 530772}, {\'name\': \'다 자란 황금용\', \'text\': \'비행, 생명연결, 신속\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1719cc3e-bd63-48f9-8773-89e45a27ab0d\', \'multiverseId\': 530784}, \'multiverseid\': 530784}, {\'name\': \'Dragão de Ouro Adulto\', \'text\': \'Voar, vínculo com a vida, ímpeto\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f42d948-4502-44fc-85d2-0753fd202923\', \'multiverseId\': 530796}, \'multiverseid\': 530796}, {\'name\': \'Взрослый Золотой Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет, Цепь жизни, Ускорение\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32ec8cce-20cf-4cfc-9c27-83ac73f1b820\', \'multiverseId\': 530808}, \'multiverseid\': 530808}, {\'name\': \'成年金龙\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命，敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a59fcf-ddc1-4ab6-b061-555081d46442\', \'multiverseId\': 530820}, \'multiverseid\': 530820}, {\'name\': \'成年金龍\', \'text\': \'飛行，繫命，敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd6f5aac-7d0d-448a-a191-0d109c6b5c61\', \'multiverseId\': 530832}, \'multiverseid\': 530832}]', "[{'name': 'Ausschwärmende Goblins', 'text': 'Wenn die Ausschwärmenden Goblins ins Spiel kommen, würfle einen W20.\\n1—9 | Erzeuge einen 1/1 roten Goblin-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n10—19 | Erzeuge zwei solcher Spielsteine.\\n20 | Erzeuge drei solcher Spielsteine.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527709&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad8c187b-c4aa-4e60-8c78-70b2a18848c8', 'multiverseId': 527709}, 'multiverseid': 527709}, {'name': 'Multitud de goblins', 'text': 'Cuando la Multitud de goblins entre al campo de batalla, tira 1d20.\\n1—9 | Crea una ficha de criatura Trasgo roja 1/1.\\n10—19 | Crea dos de esas fichas.\\n20 | Crea tres de esas fichas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Trasgo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527970&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3140c442-0654-4550-9a64-63c8cc868df3', 'multiverseId': 527970}, 'multiverseid': 527970}, {'name': 'Nuée de gobelins', 'text': 'Quand la Nuée de gobelins arrive sur le champ de bataille, lancez un d20.\\n1—9 | Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\\n10—19 | Créez deux de ces jetons.\\n20 | Créez trois de ces jetons.', 'type': 'Créature : gobelin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528231&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b510815-6088-400c-af52-6c1f6c6aa565', 'multiverseId': 528231}, 'multiverseid': 528231}, {'name': 'Sciame di Goblin', 'text': 'Quando lo Sciame di Goblin entra nel campo di battaglia, tira un d20.\\n1—9 | Crea una pedina creatura Goblin 1/1 rossa.\\n10—19 | Crea due di quelle pedine.\\n20 | Crea tre di quelle pedine.', 'type': 'Creatura — Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528492&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a06c3a6d-2e22-4d6f-948c-64b11146385d', 'multiverseId': 528492}, 'multiverseid': 528492}, {'name': '群がるゴブリン', 'text': '群がるゴブリンが戦場に出たとき、１個のd20を振る。\\n１—９ | 赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n10-19 | そのトークン２体を生成する。\\n20 | そのトークン３体を生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528753&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1ef5ecc-16b0-44f9-ab08-f6315fed6db1', 'multiverseId': 528753}, 'multiverseid': 528753}, {'name': '떼로 모여드는 고블린', 'text': '떼로 모여드는 고블린이 장에 들어올 때, 20면체를 굴린다.\\n1—9 | 1/1 적색 고블린 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n10-19 | 위와 같은 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\\n20 | 위와 같은 토큰 세 개를 만든다.', 'type': '생물 — 고블린', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529013&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d41ac42-8235-4de5-bc66-ef5c5001645a', 'multiverseId': 529013}, 'multiverseid': 529013}, {'name': 'Enxame de Goblins', 'text': 'Quando Enxame de Goblins entrar no campo de batalha, role um d20.\\n1—9 | Crie uma ficha de criatura Goblin vermelha 1/1.\\n10-19 | Crie duas daquelas fichas.\\n20 | Crie três daquelas fichas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529274&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e9ba6a62-747f-4db1-8f61-895316069f9b', 'multiverseId': 529274}, 'multiverseid': 529274}, {'name': 'Кишащие Гоблины', 'text': 'Когда Кишащие Гоблины выходят на поле битвы, бросьте d20.\\n1—9 | Создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 красный Гоблин.\\n10—19 | Создайте две такие фишки.\\n20 | Создайте три такие фишки.', 'type': 'Существо — Гоблин', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529535&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8d6ab3c-8c25-43cb-b873-43622bc72b6b', 'multiverseId': 529535}, 'multiverseid': 529535}, {'name': '哥布林聚群', 'text': '当哥布林聚群进战场时，掷一颗d20。\\n1～9 | 派出一个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物。\\n10～19 | 派出两个上述衍生物。\\n20 | 派出三个上述衍生物。', 'type': '生物 ～鬼怪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529795&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51780327-86a6-490c-8e69-d68bc2fb4883', 'multiverseId': 529795}, 'multiverseid': 529795}, {'name': '哥布林聚群', 'text': '當哥布林聚群進戰場時，擲一顆d20。\\n1～9 | 派出一個1/1紅色鬼怪衍生生物。\\n10～19 | 派出兩個上述衍生物。\\n20 | 派出三個上述衍生物。', 'type': '生物 ～鬼怪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530055&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '364c09c7-9366-487e-9993-686a53c8063f', 'multiverseId': 530055}, 'multiverseid': 530055}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bardeninstrument\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du eine Harmoniemarke auf das Bardeninstrument legen.\\n{3}{G}, {T}: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag gleich der Anzahl an Harmoniemarken auf dem Bardeninstrument, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Falls die Karte legendär ist, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. Mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527737&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cccb8a88-4996-4fcd-b6bc-9497a087d301\', \'multiverseId\': 527737}, \'multiverseid\': 527737}, {\'name\': \'Instrumento de los bardos\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes poner un contador de armonía sobre el Instrumento de los bardos.\\n{3}{G}, {T}: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura con valor de maná igual a la cantidad de contadores de armonía sobre el Instrumento de los bardos, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Si esa carta es legendaria, crea una ficha de Tesoro. Luego, baraja.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e9a5eda-4494-41dd-9259-a516c40b3358\', \'multiverseId\': 527998}, \'multiverseid\': 527998}, {\'name\': \'Instrument des bardes\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur « harmonie » sur l\'Instrument des bardes.\\n{3}{G}, {T} : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana égale au nombre de marqueurs « harmonie » sur l\'Instrument des bardes, révélez-la et mettez-la dans votre main. Si cette carte est légendaire, créez un jeton Trésor. Puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528259&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0d1b25f-c99d-4222-8fa4-253a4e615671\', \'multiverseId\': 528259}, \'multiverseid\': 528259}, {\'name\': \'Strumento dei Bardi\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi mettere un segnalino armonia sullo Strumento dei Bardi.\\n{3}{G}, {T}: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta creatura con valore di mana pari al numero di segnalini armonia sullo Strumento dei Bardi, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Se quella carta è leggendaria, crea una pedina Tesoro. Poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6269b3d4-4d6f-4c73-b76e-defcd9ff58b9\', \'multiverseId\': 528520}, \'multiverseid\': 528520}, {\'name\': \'インストゥルメント・オヴ・ザ・バーズ\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはインストゥルメント・オヴ・ザ・バーズの上に調和カウンター１個を置いてもよい。\\n{3}{G}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーから、マナ総量がインストゥルメント・オヴ・ザ・バーズの上に置かれている調和カウンターの数に等しいクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、公開してあなたの手札に加える。そのカードが伝説であるなら、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70337e68-840d-4010-85bf-bd00defb29ad\', \'multiverseId\': 528781}, \'multiverseid\': 528781}, {\'name\': \'음유시인의 악기\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 음유시인의 악기에 화음 카운터 한 개를 올려놓을 수 있다.\\n{3}{G}, {T}: 당신의 서고에서 음유시인의 악기에 놓여진 화음 카운터의 수와 같은 마나 값을 가진 생물 카드를 찾아, 공개하고, 그 카드를 당신의 손에 넣는다. 그 카드가 전설적이라면, 보물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 그 후 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'914ac41d-5a8b-4c82-9ffe-4331b6412dab\', \'multiverseId\': 529041}, \'multiverseid\': 529041}, {\'name\': \'Instrumento dos Bardos\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, você pode colocar um marcador de harmonia em Instrumento dos Bardos.\\n{3}{G}, {T}: Procure em seu grimório um card de criatura com valor de mana igual ao número de marcadores de harmonia em Instrumento dos Bardos, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Se aquele card for lendário, crie uma ficha de Tesouro. Depois, embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d713ca88-532a-4831-8a5f-b5edab20212c\', \'multiverseId\': 529302}, \'multiverseid\': 529302}, {\'name\': \'Инструмент Бардов\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки вы можете положить один жетон гармонии на Инструмент Бардов.\\n{3}{G}, {T}: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту существа с мановой ценностью, равной числу жетонов гармонии на Инструменте Бардов, покажите ее и положите ее в вашу руку. Если та карта легендарная, создайте одну фишку Клада. Затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae6c1e08-e524-478e-81a5-e3c5d4ac9289\', \'multiverseId\': 529563}, \'multiverseid\': 529563}, {\'name\': \'吟游诗人乐器\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你可以在吟游诗人乐器上放置一个和声指示物。\\n{3}{G}，{T}：从你的牌库中搜寻一张生物牌，且其法术力值须等同于吟游诗人乐器上和声指示物的数量，展示该牌，将它置于你手上。如果该牌是传奇，则派出一个珍宝衍生物。然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'469c65a5-fee2-41ee-b672-0c264f8bd98f\', \'multiverseId\': 529823}, \'multiverseid\': 529823}, {\'name\': \'吟遊詩人樂器\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，你可以在吟遊詩人樂器上放置一個和聲指示物。\\n{3}{G}，{T}：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張生物牌，且其魔法力值須等同於吟遊詩人樂器上和聲指示物的數量，展示該牌，將它置於你手上。如果該牌是傳奇，則派出一個珍寶衍生物。然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58f890f5-29c3-4340-b3a3-692597a7b388\', \'multiverseId\': 530083}, \'multiverseid\': 530083}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bardeninstrument\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du eine Harmoniemarke auf das Bardeninstrument legen.\\n{3}{G}, {T}: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag gleich der Anzahl an Harmoniemarken auf dem Bardeninstrument, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Falls die Karte legendär ist, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. Mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530543&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eb6b762-07dc-4b7d-a5e1-5d3591dced81\', \'multiverseId\': 530543}, \'multiverseid\': 530543}, {\'name\': \'Instrumento de los bardos\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes poner un contador de armonía sobre el Instrumento de los bardos.\\n{3}{G}, {T}: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura con valor de maná igual a la cantidad de contadores de armonía sobre el Instrumento de los bardos, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Si esa carta es legendaria, crea una ficha de Tesoro. Luego, baraja.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da03fad0-4cf6-453a-9072-e7ba3027be4a\', \'multiverseId\': 530580}, \'multiverseid\': 530580}, {\'name\': \'Instrument des bardes\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur « harmonie » sur l\'Instrument des bardes.\\n{3}{G}, {T} : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana égale au nombre de marqueurs « harmonie » sur l\'Instrument des bardes, révélez-la et mettez-la dans votre main. Si cette carte est légendaire, créez un jeton Trésor. Puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530617&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f186d50-49ef-43bb-903e-7ed571f67527\', \'multiverseId\': 530617}, \'multiverseid\': 530617}, {\'name\': \'Strumento dei Bardi\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi mettere un segnalino armonia sullo Strumento dei Bardi.\\n{3}{G}, {T}: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta creatura con valore di mana pari al numero di segnalini armonia sullo Strumento dei Bardi, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Se quella carta è leggendaria, crea una pedina Tesoro. Poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9113584-d177-4ddd-8a31-99410fcb037e\', \'multiverseId\': 530654}, \'multiverseid\': 530654}, {\'name\': \'インストゥルメント・オヴ・ザ・バーズ\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはインストゥルメント・オヴ・ザ・バーズの上に調和カウンター１個を置いてもよい。\\n{3}{G}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーから、マナ総量がインストゥルメント・オヴ・ザ・バーズの上に置かれている調和カウンターの数に等しいクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、公開してあなたの手札に加える。そのカードが伝説であるなら、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f656874-8738-4098-a952-67bfb25cd9cf\', \'multiverseId\': 530691}, \'multiverseid\': 530691}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barrowin vom Klan Undurr\', \'text\': \'Wenn Barrowin vom Klan Undurr ins Spiel kommt, wage dich ins Gewölbe. (Betritt den ersten Raum oder rücke in den nächsten Raum vor.)\\nImmer wenn Barrowin vom Klan Undurr angreift, bringe bis zu eine Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück, falls du ein Gewölbe absolviert hast.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zwerg, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527765&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ae161fe-1ff8-4b11-84ca-5a332cf17a46\', \'multiverseId\': 527765}, \'multiverseid\': 527765}, {\'name\': \'Barrowin del clan Undurr\', \'text\': \'Cuando Barrowin del clan Undurr entre al campo de batalla, adéntrate en la mazmorra. (Entra en la primera sala o avanza a la siguiente.)\\nSiempre que Barrowin del clan Undurr ataque, regresa hasta una carta de criatura con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla si completaste una mazmorra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Clérigo enano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb49c38-7752-4376-b722-1a9b205cace3\', \'multiverseId\': 528026}, \'multiverseid\': 528026}, {\'name\': \'Barrowin du clan Undurr\', \'text\': "Quand Barrowin du clan Undurr arrive sur le champ de bataille, aventurez-vous dans le donjon. (Entrez dans la première pièce ou avancez jusqu\'à la pièce suivante.)\\nÀ chaque fois que Barrowin du clan Undurr attaque, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille jusqu\'à une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 de votre cimetière si vous avez terminé un donjon.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : nain et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528287&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0188545f-cb72-4172-87ce-8786b4aabfe9\', \'multiverseId\': 528287}, \'multiverseid\': 528287}, {\'name\': \'Barrowin del Clan Undurr\', \'text\': \'Quando Barrowin del Clan Undurr entra nel campo di battaglia, esplora il dungeon. (Entra nella prima stanza o avanza a quella successiva.)\\nOgniqualvolta Barrowin del Clan Undurr attacca, rimetti sul campo di battaglia fino a una carta creatura con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero se hai completato un dungeon.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Chierico Nano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3d2d4b1-2e27-4199-989b-96e41b4a34f5\', \'multiverseId\': 528548}, \'multiverseid\': 528548}, {\'name\': \'ウンドゥル族のバローウィン\', \'text\': \'ウンドゥル族のバローウィンが戦場に出たとき、ダンジョン探索をする。（ダンジョン探索をするとは、最初の部屋へ入るか、次の部屋へ進むことである。）\\nウンドゥル族のバローウィンが攻撃するたび、あなたがダンジョンを踏破したことがある場合、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるクリーチャー・カード最大１枚を戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドワーフ・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'523cf12c-7e4d-4584-a38f-d9bb4fb4669d\', \'multiverseId\': 528809}, \'multiverseid\': 528809}, {\'name\': \'운두르 부족의 바로윈\', \'text\': \'운두르 부족의 바로윈이 전장에 들어올 때, 던전에 진입한다. (첫 번째 방에 들어가거나 다음 방으로 전진한다.)\\n운두르 부족의 바로윈이 공격할 때마다, 당신이 던전을 완료했다면 당신의 무덤에서 마나 값이 3 이하인 생물 카드를 최대 한 장까지 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 드워프 성직자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21352e76-cc09-421a-823f-717671cdba5b\', \'multiverseId\': 529069}, \'multiverseid\': 529069}, {\'name\': \'Barrowin do Clã Undurr\', \'text\': \'Quando Barrowin do Clã Undurr entrar no campo de batalha, aventure-se na masmorra. (Entre na primeira sala ou prossiga para a próxima.)\\nToda vez que Barrowin do Clã Undurr atacar, se você já tiver completado uma masmorra, devolva de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha até um card de criatura com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anão Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6427577c-a49f-4005-b575-adb18e2ccaaf\', \'multiverseId\': 529330}, \'multiverseid\': 529330}, {\'name\': \'Барровин из Клана Ундурр\', \'text\': \'Когда Барровин из Клана Ундурр выходит на поле битвы, углубитесь в подземелье. (Войдите в первую комнату или перейдите в следующую комнату.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Барровин из Клана Ундурр атакует, верните не более одной карты существа с мановой ценностью 3 или меньше из вашего кладбища на поле битвы, если вы прошли подземелье.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гном Священник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e2a2fe-078f-4433-bad0-433dbd17a524\', \'multiverseId\': 529591}, \'multiverseid\': 529591}, {\'name\': \'乌杜尔部族的芭罗雯\', \'text\': \'当乌杜尔部族的芭罗雯进战场时，深入地城。（进入第一个房间，或前进至下一个房间。）\\n每当乌杜尔部族的芭罗雯攻击时，如果你完成过地城，则将至多一张法术力值等于或小于3的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～矮人／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fe6e317-32ea-4261-a9ce-2beea2bfe9ba\', \'multiverseId\': 529851}, \'multiverseid\': 529851}, {\'name\': \'烏杜爾部族的芭羅雯\', \'text\': \'當烏杜爾部族的芭羅雯進戰場時，深入地城。（進入第一個房間，或前進至下一個房間。）\\n每當烏杜爾部族的芭羅雯攻擊時，如果你完成過地城，則將至多一張魔法力值等於或小於3的生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～矮人／僧侶\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'046d14c1-dc83-4465-957a-8a58a57fc8a8\', \'multiverseId\': 530111}, \'multiverseid\': 530111}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barrowin vom Klan Undurr\', \'text\': \'Wenn Barrowin vom Klan Undurr ins Spiel kommt, wage dich ins Gewölbe.\\nImmer wenn Barrowin vom Klan Undurr angreift, bringe bis zu eine Kreaturenkarte mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück, falls du ein Gewölbe absolviert hast.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zwerg, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531021&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2b6e1b9-a4f8-4521-a3b0-571df0500897\', \'multiverseId\': 531021}, \'multiverseid\': 531021}, {\'name\': \'Barrowin del clan Undurr\', \'text\': \'Cuando Barrowin del clan Undurr entre al campo de batalla, adéntrate en la mazmorra.\\nSiempre que Barrowin del clan Undurr ataque, regresa hasta una carta de criatura con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla si completaste una mazmorra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Clérigo enano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a3669a6-556f-4150-8117-413a737cda10\', \'multiverseId\': 531072}, \'multiverseid\': 531072}, {\'name\': \'Barrowin du clan Undurr\', \'text\': "Quand Barrowin du clan Undurr arrive sur le champ de bataille, aventurez-vous dans le donjon.\\nÀ chaque fois que Barrowin du clan Undurr attaque, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille jusqu\'à une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 de votre cimetière si vous avez terminé un donjon.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : nain et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531123&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53b4cb58-b463-4e33-a842-b641b7d22df7\', \'multiverseId\': 531123}, \'multiverseid\': 531123}, {\'name\': \'Barrowin del Clan Undurr\', \'text\': \'Quando Barrowin del Clan Undurr entra nel campo di battaglia, esplora il dungeon.\\nOgniqualvolta Barrowin del Clan Undurr attacca, rimetti sul campo di battaglia fino a una carta creatura con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero se hai completato un dungeon.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Chierico Nano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4561e34e-f633-4176-bd65-bee3d2961a78\', \'multiverseId\': 531174}, \'multiverseid\': 531174}, {\'name\': \'ウンドゥル族のバローウィン\', \'text\': \'ウンドゥル族のバローウィンが戦場に出たとき、ダンジョン探索をする。\\nウンドゥル族のバローウィンが攻撃するたび、あなたがダンジョンを踏破したことがある場合、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドワーフ・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'294ffa46-243b-4227-8b62-81a45bb3216d\', \'multiverseId\': 531225}, \'multiverseid\': 531225}, {\'name\': \'운두르 부족의 바로윈\', \'text\': \'운두르 부족의 바로윈이 전장에 들어올 때, 던전에 진입한다.\\n운두르 부족의 바로윈이 공격할 때마다, 당신이 던전을 완료했다면 당신의 무덤에서 마나 값이 3 이하인 생물 카드를 최대 한 장까지 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 드워프 성직자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ef0ce7e-b166-41bd-956e-2d14490e9d97\', \'multiverseId\': 531276}, \'multiverseid\': 531276}, {\'name\': \'Barrowin do Clã Undurr\', \'text\': \'Quando Barrowin do Clã Undurr entrar no campo de batalha, aventure-se na masmorra.\\nToda vez que Barrowin do Clã Undurr atacar, se você já tiver completado uma masmorra, devolva de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha até um card de criatura com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anão Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcd35027-dbbe-409c-a093-2eecec62d50c\', \'multiverseId\': 531327}, \'multiverseid\': 531327}, {\'name\': \'Барровин из Клана Ундурр\', \'text\': \'Когда Барровин из Клана Ундурр выходит на поле битвы, углубитесь в подземелье.\\nКаждый раз, когда Барровин из Клана Ундурр атакует, верните не более одной карты существа с мановой ценностью 3 или меньше из вашего кладбища на поле битвы, если вы прошли подземелье.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гном Священник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5986c7f3-0e65-42c1-af1a-6339980cef33\', \'multiverseId\': 531378}, \'multiverseid\': 531378}, {\'name\': \'乌杜尔部族的芭罗雯\', \'text\': \'当乌杜尔部族的芭罗雯进战场时，深入地城。\\n每当乌杜尔部族的芭罗雯攻击时，如果你完成过地城，则将至多一张法术力值等于或小于3的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～矮人／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'857d0b60-fbd0-46a6-b590-e8f5d18f1232\', \'multiverseId\': 531429}, \'multiverseid\': 531429}, {\'name\': \'烏杜爾部族的芭羅雯\', \'text\': \'當烏杜爾部族的芭羅雯進戰場時，深入地城。\\n每當烏杜爾部族的芭羅雯攻擊時，如果你完成過地城，則將至多一張魔法力值等於或小於3的生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～矮人／僧侶\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d945524f-7a86-4778-aa76-3ca7ab6ba50f\', \'multiverseId\': 531480}, \'multiverseid\': 531480}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bau des Grottenschrats\', \'text\': \'Falls du zwei oder mehr andere Länder kontrollierst, kommt der Bau des Grottenschrats getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\\n{3}{R}: Der Bau des Grottenschrats wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/2 roten Goblin-Kreatur mit „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, erzeuge einen getappten und angreifenden 1/1 roten Goblin-Kreaturenspielstein." Er ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527801&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29635c56-d426-4e85-9232-98e4a213a073\', \'multiverseId\': 527801}, \'multiverseid\': 527801}, {\'name\': \'Cubil del osgo\', \'text\': \'Si controlas otras dos o más tierras, el Cubil del osgo entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}.\\n{3}{R}: Hasta el final del turno, el Cubil del osgo se convierte en una criatura Trasgo roja 3/2 con "Siempre que esta criatura ataque, crea una ficha de criatura Trasgo roja 1/1 que está girada y atacando". Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c678bcb-1658-445e-82a0-5981c3a814e6\', \'multiverseId\': 528062}, \'multiverseid\': 528062}, {\'name\': \'Tanière du gobelours\', \'text\': "Si vous contrôlez au moins deux autres terrains, la Tanière du gobelours arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\\n{3}{R} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la Tanière du gobelours devient une créature 3/2 rouge Gobelin avec « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin qui est engagé et attaquant ». C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528323&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89b1525e-2dc9-464e-abbd-a7b3ee73ed79\', \'multiverseId\': 528323}, \'multiverseid\': 528323}, {\'name\': \'Tana del Bugbear\', \'text\': \'Se controlli altre due o più terre, la Tana del Bugbear entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\\n{3}{R}: Fino alla fine del turno, la Tana del Bugbear diventa una creatura Goblin 3/2 rossa con "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, crea una pedina creatura Goblin 1/1 rossa TAPpata e attaccante". È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71a3e8e1-a468-48ae-ac31-6011da06dc15\', \'multiverseId\': 528584}, \'multiverseid\': 528584}, {\'name\': \'バグベアの居住地\', \'text\': \'あなたがこれ以外の２つ以上の土地をコントロールしているなら、バグベアの居住地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}を加える。\\n{3}{R}：ターン終了時まで、バグベアの居住地は「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン１体をタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。」を持つ赤の３/２のゴブリン・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4c54cae-c089-4d0e-ae5e-2b0ec2f7def1\', \'multiverseId\': 528845}, \'multiverseid\': 528845}, {\'name\': \'버그베어의 소굴\', \'text\': \'당신이 다른 대지를 두 개 이상 조종한다면, 버그베어의 소굴은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {R}를 추가한다.\\n{3}{R}: 턴종료까지, 버그베어의 소굴은 "이 생물이 공격할 때마다, 탭되어 공격 중인 1/1 적색 고블린 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다."를 가진 3/2 적색 고블린 생물이 된다. 이 생물은 여전히 대지다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f1e7a08-a2a4-4636-9734-147e0525daf7\', \'multiverseId\': 529105}, \'multiverseid\': 529105}, {\'name\': \'Covil do Bugurso\', \'text\': \'Se você controla dois ou mais outros terrenos, Covil do Bugurso entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}.\\n{3}{R}: Até o final do turno, Covil do Bugurso torna-se uma criatura Goblin vermelha 3/2 com "Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, crie uma ficha de criatura Goblin vermelha 1/1 virada e atacando". Ele ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc39a89c-ac48-4759-bfee-e42155ccb7bd\', \'multiverseId\': 529366}, \'multiverseid\': 529366}, {\'name\': \'Логово Багбера\', \'text\': \'Если под вашим контролем есть не менее двух других земель, Логово Багбера выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}.\\n{3}{R}: до конца хода Логово Багбера становится существом 3/2 красный Гоблин со способностью «Каждый раз, когда это существо атакует, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 красный Гоблин повернутой и атакующей». При этом оно остается землей.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e8e4fce-be81-4fbf-b48c-90c731fe09ad\', \'multiverseId\': 529627}, \'multiverseid\': 529627}, {\'name\': \'熊哥布林窝巢\', \'text\': \'如果你操控两个或更多其他地，则熊哥布林窝巢须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}。\\n{3}{R}：直到回合结束，熊哥布林窝巢成为3/2红色鬼怪生物，且具有「每当此生物攻击时，派出一个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物，其为横置且正进行攻击。」它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'985a1523-a93b-4ba6-a29e-132aa50dd60f\', \'multiverseId\': 529887}, \'multiverseid\': 529887}, {\'name\': \'熊哥布林窩巢\', \'text\': \'如果你操控兩個或更多其他地，則熊哥布林窩巢須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{R}。\\n{3}{R}：直到回合結束，熊哥布林窩巢成為3/2紅色鬼怪生物，且具有「每當此生物攻擊時，派出一個1/1紅色鬼怪衍生生物，其為橫置且正進行攻擊。」它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dc83b67-1730-4348-aa2e-8f927cea26d4\', \'multiverseId\': 530147}, \'multiverseid\': 530147}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bau des Grottenschrats\', \'text\': \'Falls du zwei oder mehr andere Länder kontrollierst, kommt der Bau des Grottenschrats getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\\n{3}{R}: Der Bau des Grottenschrats wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/2 roten Goblin-Kreatur mit „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, erzeuge einen getappten und angreifenden 1/1 roten Goblin-Kreaturenspielstein." Er ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530844&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62899fda-05dc-461f-8f35-f99bd0309c01\', \'multiverseId\': 530844}, \'multiverseid\': 530844}, {\'name\': \'Cubil del osgo\', \'text\': \'Si controlas otras dos o más tierras, el Cubil del osgo entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}.\\n{3}{R}: Hasta el final del turno, el Cubil del osgo se convierte en una criatura Trasgo roja 3/2 con "Siempre que esta criatura ataque, crea una ficha de criatura Trasgo roja 1/1 que está girada y atacando". Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e489b4c8-d776-4197-9185-9c0ca0ba4ff3\', \'multiverseId\': 530853}, \'multiverseid\': 530853}, {\'name\': \'Tanière du gobelours\', \'text\': "Si vous contrôlez au moins deux autres terrains, la Tanière du gobelours arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\\n{3}{R} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la Tanière du gobelours devient une créature 3/2 rouge Gobelin avec « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin qui est engagé et attaquant ». C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530862&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61c62465-330a-4c21-9f8e-35b4dfe9e0cb\', \'multiverseId\': 530862}, \'multiverseid\': 530862}, {\'name\': \'Tana del Bugbear\', \'text\': \'Se controlli altre due o più terre, la Tana del Bugbear entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\\n{3}{R}: Fino alla fine del turno, la Tana del Bugbear diventa una creatura Goblin 3/2 rossa con "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, crea una pedina creatura Goblin 1/1 rossa TAPpata e attaccante". È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16d4a2b6-f730-448d-94d0-b64bb3761bf6\', \'multiverseId\': 530871}, \'multiverseid\': 530871}, {\'name\': \'バグベアの居住地\', \'text\': \'あなたがこれ以外の２つ以上の土地をコントロールしているなら、バグベアの居住地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}を加える。\\n{3}{R}：ターン終了時まで、バグベアの居住地は「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン１体をタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。」を持つ赤の３/２のゴブリン・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85f99d88-475f-46ff-b739-433621713b38\', \'multiverseId\': 530880}, \'multiverseid\': 530880}, {\'name\': \'버그베어의 소굴\', \'text\': \'당신이 다른 대지를 두 개 이상 조종한다면, 버그베어의 소굴은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {R}를 추가한다.\\n{3}{R}: 턴종료까지, 버그베어의 소굴은 "이 생물이 공격할 때마다, 탭되어 공격 중인 1/1 적색 고블린 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다."를 가진 3/2 적색 고블린 생물이 된다. 이 생물은 여전히 대지다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c0d763f-1983-47ea-b408-8564dbc38fe0\', \'multiverseId\': 530889}, \'multiverseid\': 530889}, {\'name\': \'Covil do Bugurso\', \'text\': \'Se você controla dois ou mais outros terrenos, Covil do Bugurso entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}.\\n{3}{R}: Até o final do turno, Covil do Bugurso torna-se uma criatura Goblin vermelha 3/2 com "Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, crie uma ficha de criatura Goblin vermelha 1/1 virada e atacando". Ele ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88447f7a-45e0-4817-bc12-5a9fd1de722c\', \'multiverseId\': 530898}, \'multiverseid\': 530898}, {\'name\': \'Логово Багбера\', \'text\': \'Если под вашим контролем есть не менее двух других земель, Логово Багбера выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}.\\n{3}{R}: до конца хода Логово Багбера становится существом 3/2 красный Гоблин со способностью «Каждый раз, когда это существо атакует, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 красный Гоблин повернутой и атакующей». При этом оно остается землей.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88c39168-1779-4fb7-b8a6-57ab35efc6b9\', \'multiverseId\': 530907}, \'multiverseid\': 530907}, {\'name\': \'熊哥布林窝巢\', \'text\': \'如果你操控两个或更多其他地，则熊哥布林窝巢须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}。\\n{3}{R}：直到回合结束，熊哥布林窝巢成为3/2红色鬼怪生物，且具有「每当此生物攻击时，派出一个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物，其为横置且正进行攻击。」它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c105712c-91bf-4952-8c01-e9068ad206dc\', \'multiverseId\': 530916}, \'multiverseid\': 530916}, {\'name\': \'熊哥布林窩巢\', \'text\': \'如果你操控兩個或更多其他地，則熊哥布林窩巢須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{R}。\\n{3}{R}：直到回合結束，熊哥布林窩巢成為3/2紅色鬼怪生物，且具有「每當此生物攻擊時，派出一個1/1紅色鬼怪衍生生物，其為橫置且正進行攻擊。」它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c99a407c-df99-4650-91f2-bbf5d6c8c0ce\', \'multiverseId\': 530925}, \'multiverseid\': 530925}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beute der Jagd\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält für jedes Mana von einem Schatz, das ausgegeben wurde, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Dann fügt sie einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dein Gegner kontrolliert, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Jede Münze hilft, die von ihnen zerstörte Stadt wieder aufzubauen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527752&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed8b9643-95d2-44e0-9d4c-5649273fadc7\', \'multiverseId\': 527752}, \'multiverseid\': 527752}, {\'name\': \'Botín de la caza\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno por cada maná de un Tesoro que se usó para lanzar este hechizo. Luego, esa criatura hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada moneda ayuda a reconstruir la ciudad que destruyeron".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0324a64-7e43-4651-8650-e504de138da6\', \'multiverseId\': 528013}, \'multiverseid\': 528013}, {\'name\': \'Butin de la chasse\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque mana d\'un trésor qui a été dépensé pour lancer ce sort. Ensuite, cette créature inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Chaque écu aide à reconstruire la ville qu\'ils ont détruite. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528274&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'737eb9ff-658b-4329-959e-6254998cc31f\', \'multiverseId\': 528274}, \'multiverseid\': 528274}, {\'name\': \'Spoglie della Caccia\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno per ogni mana da un Tesoro che è stato speso per lanciare questa magia. Poi quella creatura infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni moneta aiuta a ricostruire la città che hanno distrutto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e88cca51-1509-4a00-b010-b102f4a0f56f\', \'multiverseId\': 528535}, \'multiverseid\': 528535}, {\'name\': \'狩りの戦利品\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、その前者はこの呪文を唱えるために支払われた宝物からのマナ１点につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。その後、その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「どんな硬貨でも奴らが破壊した村を修復する役に立つ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b8c3ae0-048f-44de-b1c2-5a60ef2a5377\', \'multiverseId\': 528796}, \'multiverseid\': 528796}, {\'name\': \'사냥의 전리품\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 이 주문을 발동하기 위해 지불한 비용 중 보물로 생성된 각 마나당 +1/+0을 받는다. 그 후 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 첫 번째 목표는 두 번째 목표에게 자신의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"모든 동전은 그것들 때문에 파괴된 마을을 재건하는 일을 도와주지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'350227a2-8b46-44b3-bf46-963e20b6c8d7\', \'multiverseId\': 529056}, \'multiverseid\': 529056}, {\'name\': \'Espólio da Caçada\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno para cada mana de um Tesouro que tenha sido gasto para conjurar esta mágica. Em seguida, aquela criatura causa uma quantidade de dano igual ao próprio poder à criatura alvo que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada moeda ajuda a reconstruir a cidade que eles destruíram."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fe81f3f-651e-4f5a-95aa-4c2e6982fb04\', \'multiverseId\': 529317}, \'multiverseid\': 529317}, {\'name\': \'Охотничьи Трофеи\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +1/+0 до конца хода за каждую ману от Клада, которая была потрачена на разыгрывание этого заклинания. Затем то существо наносит повреждения, равные своей силе, целевому существу под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Каждая монета помогает отстроить город, который они разрушили».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'343d5f52-f8a6-42b2-ba69-ab53179849b8\', \'multiverseId\': 529578}, \'multiverseid\': 529578}, {\'name\': \'狩猎收获\', \'text\': \'选择目标由你操控的生物与目标由对手操控的生物。施放此咒语时每支付过一点来自珍宝的法术力，前者便得+1/+0直到回合结束。然后前者对后者造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「每一枚硬币都会用于重建遭其毁坏的城镇。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96f0cf02-109b-45f3-967e-1243df243cac\', \'multiverseId\': 529838}, \'multiverseid\': 529838}, {\'name\': \'狩獵收穫\', \'text\': \'選擇目標由你操控的生物與目標由對手操控的生物。施放此咒語時每支付過一點來自珍寶的魔法力，前者便得+1/+0直到回合結束。然後前者對後者造成傷害，其數量等同於前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「每一枚硬幣都會用於重建遭其毀壞的城鎮。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a26a9dff-10ef-4449-a8c9-c7005832f6cd\', \'multiverseId\': 530098}, \'multiverseid\': 530098}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blauer Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nBlitzodem — Wenn der Blaue Drache ins Spiel kommt, erhält bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, -3/-0, bis zu eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-0 und bis zu eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527596&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cebbaf0-34ed-4fea-9605-c3dff97980a9\', \'multiverseId\': 527596}, \'multiverseid\': 527596}, {\'name\': \'Dragón azul\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAliento de relámpago — Cuando el Dragón azul entre al campo de batalla, hasta tu próximo turno, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene 3/-0, hasta una otra criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-0 y hasta una otra criatura objetivo obtiene -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e199771-a2ca-4b82-933b-418f6507cae0\', \'multiverseId\': 527857}, \'multiverseid\': 527857}, {\'name\': \'Dragon bleu\', \'text\': "Vol\\nSouffle de foudre — Quand le Dragon bleu arrive sur le champ de bataille, jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -3/-0, jusqu\'à une autre créature ciblée gagne -2/-0 et jusqu\'à une autre créature ciblée gagne -1/-0.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528118&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9c65005-2ead-4c08-8c70-deddaa8d7545\', \'multiverseId\': 528118}, \'multiverseid\': 528118}, {\'name\': \'Drago Blu\', \'text\': "Volare\\nSoffio di Fulmini — Quando il Drago Blu entra nel campo di battaglia, fino al tuo prossimo turno, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -3/-0, fino a un\'altra creatura bersaglio prende -2/-0 e fino a un\'altra creatura bersaglio prende -1/-0.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3e13464-1f39-44f0-b331-4b012f5280d7\', \'multiverseId\': 528379}, \'multiverseid\': 528379}, {\'name\': \'ブルー・ドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n電撃のブレス — ブルー・ドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、それ以外のクリーチャー最大１体と、それら以外のクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。次のあなたのターンまで、その第１者が－３/－０の修整を受け、その第２者が－２/－０の修整を受け、その第３者が－１/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30562e3d-33e6-4229-af39-0da96287103f\', \'multiverseId\': 528640}, \'multiverseid\': 528640}, {\'name\': \'푸른 용\', \'text\': \'비행\\n번개 숨결 — 푸른 용이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정하고 다른 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정하고 또 다른 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 당신의 다음 턴까지, 첫 번째 목표는 -3/-0을, 두 번째 목표는 -2/-0을, 세 번째 목표는 -1/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0816b723-ce3c-4c02-b7de-8a06a46ad93f\', \'multiverseId\': 528900}, \'multiverseid\': 528900}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Azul\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nSopro elétrico — Quando Dragão Azul entrar no campo de batalha, até seu próximo turno, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -3/-0, até uma outra criatura alvo recebe -2/-0, e até uma outra criatura alvo recebe -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d5e6e8d-f78f-42e9-9ccb-3913a9b1a89c\', \'multiverseId\': 529161}, \'multiverseid\': 529161}, {\'name\': \'Синий Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nДыхание молнии — Когда Синий Дракон выходит на поле битвы, до вашего следующего хода целевое существо под контролем оппонента получает -3/-0, не более одного другого целевого существа получает -2/-0, и не более одного другого целевого существа получает -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aa01caa-84d2-4a0a-913f-9985ad52b49f\', \'multiverseId\': 529422}, \'multiverseid\': 529422}, {\'name\': \'蓝龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n闪电喷吐～当蓝龙进战场时，直到你的下一个回合，目标由对手操控的生物得-3/-0，至多另一个目标生物得-2/-0，且至多再另一个目标生物得-1/-0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd93db5b-78c3-47d8-965c-3eb0b309fc31\', \'multiverseId\': 529682}, \'multiverseid\': 529682}, {\'name\': \'藍龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n閃電噴吐～當藍龍進戰場時，直到你的下一個回合，目標由對手操控的生物得-3/-0，至多另一個目標生物得-2/-0，且至多再另一個目標生物得-1/-0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e9a4a83-b31d-43a1-b0db-16e675c5ebae\', \'multiverseId\': 529942}, \'multiverseid\': 529942}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blauer Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nBlitzodem — Wenn der Blaue Drache ins\\nSpiel kommt, erhält bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, -3/-0, bis zu eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-0 und bis zu eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530716&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab9d2139-dda1-4822-a685-680acd0f04be\', \'multiverseId\': 530716}, \'multiverseid\': 530716}, {\'name\': \'Dragón azul\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAliento de relámpago — Cuando el Dragón azul\\nentre al campo de batalla, hasta tu próximo turno, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene -3/-0, hasta una otra criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-0 y hasta una otra criatura objetivo obtiene -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11ba467a-37c0-418e-88da-a98470d86891\', \'multiverseId\': 530728}, \'multiverseid\': 530728}, {\'name\': \'Dragon bleu\', \'text\': "Vol\\nSouffle de foudre— Quand le Dragon bleu arrive\\nsur le champ de bataille, jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -3/-0, jusqu\'à une autre créature ciblée gagne -2/-0 et jusqu\'à une autre créature ciblée gagne -1/-0.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530740&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26306d2b-7d16-44c2-94cd-90b9a2bd26dd\', \'multiverseId\': 530740}, \'multiverseid\': 530740}, {\'name\': \'Drago Blu\', \'text\': "Volare\\nSoffio di Fulmini — Quando il Drago Blu\\nentra nel campo di battaglia, fino al tuo prossimo turno, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -3/-0, fino a un\'altra creatura bersaglio prende -2/-0 e fino a un\'altra creatura bersaglio prende -1/-0.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fcd854c-41f0-4d87-bfc4-8e9f598fae61\', \'multiverseId\': 530752}, \'multiverseid\': 530752}, {\'name\': \'ブルー・ドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行、\\n電撃のブレス — ブルー・ドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、それ以外のクリーチャー最大１体と、それら以外のクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。次のあなたのターンまで、その第１者が－３/－０の修整を受け、その第２者が－２/－０の修整を受け、その第３者が－１/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26fb7b92-99fe-42b9-88b8-ffd4a017fb92\', \'multiverseId\': 530764}, \'multiverseid\': 530764}, {\'name\': \'푸른 용\', \'text\': \'비행\\n번개 숨결— 푸른 용이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정하고 다른 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정하고 또 다른 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 당신의 다음 턴까지, 첫 번째 목표는 -3/-0을, 두번째 목표는 -2/-0을, 세 번째 목표는 -1/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9255d795-6649-41c2-aa25-435c37708177\', \'multiverseId\': 530776}, \'multiverseid\': 530776}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Azul\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nSopro elétrico — Quando Dragão Azul\\nentrar no campo de batalha, até seu próximo turno, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -3/-0, até uma outra criatura alvo recebe -2/-0, e até uma outra criatura alvo recebe -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b88fc50f-f491-4cb5-8b9b-50f9e0736c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 530788}, \'multiverseid\': 530788}, {\'name\': \'Синий Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nДыхание молнии — Когда Синий Дракон выходит на поле битвы, до вашего следующего хода целевое существо под контролем оппонента получает -3/-0, не более одного другого целевого существа получает -2/-0, и не более одного другого целевого существа получает -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d34aa429-4bef-4d9a-affa-6d65a11fd765\', \'multiverseId\': 530800}, \'multiverseid\': 530800}, {\'name\': \'蓝龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n闪电喷吐～当蓝龙进战场时，直到你的下一个回合，目标由对手操控的生物得-3/-0，至多另一个目标生物得-2/-0，且至多再另一个目标生物得-1/-0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f56736d-a233-4e0b-ac92-df9b57b606c2\', \'multiverseId\': 530812}, \'multiverseid\': 530812}, {\'name\': \'藍龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n閃電噴吐～當藍龍進戰場時，直到你的下一個回合，目標由對手操控的生物得-3/-0，至多另一個目標生物得-2/-0，且至多再另一個目標生物得-1/-0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59986c8f-943b-461b-8715-bc444cba5899\', \'multiverseId\': 530824}, \'multiverseid\': 530824}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brennende Hände\', \'text\': \'Die Brennenden Hände fügen einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls jene bleibende Karte grün ist, fügen ihr die Brennenden Hände stattdessen 6 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ein einfacher Feuerzauber, der zusammen mit demjenigen, der ihn wirkt, an Intensität zunimmt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527682&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e038cf44-9d9f-465f-8d63-4abe05da55ea\', \'multiverseId\': 527682}, \'multiverseid\': 527682}, {\'name\': \'Manos ardientes\', \'text\': \'Las Manos ardientes hacen 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo. Si ese permanente es verde, en vez de eso, las Manos ardientes hacen 6 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Un conjuro de fuego sencillo que aumenta en intensidad con su lanzador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'030b1d01-c758-4398-8570-18155643230d\', \'multiverseId\': 527943}, \'multiverseid\': 527943}, {\'name\': \'Mains brûlantes\', \'text\': \'Les Mains brûlantes infligent 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker. Si ce permanent est vert, les Mains brûlantes infligent 6 blessures à la place.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Un simple sort de feu qui évolue en intensité avec son lanceur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528204&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'579c0505-dbf9-470b-bc4d-b40a68fdde48\', \'multiverseId\': 528204}, \'multiverseid\': 528204}, {\'name\': \'Mani Brucianti\', \'text\': \'Le Mani Brucianti infliggono 2 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio. Se quel permanente è verde, le Mani Brucianti infliggono invece 6 danni.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Una semplice magia di fuoco la cui intensità cresce con il potere dell\'incantatore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fb194ee-0741-4370-a30a-a9b5e1fcd9f2\', \'multiverseId\': 528465}, \'multiverseid\': 528465}, {\'name\': \'バーニング・ハンズ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。バーニング・ハンズはそれに2点のダメージを与える。そのパーマネントが緑であるなら、代わりにバーニング・ハンズはそれに６点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'唱える者と共に激しさが増す、簡単な炎の呪文。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d23da56-0d80-4a0e-82eb-288da8356f02\', \'multiverseId\': 528726}, \'multiverseid\': 528726}, {\'name\': \'불타는 손\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 불타는 손은 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다. 그 지속물이 녹색이라면, 불타는 손은 대신 피해 6점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'주문을 발동한 자와 함께 그 격렬함을 키워나가는 간단한 화염 주문이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1554e1d9-72c7-4ca1-8a70-7dbf237bccef\', \'multiverseId\': 528986}, \'multiverseid\': 528986}, {\'name\': \'Mãos Flamejantes\', \'text\': \'Mãos Flamejantes causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo. Se aquela permanente for verde, em vez isso, Mãos Flamejantes causará 6 pontos de dano.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Uma mágica de fogo simples, cuja intensidade cresce com seu conjurador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b2c5cca-db1e-4676-96bc-2fb385296b3f\', \'multiverseId\': 529247}, \'multiverseid\': 529247}, {\'name\': \'Пылающие Руки\', \'text\': "Пылающие Руки наносят 2 повреждения целевому существу или planeswalker\'у. Если тот перманент зеленый, вместо этого Пылающие Руки наносят 6 повреждений.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Простое огненное заклинание, которое усиливается вместе с колдующим.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54e5cc70-1b6e-4a13-9d6f-99c37d40bd89\', \'multiverseId\': 529508}, \'multiverseid\': 529508}, {\'name\': \'燃烧之手\', \'text\': \'燃烧之手对目标生物或鹏洛客造成2点伤害。如果该永久物是绿色，则改为燃烧之手造成6点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'这单纯的火焰咒语随着施放者增长威力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d3b575e-013d-4e37-bfe7-99b0b8491b6f\', \'multiverseId\': 529768}, \'multiverseid\': 529768}, {\'name\': \'燃燒之手\', \'text\': \'燃燒之手對目標生物或鵬洛客造成2點傷害。如果該永久物是綠色，則改為燃燒之手造成6點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'這單純的火焰咒語隨著施放者增長威力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0491a5d2-d25a-4faf-956a-ba9c73935ed2\', \'multiverseId\': 530028}, \'multiverseid\': 530028}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bruenor Heldenhammer\', \'text\': \'Jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, erhält +2/+0 für jede an sie angelegte Ausrüstung.\\nFür die erste Ausrüsten-Fähigkeit, die du pro Zug aktivierst, kannst du {0} bezahlen, anstatt ihre Ausrüstungskosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zwerg, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich wusste doch, dass ich dich in Schwierigkeiten vorfinden würde, wenn ich hier draußen nach dir suchte!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527766&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ee99168-4476-40ca-95cd-dc786495d7f6\', \'multiverseId\': 527766}, \'multiverseid\': 527766}, {\'name\': \'Bruenor Martillo de Batalla\', \'text\': \'Cada criatura que controlas obtiene +2/+0 por cada Equipo anexado a ella.\\nPuedes pagar {0} en vez de pagar el coste de equipar de la primera habilidad de equipar que actives cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero enano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Sabía que te encontraría en un apuro si salía a buscarte!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2dd4452-3567-44b8-8fc5-bf79c8f3ca83\', \'multiverseId\': 528027}, \'multiverseid\': 528027}, {\'name\': \'Bruenor Marteaudeguerre\', \'text\': "Chaque créature que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+0 pour chaque équipement qui lui est attaché.\\nVous pouvez payer {0} à la place du coût d\'équipement de la première capacité d\'équipement que vous activez à chaque tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : nain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« J\'savais que j\'te trouverais dans la mouise si j\'partais à ta recherche ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528288&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f912c0cb-c909-4b9a-bed4-2bcb9567a79f\', \'multiverseId\': 528288}, \'multiverseid\': 528288}, {\'name\': \'Bruenor Battlehammer\', \'text\': \'Ogni creatura che controlli prende +2/+0 per ogni Equipaggiamento assegnato ad essa.\\nPuoi pagare {0} invece di pagare il costo di equipaggiare della prima abilità equipaggiare che attivi in ogni turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo sapevo che ti avrei trovato nei guai se fossi venuto a cercarti!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'395d9133-4aa7-4ef6-bb17-9914940bee13\', \'multiverseId\': 528549}, \'multiverseid\': 528549}, {\'name\': \'ブルーノー・バトルハンマー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーは、それぞれ自身についている装備品１つにつき＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\nあなたは、各ターンで初めてあなたが起動する装備能力の装備コストを支払うのではなく{0}を支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドワーフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「お前を見つけたらきっと問題に巻き込まれているだろうと確信していたぜ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a3dab0c-968e-400e-81cd-e82a6d559571\', \'multiverseId\': 528810}, \'multiverseid\': 528810}, {\'name\': \'브루노 배틀해머\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 각 생물은 그 생물에 부착된 장비의 수만큼 +2/+0을 받는다.\\n당신이 매 턴 처음으로 활성화하는 장착 능력은 장착 비용 대신 {0}을 지불할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 드워프 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"곤란해하고 있을 줄 알고 찾으러 나왔지!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dfc264f-0be0-4130-9c00-bbc23407e3bd\', \'multiverseId\': 529070}, \'multiverseid\': 529070}, {\'name\': \'Bruenor Martelo de Batalha\', \'text\': \'Cada criatura que você controla recebe +2/+0 para cada Equipamento anexado a ela.\\nVocê pode pagar {0} em vez de pagar o custo de equipar da primeira habilidade equipar que você ativar a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anão Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Sabia que ia te achar numa roubada se saísse pra te procurar!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff1e74f5-482e-4271-bf41-35257be3dae1\', \'multiverseId\': 529331}, \'multiverseid\': 529331}, {\'name\': \'Бренор Боевой Молот\', \'text\': \'Каждое существо под вашим контролем получает +2/+0 за каждое прикрепленное к нему Снаряжение.\\nВы можете заплатить {0} вместо оплаты стоимости первой способности «Снарядить», которую вы активируете в каждом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гном Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Так и знал, что если пойду вас искать, то найду в какой-нибудь передряге».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27a79aeb-6c40-4ebd-9377-c1c9511701c2\', \'multiverseId\': 529592}, \'multiverseid\': 529592}, {\'name\': \'布鲁诺战锤\', \'text\': \'对每个由你操控的生物而言，其上每贴附一个武具，便得+2/+0。\\n对你每回合首度起动的佩带异能而言，你可以支付{0}，而不支付其佩带费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～矮人／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「就知道我每次去找你，你都会有麻烦！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f718607-a6ac-4273-96a6-22d5ec98c778\', \'multiverseId\': 529852}, \'multiverseid\': 529852}, {\'name\': \'布魯諾戰鎚\', \'text\': \'對每個由你操控的生物而言，其上每貼附一個武具，便得+2/+0。\\n你每回合首度起動佩帶異能時可以支付{0}，而不支付其佩帶費用。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～矮人／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「就知道我每次去找你，你都會有麻煩！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67e78129-1387-4815-ad7d-c89d4f27884e\', \'multiverseId\': 530112}, \'multiverseid\': 530112}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bruenor Heldenhammer\', \'text\': \'Jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, erhält +2/+0 für jede an sie angelegte Ausrüstung.\\nFür die erste Ausrüsten-Fähigkeit, die du pro Zug aktivierst, kannst du {0} bezahlen, anstatt ihre Ausrüstungskosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zwerg, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531022&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99bb7216-3cc2-49b1-b235-2052d8d60a51\', \'multiverseId\': 531022}, \'multiverseid\': 531022}, {\'name\': \'Bruenor Martillo de Batalla\', \'text\': \'Cada criatura que controlas obtiene +2/+0 por cada Equipo anexado a ella.\\nPuedes pagar {0} en vez de pagar el coste de equipar de la primera habilidad de equipar que actives cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero enano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33745f23-2817-4ef2-ba66-73b191d9a82e\', \'multiverseId\': 531073}, \'multiverseid\': 531073}, {\'name\': \'Bruenor Marteaudeguerre\', \'text\': "Chaque créature que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+0 pour chaque équipement qui lui est attaché.\\nVous pouvez payer {0} à la place du coût d\'équipement de la première capacité d\'équipement que vous activez à chaque tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : nain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531124&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1817f36b-2fec-43dd-895a-20970c99b0d7\', \'multiverseId\': 531124}, \'multiverseid\': 531124}, {\'name\': \'Bruenor Battlehammer\', \'text\': \'Ogni creatura che controlli prende +2/+0 per ogni Equipaggiamento assegnato ad essa.\\nPuoi pagare {0} invece di pagare il costo di equipaggiare della prima abilità equipaggiare che attivi in ogni turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Nano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1851059c-8526-4528-a108-4022e3bfcdb3\', \'multiverseId\': 531175}, \'multiverseid\': 531175}, {\'name\': \'ブルーノー・バトルハンマー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーは、それぞれそれについている装備品１つにつき＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\nあなたは、各ターンで初めてあなたが起動する装備能力の装備コストを支払うのではなく{0}を支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドワーフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20d43100-66f5-48d6-adea-328fb7d670f6\', \'multiverseId\': 531226}, \'multiverseid\': 531226}, {\'name\': \'브루노 배틀해머\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 각 생물은 그 생물에 부착된 장비의 수만큼 +2/+0을 받는다.\\n당신이 매 턴 처음으로 활성화하는 장착 능력은 장착 비용 대신 {0}을 지불할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 드워프 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2f41016-48f2-4b8f-a720-637621885854\', \'multiverseId\': 531277}, \'multiverseid\': 531277}, {\'name\': \'Bruenor Martelo de Batalha\', \'text\': \'Cada criatura que você controla recebe +2/+0 para cada Equipamento anexado a ela.\\nVocê pode pagar {0} em vez de pagar o custo de equipar da primeira habilidade equipar que você ativar a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anão Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99fa3b49-a706-439d-ae48-d1535d13877f\', \'multiverseId\': 531328}, \'multiverseid\': 531328}, {\'name\': \'Бренор Боевой Молот\', \'text\': \'Каждое существо под вашим контролем получает +2/+0 за каждое прикрепленное к нему Снаряжение.\\nВы можете заплатить {0} вместо оплаты стоимости первой способности «Снарядить», которую вы активируете в каждом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гном Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'797a936c-2fcc-4ada-83f5-ab2e51aca71a\', \'multiverseId\': 531379}, \'multiverseid\': 531379}, {\'name\': \'布鲁诺战锤\', \'text\': \'对每个由你操控的生物而言，其上每贴附一个武具，便得+2/+0。\\n你每回合首度起动佩带异能时可以支付{0}，而不支付其佩带费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～矮人／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08aee338-ff8a-4357-9470-6657fbb0cb0a\', \'multiverseId\': 531430}, \'multiverseid\': 531430}, {\'name\': \'布魯諾戰鎚\', \'text\': \'對每個由你操控的生物而言，其上每貼附一個武具，便得+2/+0。\\n你每回合首度起動佩帶異能時可以支付{0}，而不支付其佩帶費用。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～矮人／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a7f8643-e876-471f-9867-3f3f0b7f3b1d\', \'multiverseId\': 531481}, \'multiverseid\': 531481}]', '[{\'name\': \'Buch der niederträchtigen Dunkelheit\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug 2 oder mehr Lebenspunkte verloren hast, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{T}, schicke das Buch der niederträchtigen Dunkelheit sowie Artefakte namens Auge des Vecna und Hand des Vecna, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil: Erzeuge Vecna, einen legendären 8/8 schwarzen Zombie-Gott-Kreaturenspielstein mit Unzerstörbarkeit. Er erhält alle ausgelösten Fähigkeiten der ins Exil geschickten Karten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527638&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d58d7525-bf4c-4d62-b8f0-dde056aca24a\', \'multiverseId\': 527638}, \'multiverseid\': 527638}, {\'name\': \'El Libro de la Oscuridad Vil\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si perdiste 2 o más vidas este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.\\n{T}, exiliar El Libro de la Oscuridad Vil y los artefactos que controlas llamados Ojo de Vecna y Mano de Vecna: Crea a Vecna, una ficha de criatura legendaria Deidad Zombie negra 8/8 con la habilidad de indestructible. Gana todas las habilidades disparadas de las cartas exiliadas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5f8c06a-1436-44c4-a71f-d3af55247002\', \'multiverseId\': 527899}, \'multiverseid\': 527899}, {\'name\': \'Le livre de noire vilénie\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous avez perdu au moins 2 points de vie ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\\n{T}, exilez Le livre de noire vilénie et les artefacts que vous contrôlez appelés Œil de Vecna et Main de Vecna : Créez Vecna, un jeton de créature légendaire 8/8 noire Zombie et Dieu avec l\'indestructible. Il acquiert toutes les capacités déclenchées des cartes exilées.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528160&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c41dd7ec-64a6-41f9-b2e3-a4a86135ca8f\', \'multiverseId\': 528160}, \'multiverseid\': 528160}, {\'name\': \'Il Libro delle Fosche Tenebre\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se hai perso 2 o più punti vita in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera.\\n{T}, Esilia Il Libro delle Fosche Tenebre e gli artefatti che controlli chiamati Occhio di Vecna e Mano di Vecna: Crea Vecna, una pedina creatura leggendaria Dio Zombie 8/8 nera con indistruttibile. Ha tutte le abilità innescate delle carte esiliate.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c30dea6-87ea-44df-b8f1-449d1017e6b9\', \'multiverseId\': 528421}, \'multiverseid\': 528421}, {\'name\': \'不浄なる暗黒の書\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが２点以上のライフを失っていた場合、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{T}, 不浄なる暗黒の書と、あなたがコントロールしている「アイ・オヴ・ヴェクナ」という名前のアーティファクト１つと「ハンド・オヴ・ヴェクナ」という名前のアーティファクト１つを追放する：「ヴェクナ」という名前で破壊不能を持つ黒の８/８の伝説のゾンビ・神・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それはそれらの追放されたカードのすべての誘発型能力を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0661312b-3cee-4917-9b3c-65e557f79dac\', \'multiverseId\': 528682}, \'multiverseid\': 528682}, {\'name\': \'비열한 어둠의 책\', \'text\': \'당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신이 이번 턴에 생명 2점 이상을 잃었다면, 2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{T}, 비열한 어둠의 책 및 당신이 조종하며 이름이 베크나의 눈인 마법물체 및 이름이 베크나의 손인 마법물체를 추방한다: 이름이 베크나이며 무적을 가진 전설적 8/8 흑색 좀비 신 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 베크나는 추방된 카드들의 모든 격발능력을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a09a175b-2b42-4191-8cb6-9441ba187edd\', \'multiverseId\': 528942}, \'multiverseid\': 528942}, {\'name\': \'O Livro da Vil Escuridão\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, se você perdeu 2 ou mais pontos de vida neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura Zumbi preta 2/2.\\n{T}, exile O Livro da Vil Escuridão e artefatos que você controla com os nomes Olho de Vecna e Mão de Vecna: Crie Vecna, uma ficha de criatura Zumbi Deus preta 8/8 com indestrutível. Ela ganha todas as habilidades desencadeadas dos cards exilados.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96c77bf7-880e-47e6-84ac-63f5214e6e65\', \'multiverseId\': 529203}, \'multiverseid\': 529203}, {\'name\': \'Книга Мерзкой Тьмы\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего заключительного шага, если в этом ходу вы потеряли 2 или более жизни, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби.\\n{T}, изгоните Книгу Мерзкой Тьмы и артефакты под вашим контролем с именами Глаз Векны и Рука Векны: создайте Векну, фишку легендарного существа 8/8 черный Зомби Бог с Неразрушимостью. Она получает все срабатывающие способности тех изгнанных карт.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3713905-8b0b-4608-b8de-fd4555c7ad15\', \'multiverseId\': 529464}, \'multiverseid\': 529464}, {\'name\': \'秽暗之书\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中失去了2点或更多生命，则派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\\n{T}，放逐秽暗之书和由你操控且名称为威可那法眼与威可那魔手的神器：派出传奇衍生生物威可那，其为8/8黑色，具不灭异能的灵俑／神。它获得所放逐之牌的所有触发式异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fd9ee33-2046-4128-9a55-1a36ae5eee79\', \'multiverseId\': 529724}, \'multiverseid\': 529724}, {\'name\': \'穢暗之書\', \'text\': \'在你的結束步驟開始時，若你本回合中失去了2點或更多生命，則派出一個2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物。\\n{T}，放逐穢暗之書和由你操控且名稱為威可那法眼與威可那魔手的神器：派出傳奇衍生生物威可那，其為8/8黑色，具不滅異能的殭屍／神。它獲得所放逐之牌的所有觸發式異能。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b58ad91-445b-4884-8cf1-496206bb4ae0\', \'multiverseId\': 529984}, \'multiverseid\': 529984}]', '[{\'name\': \'Buch der niederträchtigen Dunkelheit\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug 2 oder mehr Lebenspunkte verloren hast, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{T}, schicke das Buch der niederträchtigen Dunkelheit sowie Artefakte namens Auge des Vecna und Hand des Vecna, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil: Erzeuge Vecna, einen legendären 8/8 schwarzen Zombie-Gott-Kreaturenspielstein mit Unzerstörbarkeit. Er erhält alle ausgelösten Fähigkeiten der ins Exil geschickten Karten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530532&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f43eac9c-ba45-4b0e-9111-c430f601aeb6\', \'multiverseId\': 530532}, \'multiverseid\': 530532}, {\'name\': \'El Libro de la Oscuridad Vil\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si perdiste 2 o más vidas este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.\\n{T}, exiliar El Libro de la Oscuridad Vil y los artefactos que controlas llamados Ojo de Vecna y Mano de Vecna: Crea a Vecna, una ficha de criatura legendaria Deidad Zombie negra 8/8 con la habilidad de indestructible. Gana todas las habilidades disparadas de las cartas exiliadas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12e578c9-e333-45a7-9d1b-35a4ba2cdb16\', \'multiverseId\': 530569}, \'multiverseid\': 530569}, {\'name\': \'Le livre de noire vilénie\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous avez perdu au moins 2 points de vie ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\\n{T}, exilez Le livre de noire vilénie et les artefacts que vous contrôlez appelés Œil de Vecna et Main de Vecna : Créez Vecna, un jeton de créature légendaire 8/8 noire Zombie et Dieu avec l\'indestructible. Il acquiert toutes les capacités déclenchées des cartes exilées.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530606&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd0a1248-894c-4223-9f21-80cad87ded59\', \'multiverseId\': 530606}, \'multiverseid\': 530606}, {\'name\': \'Il Libro delle Fosche Tenebre\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se hai perso 2 o più punti vita in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera.\\n{T}, Esilia Il Libro delle Fosche Tenebre e gli artefatti che controlli chiamati Occhio di Vecna e Mano di Vecna: Crea Vecna, una pedina creatura leggendaria Dio Zombie 8/8 nera con indistruttibile. Ha tutte le abilità innescate delle carte esiliate.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc559fd0-366e-421b-a57d-8e17010a075d\', \'multiverseId\': 530643}, \'multiverseid\': 530643}, {\'name\': \'不浄なる暗黒の書\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが2点以上のライフを失っていた場合、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{T}, 不浄なる暗黒の書と、あなたがコントロールしている「アイ・オヴ・ヴェクナ」という名前のアーティファクト１つと「ハンド・オヴ・ヴェクナ」という名前のアーティファクト１つを追放する：「ヴェクナ」という名前で破壊不能を持つ黒の８/８の伝説のゾンビ・神・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それはそれらの追放されたカードのすべての誘発型能力を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'668708c0-7b49-4432-b0e5-a7aef1f98429\', \'multiverseId\': 530680}, \'multiverseid\': 530680}]', '[{\'name\': \'Buch der überschwänglichen Taten\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, erzeuge einen 3/3 weißen Engel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T}, schicke das Buch der überschwänglichen Taten ins Exil: Lege eine Erleuchtungsmarke auf einen Engel deiner Wahl. Er erhält „Du kannst die Partie nicht verlieren, und deine Gegner können die Partie nicht gewinnen." Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86847555-0617-40ba-8e3e-e2a32a3d7dfe\', \'multiverseId\': 527551}, \'multiverseid\': 527551}, {\'name\': \'El Libro de las Obras Elevadas\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si ganaste 3 o más vidas este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Ángel blanca 3/3 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T}, exiliar El Libro de las Obras Elevadas: Pon un contador de iluminación sobre el Ángel objetivo. Gana "Tú no puedes perder el juego y tus oponentes no pueden ganar el juego". Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4c5e340-ebe4-45ed-9872-16da2615d1d9\', \'multiverseId\': 527812}, \'multiverseid\': 527812}, {\'name\': "Le livre d\'exaltation suprême", \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous avez gagné au moins 3 points de vie ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 blanche Ange avec le vol.\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T}, exilez Le livre d\'exaltation suprême : Mettez un marqueur « éclairé » sur un ange ciblé. Il acquiert « Vous ne pouvez pas perdre la partie et vos adversaires ne peuvent pas la gagner. » N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528073&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57025466-0311-4adf-9dea-9d35a387c481\', \'multiverseId\': 528073}, \'multiverseid\': 528073}, {\'name\': \'Il Libro delle Imprese Eroiche\', \'text\': \'All\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se hai guadagnato 3 o più punti vita in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Angelo 3/3 bianca con volare.\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T}, Esilia Il Libro delle Imprese Eroiche: Metti un segnalino illuminazione su un Angelo bersaglio. Ha "Non puoi perdere la partita e i tuoi avversari non possono vincere la partita". Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a84c16a-c5ae-4457-9e42-22963077f897\', \'multiverseId\': 528334}, \'multiverseid\': 528334}, {\'name\': \'高貴なる行いの書\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが３点以上のライフを得ていた場合、飛行を持つ白の３/３の天使・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T},高貴なる行いの書を追放する：天使１体を対象とする。それの上に悟りカウンター１個を置く。それは「あなたはこのゲームに敗北することができず、対戦相手はこのゲームに勝利することができない」を得る。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ba60fa3-9e94-4d65-b8b6-38bdbee0145c\', \'multiverseId\': 528595}, \'multiverseid\': 528595}, {\'name\': \'고귀한 행위의 책\', \'text\': \'당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신이 이번 턴에 생명 3점 이상을 얻었다면, 비행을 가진 3/3 백색 천사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T}, 고귀한 행위의 책을 추방한다: 천사를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 계몽 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 "당신은 게임에서 패배할 수 없으며 당신의 상대들은 게임에서 승리할 수 없다."를 얻는다. 집중마법 시기에만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b722d80-4e7f-4fe6-8ca2-34846a98c0ed\', \'multiverseId\': 528855}, \'multiverseid\': 528855}, {\'name\': \'O Livro dos Feitos Exaltados\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, se você ganhou 3 ou mais pontos de vida neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura Anjo branca 3/3 com voar.\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T}, exile O Livro dos Feitos Exaltados: Coloque um marcador de iluminação no Anjo alvo. Ele ganha "Você não pode perder o jogo e seus oponentes não podem vencer o jogo". Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bed6feb-0b0b-458e-8372-20be8ebb4b22\', \'multiverseId\': 529116}, \'multiverseid\': 529116}, {\'name\': \'Книга Возвышенных Деяний\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего заключительного шага, если в этом ходу вы получили 3 или более жизни, создайте одну фишку существа 3/3 белый Ангел с Полетом.\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T}, изгоните Книгу Возвышенных Деяний: положите один жетон просветления на целевого Ангела. Он получает способность «Вы не можете проиграть партию, а ваши оппоненты не могут выиграть партию». Активируйте только как волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06de5c7c-5fb7-4976-84b0-81f73f77b4df\', \'multiverseId\': 529377}, \'multiverseid\': 529377}, {\'name\': \'圣洁之书\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中获得了3点或更多生命，则派出一个3/3白色，具飞行异能的天使衍生生物。\\n{W}{W}{W}，{T}，放逐圣洁之书：在目标天使上放置一个启化指示物。它获得「你这盘游戏不会输，对手也不会赢。」只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07251d32-a629-4595-86c2-0673ff3fca14\', \'multiverseId\': 529637}, \'multiverseid\': 529637}, {\'name\': \'聖潔之書\', \'text\': \'在你的結束步驟開始時，若你本回合中獲得了3點或更多生命，則派出一個3/3白色，具飛行異能的天使衍生生物。\\n{W}{W}{W}，{T}，放逐聖潔之書：在目標天使上放置一個啟化指示物。它獲得「你這盤遊戲不會輸，對手也不會贏。」只能於巫術時機起動。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'909e0b49-ef60-41b0-b5e6-a2d5d7dc8f38\', \'multiverseId\': 529897}, \'multiverseid\': 529897}]', '[{\'name\': \'Buch der überschwänglichen Taten\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug 3 oder mehr Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, erzeuge einen 3/3 weißen Engel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T}, schicke das Buch der überschwänglichen Taten ins Exil: Lege eine Erleuchtungsmarke auf einen Engel deiner Wahl. Er erhält „Du kannst die Partie nicht verlieren, und deine Gegner können die Partie nicht gewinnen." Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530517&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d1a9b65-63de-48a6-aef8-01a9b8d56add\', \'multiverseId\': 530517}, \'multiverseid\': 530517}, {\'name\': \'El Libro de las Obras Elevadas\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, si ganaste 3 o más vidas este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Ángel blanca 3/3 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T}, exiliar El Libro de las Obras Elevadas: Pon un contador de iluminación sobre el Ángel objetivo. Gana "Tú no puedes perder el juego y tus oponentes no pueden ganar el juego". Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7d47a1e-d5a3-4a2f-8cc7-bcc6945a045b\', \'multiverseId\': 530554}, \'multiverseid\': 530554}, {\'name\': "Le livre d\'exaltation suprême", \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, si vous avez gagné au moins 3 points de vie ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 blanche Ange avec le vol.\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T}, exilez Le livre d\'exaltation suprême : Mettez un marqueur « éclairé » sur un ange ciblé. Il acquiert « Vous ne pouvez pas perdre la partie et vos adversaires ne peuvent pas la gagner. » N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530591&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5332cb9f-b341-490a-a28e-a9a455277a00\', \'multiverseId\': 530591}, \'multiverseid\': 530591}, {\'name\': \'Il Libro delle Imprese Eroiche\', \'text\': \'All\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se hai guadagnato 3 o più punti vita in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Angelo 3/3 bianca con volare.\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T}, Esilia Il Libro delle Imprese Eroiche: Metti un segnalino illuminazione su un Angelo bersaglio. Ha "Non puoi perdere la partita e i tuoi avversari non possono vincere la partita". Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b7c1a5-8615-4407-ac5d-7ce6184fd8c3\', \'multiverseId\': 530628}, \'multiverseid\': 530628}, {\'name\': \'高貴なる行いの書\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが３点以上のライフを得ていた場合、飛行を持つ白の３/３の天使・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{W}{W}{W}, {T},高貴なる行いの書を追放する：天使１体を対象とする。それの上に悟りカウンター１個を置く。それは「あなたはこのゲームに敗北することができず、対戦相手はこのゲームに勝利することができない」を得る。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06ad4bec-356b-496f-9a15-ee15edb9826a\', \'multiverseId\': 530665}, \'multiverseid\': 530665}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaoskanalisierer\', \'text\': \'Woge der Wilden Magie — Immer wenn der Chaoskanalisierer angreift, würfle einen W20.\\n1—9 | Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\\n10—19 | Schicke die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\\n20 | Schicke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527683&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f8d46c4-c7aa-4061-9787-50607ea83de1\', \'multiverseId\': 527683}, \'multiverseid\': 527683}, {\'name\': \'Canalizador del caos\', \'text\': \'Sobrecarga de magia salvaje — Siempre que el Canalizador del caos ataque, tira 1d20.\\n1—9 | Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\\n10—19 | Exilia las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugarlas este turno.\\n20 | Exilia las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugarlas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64853362-5c4d-4fd4-b298-6a84d70f9555\', \'multiverseId\': 527944}, \'multiverseid\': 527944}, {\'name\': \'Canaliseur de chaos\', \'text\': \'Déferlement de magie sauvage — À chaque fois que le Canaliseur de chaos attaque, lancez un d20.\\n1—9 | Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la jouer ce tour-ci.\\n10—19 | Exilez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez les jouer ce tour-ci.\\n20 | Exilez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez les jouer ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528205&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'570286bf-a943-46ab-911e-3e7a4954f9da\', \'multiverseId\': 528205}, \'multiverseid\': 528205}, {\'name\': \'Incanalatore del Caos\', \'text\': "Impulso di Magia Selvaggia — Ogniqualvolta l\'Incanalatore del Caos attacca, tira un d20.\\n1—9 | Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocarla in questo turno.\\n10—19 | Esilia le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocarle in questo turno.\\n20 | Esilia le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocarle in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78155d3d-e9b2-4534-9dd4-5f19f1fbd844\', \'multiverseId\': 528466}, \'multiverseid\': 528466}, {\'name\': \'混沌の媒介者\', \'text\': \'ワイルドマジックサージ — 混沌の媒介者が攻撃するたび、１個のd20を振る。\\n１—９| あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはそれをプレイしてもよい。\\n10—19 | あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはそれらをプレイしてもよい。\\n20 | あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはそれらをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb59b80-1364-436d-93ed-976c897be8ba\', \'multiverseId\': 528727}, \'multiverseid\': 528727}, {\'name\': \'혼돈 전달자\', \'text\': \'야생 마법 급등 — 혼돈 전달자가 공격할 때마다, 20면체를 굴린다.\\n1—9 | 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 추방한다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\\n10-19 | 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 두 장을 추방한다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 카드들을 플레이할 수 있다.\\n20 | 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 추방한다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 카드들을 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e69ebb10-1449-474b-b673-2d882f8e0b8e\', \'multiverseId\': 528987}, \'multiverseid\': 528987}, {\'name\': \'Canalizador do Caos\', \'text\': \'Surto de magia selvagem — Toda vez que Canalizador do Caos atacar, role um d20.\\n1—9 | Exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogá-lo neste turno.\\n10—19 | Exile os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogá-los neste turno.\\n20 | Exile os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogá-los neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'023e3226-1170-4277-a2e3-d3ae8bdbf018\', \'multiverseId\': 529248}, \'multiverseid\': 529248}, {\'name\': \'Проводник Хаоса\', \'text\': \'Выброс дикой магии — Каждый раз, когда Проводник Хаоса атакует, бросьте d20.\\n1—9 | Изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту в этом ходу.\\n10—19 | Изгоните две верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть их в этом ходу.\\n20 | Изгоните три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть их в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72bbec0d-6a1f-444a-8ec8-33170c4c1def\', \'multiverseId\': 529509}, \'multiverseid\': 529509}, {\'name\': \'混沌通联师\', \'text\': \'狂野魔法浪涌～每当混沌通联师攻击时，掷一颗d20。\\n1～9 | 放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\\n10～19 | 放逐你牌库顶的两张牌。本回合中，你可以使用这些牌。\\n20 | 放逐你牌库顶的三张牌。本回合中，你可以使用这些牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3070a967-5e60-4792-9b5e-5d21c6319a03\', \'multiverseId\': 529769}, \'multiverseid\': 529769}, {\'name\': \'混沌通聯師\', \'text\': \'狂野魔法浪湧～每當混沌通聯師攻擊時，擲一顆d20。\\n1～9 | 放逐你的牌庫頂牌。本回合中，你可以使用該牌。\\n10～19 | 放逐你牌庫頂的兩張牌。本回合中，你可以使用這些牌。\\n20 | 放逐你牌庫頂的三張牌。本回合中，你可以使用這些牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec8a03da-cf10-4d9c-a2e5-5a110cb16e02\', \'multiverseId\': 530029}, \'multiverseid\': 530029}]', '[{\'name\': \'Delina, Wilde Magierin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Delina, Wilde Magierin, angreift, bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, und würfle dann einen W20.\\n1—14 | Erzeuge einen getappten und angreifenden Spielstein, der eine Kopie jener Kreatur ist, außer dass er nicht legendär ist und „Schicke diese Kreatur am Ende des Kampfes ins Exil" hat.\\n15—20 | Erzeuge einen solchen Spielstein. Würfle erneut.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527685&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f6dfb3b-a51f-4722-9abc-899c5ed34885\', \'multiverseId\': 527685}, \'multiverseid\': 527685}, {\'name\': \'Delina, maga salvaje\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Delina, maga salvaje ataque, elige la criatura objetivo que controlas y luego tira 1d20.\\n1—14 | Crea una ficha girada y atacando que es una copia de esa criatura, excepto que no es legendaria y tiene "Exilia esta criatura al final del combate".\\n15—20 | Crea una de esas fichas. Tira de nuevo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f202eda-5bd0-40e0-9b4b-31d8ef461e82\', \'multiverseId\': 527946}, \'multiverseid\': 527946}, {\'name\': \'Délina, mage sauvage\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Délina, mage sauvage attaque, choisissez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, puis lancez un d20.\\n1—14 | Créez un jeton engagé et attaquant qui est une copie de cette créature, excepté qu\'il n\'est pas légendaire et qu\'il a « Exilez cette créature à la fin du combat ».\\n15—20 | Créez un de ces jetons. Relancez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528207&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255077c2-0892-46cb-b701-61cdae13b866\', \'multiverseId\': 528207}, \'multiverseid\': 528207}, {\'name\': \'Delina, Maga Selvaggia\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Delina, Maga Selvaggia attacca, scegli una creatura bersaglio che controlli, poi tira un d20.\\n1—14 | Crea una pedina TAPpata e attaccante che è una copia di quella creatura, tranne che non è leggendaria e ha "Esilia questa creatura alla fine del combattimento".\\n15—20 | Crea la pedina. Tira ancora.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e3b883-6ac2-4e4c-bebe-d0640ecba2fa\', \'multiverseId\': 528468}, \'multiverseid\': 528468}, {\'name\': \'暴走魔導士、デリーナ\', \'text\': \'暴走魔導士、デリーナが攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。１個のd20を振る。\\n１—14 | 伝説でなく「戦闘終了時にこのクリーチャーを追放する。」を持つことを除いてそのクリーチャーのコピーであるトークン１体をタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。\\n15—20 | そのトークン１体を生成する。再度１個のd20を振る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73dce312-e7f4-44a0-a0a6-9299bfc9ad6c\', \'multiverseId\': 528729}, \'multiverseid\': 528729}, {\'name\': \'야생 마도사, 델리나\', \'text\': \'야생 마도사, 델리나가 공격할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한 후, 20면체를 굴린다.\\n1—14 | 전설적이 아니고 "이 생물을 전투종료에 추방한다."를 가졌으며 탭되어 공격 중인 그 생물의 복사본을 만든다.\\n15—20 | 위와 같은 토큰 하나를 만든다. 다시 굴린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 엘프 주술사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e429bbb5-cd1a-47f2-88ab-bc78070a197b\', \'multiverseId\': 528989}, \'multiverseid\': 528989}, {\'name\': \'Delina, Maga Selvagem\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Delina, Maga Selvagem, atacar, escolha a criatura alvo que você controla e depois role um d20.\\n1—14 | Crie um ficha virada e atacando que seja uma cópia daquela criatura, com a exceção de não ser lendária e ter "Exile esta criatura no final do combate".\\n15—20 | Crie uma daquelas fichas. Role de novo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a0bd73a-6c2e-4aae-833f-61234d63f467\', \'multiverseId\': 529250}, \'multiverseid\': 529250}, {\'name\': \'Делина, Дикий Маг\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Делина, Дикий Маг атакует, выберите целевое существо под вашим контролем, затем бросьте d20.\\n1—14 | Создайте повернутую и атакующую фишку, которая является копией того существа, но при этом она не легендарная и имеет способность «Изгоните это существо в конце боя».\\n15—20 | Создайте одну такую фишку. Бросьте кубик еще раз.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльф Шаман\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b040639a-3165-4ff7-b43e-0775c8a98eec\', \'multiverseId\': 529511}, \'multiverseid\': 529511}, {\'name\': \'狂野法师德莉娜\', \'text\': \'每当狂野法师德莉娜攻击时，选择目标由你操控的生物，然后掷一颗d20。\\n1～14 | 派出一个为该生物之复制品的衍生物，其为横置且正进行攻击，但它不是传奇，且具有「在战斗结束时，放逐此生物。」\\n15～20 | 派出一个上述衍生物。再掷一次。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10290972-c2ca-4eee-b744-52852c96e448\', \'multiverseId\': 529771}, \'multiverseid\': 529771}, {\'name\': \'狂野法師德莉娜\', \'text\': \'每當狂野法師德莉娜攻擊時，選擇目標由你操控的生物，然後擲一顆d20。\\n1～14 | 派出一個為該生物之複製品的衍生物，其為橫置且正進行攻擊，但它不是傳奇，且具有「在戰鬥結束時，放逐此生物。」\\n15～20 | 派出一個上述衍生物。再擲一次。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～妖精／祭師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f14b308-584b-4617-9d4a-f28a0531094e\', \'multiverseId\': 530031}, \'multiverseid\': 530031}]', '[{\'name\': \'Delina, Wilde Magierin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Delina, Wilde Magierin, angreift, bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, und würfle dann einen W20.\\n1—14 | Erzeuge einen getappten und angreifenden Spielstein, der eine Kopie jener Kreatur ist, außer dass er nicht legendär ist und „Schicke diese Kreatur am Ende des Kampfes ins Exil" hat.\\n15—20 | Erzeuge einen solchen Spielstein. Würfle erneut.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531002&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90a25e41-0453-4a39-aeea-4bc304a84205\', \'multiverseId\': 531002}, \'multiverseid\': 531002}, {\'name\': \'Delina, maga salvaje\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Delina, maga salvaje ataque, elige la criatura objetivo que controlas y luego tira 1d20.\\n1—14 | Crea una ficha girada y atacando que es una copia de esa criatura, excepto que no es legendaria y tiene "Exilia esta criatura al final del combate".\\n15—20 | Crea una de esas fichas. Tira de nuevo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'010a039d-db3f-448a-bc7f-432016eb1074\', \'multiverseId\': 531053}, \'multiverseid\': 531053}, {\'name\': \'Délina, mage sauvage\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Délina, mage sauvage attaque, choisissez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, puis lancez un d20.\\n1—14 | Créez un jeton engagé et attaquant qui est une copie de cette créature, excepté qu\'il n\'est pas légendaire et qu\'il a « Exilez cette créature à la fin du combat ».\\n15—20 | Créez un de ces jetons. Relancez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531104&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17bcaa47-c247-4026-a85e-ff62b46b9e5e\', \'multiverseId\': 531104}, \'multiverseid\': 531104}, {\'name\': \'Delina, Maga Selvaggia\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Delina, Maga Selvaggia attacca, scegli una creatura bersaglio che controlli, poi tira un d20.\\n1—14 | Crea una pedina TAPpata e attaccante che è una copia di quella creatura, tranne che non è leggendaria e ha "Esilia questa creatura alla fine del combattimento".\\n15—20 | Crea la pedina. Tira ancora.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f1f08d3-2244-444b-b0ca-fbfe83f52a03\', \'multiverseId\': 531155}, \'multiverseid\': 531155}, {\'name\': \'暴走魔導士、デリーナ\', \'text\': \'暴走魔導士、デリーナが攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。１個のd20を振る。\\n１—14 | 伝説でなく「戦闘終了時にこのクリーチャーを追放する。」を持つことを除いてそのクリーチャーのコピーであるトークン１体をタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。\\n15—20 | そのトークン１体を生成する。再度d20を振る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fd66836-9217-4f1f-92e1-6f75041178a7\', \'multiverseId\': 531206}, \'multiverseid\': 531206}, {\'name\': \'야생 마도사, 델리나\', \'text\': \'야생 마도사, 델리나가 공격할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한 후, 20면체를 굴린다.\\n1—14 | 전설적이 아니고 "이 생물을 전투종료에 추방한다."를 가졌으며 탭되어 공격 중인 그 생물의 복사본을 만든다.\\n15—20 | 위와 같은 토큰 하나를 만든다. 다시 굴린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 엘프 주술사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36a457fc-2456-4c80-a1ba-a5b9efa03b33\', \'multiverseId\': 531257}, \'multiverseid\': 531257}, {\'name\': \'Delina, Maga Selvagem\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Delina, Maga Selvagem, atacar, escolha a criatura alvo que você controla e depois role um d20.\\n1—14 | Crie um ficha virada e atacando que seja uma cópia daquela criatura, com a exceção de não ser lendária e ter "Exile esta criatura no final do combate".\\n15—20 | Crie uma daquelas fichas. Role de novo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b7f209a-d330-43f4-b32c-2fc3efd0839d\', \'multiverseId\': 531308}, \'multiverseid\': 531308}, {\'name\': \'Делина, Дикий Маг\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Делина, Дикий Маг атакует, выберите целевое существо под вашим контролем, затем бросьте d20.\\n1—14 | Создайте повернутую и атакующую фишку, которая является копией того существа, но при этом она не легендарная и имеет способность «Изгоните это существо в конце боя».\\n15—20 | Создайте одну такую фишку. Бросьте кубик еще раз.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльф Шаман\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0afe5a34-9426-4d86-bbb6-fed92ec9a11d\', \'multiverseId\': 531359}, \'multiverseid\': 531359}, {\'name\': \'狂野法师德莉娜\', \'text\': \'每当狂野法师德莉娜攻击时，选择目标由你操控的生物，然后掷一颗d20。\\n1～14 | 派出一个为该生物之复制品的衍生物，其为横置且正进行攻击，但它不是传奇，且具有「在战斗结束时，放逐此生物。」\\n15～20 | 派出一个上述衍生物。再掷一次。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc2ffda1-fc9b-4462-aef5-878db1d2fb45\', \'multiverseId\': 531410}, \'multiverseid\': 531410}, {\'name\': \'狂野法師德莉娜\', \'text\': \'每當狂野法師德莉娜攻擊時，選擇目標由你操控的生物，然後擲一顆d20。\\n1～14 | 派出一個為該生物之複製品的衍生物，其為橫置且正進行攻擊，但它不是傳奇，且具有「在戰鬥結束時，放逐此生物。」\\n15～20 | 派出一個上述衍生物。再擲一次。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～妖精／祭師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02d9a1be-fb01-4376-89b3-03d8790a8a53\', \'multiverseId\': 531461}, \'multiverseid\': 531461}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demilich\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden Spontanzauber und jede Hexerei, den bzw. die du in diesem Zug gewirkt hast, {U} weniger.\\nImmer wenn der Demilich angreift, schicke bis zu eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Kopiere sie. Du kannst die Kopie wirken.\\nDu kannst den Demilich aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Kosten vier Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexereikarten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Skelett, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527600&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e98367d-7f4e-467c-bea3-ecf1a0e7cd8e\', \'multiverseId\': 527600}, \'multiverseid\': 527600}, {\'name\': \'Semiliche\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {U} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada hechizo de instantáneo y de conjuro que lanzaste este turno.\\nSiempre que el Semiliche ataque, exilia hasta una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio. Cópiala. Puedes lanzar la copia.\\nPuedes lanzar el Semiliche desde tu cementerio exiliando cuatro cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro de tu cementerio además de pagar sus otros costes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero esqueleto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af0b5c58-a5c5-4d67-93b7-9f6057ec1765\', \'multiverseId\': 527861}, \'multiverseid\': 527861}, {\'name\': \'Demi-liche\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {U} de moins à lancer pour chaque sort d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous avez lancé ce tour-ci.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Demi-liche attaque, exilez jusqu\'à une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée de votre cimetière. Copiez-la. Vous pouvez lancer la copie.\\nVous pouvez lancer la Demi-liche depuis votre cimetière en exilant quatre cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel de votre cimetière en plus de payer ses autres coûts.", \'type\': \'Créature : squelette et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528122&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28221391-5405-407e-9886-9a83eb8842f2\', \'multiverseId\': 528122}, \'multiverseid\': 528122}, {\'name\': \'Demilich\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {U} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni magia istantaneo e stregoneria che hai lanciato in questo turno.\\nOgniqualvolta il Demilich attacca, esilia fino a una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Copia quella carta. Puoi lanciare la copia.\\nPuoi lanciare il Demilich dal tuo cimitero esiliando quattro carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria dal tuo cimitero oltre a pagare i suoi altri costi.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Scheletro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fc9d8c4-43f6-46f9-8de9-ef8cf8ab5e4d\', \'multiverseId\': 528383}, \'multiverseid\': 528383}, {\'name\': \'デミリッチ\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、このターンにあなたが唱えたインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つにつき{U}少なくなる。\\nデミリッチが攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード最大１枚を対象とする。それを追放し、コピーする。あなたはそのコピーを唱えてもよい。\\nあなたはあなたの墓地にあるデミリッチを、他のコストの支払いに加えてあなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード４枚を追放することで唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スケルトン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96aebdfa-a8e6-4c14-acf6-8263b994bcd0\', \'multiverseId\': 528644}, \'multiverseid\': 528644}, {\'name\': \'데미리치\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 당신이 이 턴에 발동한 순간마법 및 집중마법 주문 한 개당 발동하는데 {U}가 덜 든다.\\n데미리치가 공격할 때마다, 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드를 최대 한 장까지 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다. 그 카드를 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본을 발동할 수 있다.\\n당신은 데미리치의 다른 비용을 지불하는 것에 더해 당신의 무덤에서 순간마법 및/또는 집중마법 카드 네 장을 추방해서 데미리치를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 해골 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d02bc4e-c347-446d-bf22-72434a8d07ee\', \'multiverseId\': 528904}, \'multiverseid\': 528904}, {\'name\': \'Demilich\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {U} a menos para ser conjurada para cada mágica instantânea e feitiço que você conjurou neste turno.\\nToda vez que Demilich atacar, exile até um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo de seu cemitério. Copie-o. Você pode conjurar a cópia.\\nVocê pode conjurar Demilich do seu cemitério exilando quatro cards de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço de seu cemitério além de pagar seus outros custos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esqueleto Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4e4def6-82c6-4eb4-af2d-582bff0d54be\', \'multiverseId\': 529165}, \'multiverseid\': 529165}, {\'name\': \'Демилич\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {U} меньше за каждое мгновенное заклинание и заклинание волшебства, которое вы разыграли в этом ходу.\\nКаждый раз, когда Демилич атакует, изгоните не более одной целевой карты мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища. Скопируйте ее. Вы можете разыграть ту копию.\\nВы можете разыграть Демилича из вашего кладбища, изгнав четыре карты мгновенных заклинаний и/или волшебства из вашего кладбища в дополнение к оплате других его стоимостей.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Скелет Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f53c59b3-7377-450f-9826-1e8a628db6a5\', \'multiverseId\': 529426}, \'multiverseid\': 529426}, {\'name\': \'半巫妖\', \'text\': \'你本回合中每施放过一个瞬间和法术咒语，此咒语便减少{U}来施放。\\n每当半巫妖攻击时，将至多一张目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场放逐。将其复制。你可以施放该复制品。\\n你可以从你的坟墓场中施放半巫妖，但在其他费用以外，还须从你的坟墓场放逐四张瞬间和／或法术牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～骷髅妖／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5414f9d3-872d-46c4-9020-33f314026b52\', \'multiverseId\': 529686}, \'multiverseid\': 529686}, {\'name\': \'半巫妖\', \'text\': \'你本回合中每施放過一個瞬間和巫術咒語，此咒語便減少{U}來施放。\\n每當半巫妖攻擊時，將至多一張目標瞬間或巫術牌從你的墳墓場放逐。將其複製。你可以施放該複製品。\\n你可以從你的墳墓場中施放半巫妖，但在其他費用以外，還須從你的墳墓場放逐四張瞬間和／或巫術牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～骷髏妖／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16ddda56-5430-4f6e-b5c0-f1635ca5bbdd\', \'multiverseId\': 529946}, \'multiverseid\': 529946}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demilich\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden Spontanzauber und jede Hexerei, den bzw. die du in diesem Zug gewirkt hast, {U} weniger.\\nImmer wenn der Demilich angreift, schicke bis zu eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Kopiere sie. Du kannst die Kopie wirken.\\nDu kannst den Demilich aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Kosten vier Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexereikarten aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Skelett, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530524&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01b7791f-df44-4569-b471-a62defb83092\', \'multiverseId\': 530524}, \'multiverseid\': 530524}, {\'name\': \'Semiliche\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {U} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada hechizo de instantáneo y de conjuro que lanzaste este turno.\\nSiempre que el Semiliche ataque, exilia hasta una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio. Cópiala. Puedes lanzar la copia.\\nPuedes lanzar el Semiliche desde tu cementerio exiliando cuatro cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro de tu cementerio además de pagar sus otros costes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero esqueleto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'638bb1c7-1877-4c27-9bc5-e9ffb5c5023b\', \'multiverseId\': 530561}, \'multiverseid\': 530561}, {\'name\': \'Demi-liche\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {U} de moins à lancer pour chaque sort d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous avez lancé ce tour-ci.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Demi-liche attaque, exilez jusqu\'à une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée de votre cimetière. Copiez-la. Vous pouvez lancer la copie.\\nVous pouvez lancer la Demi-liche depuis votre cimetière en exilant quatre cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel de votre cimetière en plus de payer ses autres coûts.", \'type\': \'Créature : squelette et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530598&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bc5bdcb-9c90-4b03-99e6-1f85c1fd8918\', \'multiverseId\': 530598}, \'multiverseid\': 530598}, {\'name\': \'Demilich\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {U} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni magia istantaneo e stregoneria che hai lanciato in questo turno.\\nOgniqualvolta il Demilich attacca, esilia fino a una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Copia quella carta. Puoi lanciare la copia.\\nPuoi lanciare il Demilich dal tuo cimitero esiliando quattro carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria dal tuo cimitero oltre a pagare i suoi altri costi.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Scheletro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b551ab4a-1a85-4b76-847c-6380216a2f79\', \'multiverseId\': 530635}, \'multiverseid\': 530635}, {\'name\': \'デミリッチ\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、このターンにあなたが唱えたインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つにつき{U}少なくなる。\\nデミリッチが攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード最大１枚を対象とする。それを追放し、コピーする。あなたはそのコピーを唱えてもよい。\\nあなたはあなたの墓地にあるデミリッチを、他のコストの支払いに加えてあなたの墓地からインスタントやソーサリーであるカード４枚を追放することで唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スケルトン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4772c313-c613-4c5b-bc64-d2c79ce7dcdc\', \'multiverseId\': 530672}, \'multiverseid\': 530672}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Schicksalskarten\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Würfle einen W20 und ziehe die Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand vom Ergebnis ab. Falls das Ergebnis 0 oder weniger ist, wirf alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab.\\n1—9 | Bringe eine per Zufall bestimmte Karte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n10—19 | Ziehe zwei Karten.\\n20 | Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte aus einem beliebigen Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Wenn jene Kreatur stirbt, verliert ihr Besitzer die Partie.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527788&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2603656-eacf-4063-a920-99bd2e022538\', \'multiverseId\': 527788}, \'multiverseid\': 527788}, {\'name\': \'La baraja de múltiples cosas\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Tira 1d20 y resta la cantidad de cartas en tu mano. Si el resultado es 0 o menos, descarta tu mano.\\n1—9 | Regresa una carta al azar de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\n10—19 | Roba dos cartas.\\n20 | Pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control una carta de criatura de cualquier cementerio. Cuando esa criatura muera, su propietario pierde el juego.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ead3355-28f2-4ee6-bb45-a6300bbdf9a3\', \'multiverseId\': 528049}, \'multiverseid\': 528049}, {\'name\': \'Les cartes merveilleuses\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Lancez un d20 et soustrayez le nombre de cartes de votre main au résultat. Si le résultat est inférieur ou égal à 0, défaussez-vous de votre main.\\n1—9 | Renvoyez une carte choisie au hasard depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\n10—19 | Piochez deux cartes.\\n20 | Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature de n\'importe quel cimetière. Quand cette créature meurt, son propriétaire perd la partie.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528310&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ab65e1e-fe93-4f09-bedc-062bea196d41\', \'multiverseId\': 528310}, \'multiverseid\': 528310}, {\'name\': \'Il Mazzo delle Meraviglie\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Tira un d20 e sottrai il numero di carte nella tua mano. Se il risultato è pari o inferiore a 0, scarta la tua mano.\\n1—9 | Riprendi in mano una carta a caso dal tuo cimitero.\\n10—19 | Pesca due carte.\\n20 | Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura da un qualsiasi cimitero. Quando quella creatura muore, il suo proprietario perde la partita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c816bfd-ea97-45d3-9f01-0a1c56013020\', \'multiverseId\': 528571}, \'multiverseid\': 528571}, {\'name\': \'デック・オヴ・メニー・シングズ\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：１個のd20を振り、その出目からあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数を引く。その数が０以下であるなら、あなたの手札を捨てる。\\n１—９ | あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚を無作為に選んであなたの手札に戻す。\\n10—19 | カード２枚を引く。\\n20 | 墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。そのクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それのオーナーはゲームに敗北する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f13235b-cce4-4423-92ac-ae415ff4404d\', \'multiverseId\': 528832}, \'multiverseid\': 528832}, {\'name\': \'수많은 것들의 덱\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: 20면체를 굴리고 당신의 손에 있는 카드만큼 수를 뺀다. 결과가 0 이하라면, 당신의 손을 버린다.\\n1—9 | 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드 한 장을 무작위로 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\\n10-19 | 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\\n20 | 원하는 무덤에 있는 생물 카드 한 장을 당신의 조종하에 전장에 놓는다. 그 생물이 죽을 때, 그 생물의 소유자는 게임에서 패배한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc65c2ba-e474-4398-b3fc-ee3f7a633706\', \'multiverseId\': 529092}, \'multiverseid\': 529092}, {\'name\': \'O Baralho das Surpresas\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Role um d20 e subtraia o número de cards em sua mão. Se o resultado for igual ou inferior a 0, descarte sua mão.\\n1—9 | Devolva um card aleatório de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\n10-19 | Compre dois cards.\\n20 | Coloque um card de criatura de qualquer cemitério no campo de batalha sob seu controle. Quando aquela criatura morre, seu dono perde o jogo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69b9bea5-8863-43bb-80c7-873098ea1fa2\', \'multiverseId\': 529353}, \'multiverseid\': 529353}, {\'name\': \'Колода Многих Вещей\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: бросьте d20 и вычтите число карт в вашей руке. Если результат равен 0 или меньше, сбросьте вашу руку.\\n1—9 | Верните случайно выбранную карту из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\n10—19 | Возьмите две карты.\\n20 | Положите карту существа из любого кладбища на поле битвы под вашим контролем. Когда то существо умирает, его владелец проигрывает партию.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09e859d4-ba09-4f0c-9e21-651e37cd82bf\', \'multiverseId\': 529614}, \'multiverseid\': 529614}, {\'name\': \'万象无常牌\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：掷一颗d20，然后将点数减去你的手牌数量。如果掷骰结果等于或小于0，则弃掉你的手牌。\\n1～9 | 随机将一张牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\n10～19 | 抓两张牌。\\n20 | 将一张生物牌在你的操控下从任一坟墓场放进战场。当该生物死去时，其拥有者输掉这盘游戏。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cff1f718-ccb9-4dd2-8889-9d072506767a\', \'multiverseId\': 529874}, \'multiverseid\': 529874}, {\'name\': \'萬象無常牌\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：擲一顆d20，然後將點數減去你的手牌數量。如果擲骰結果等於或小於0，則棄掉你的手牌。\\n1～9 | 隨機將一張牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\\n10～19 | 抽兩張牌。\\n20 | 將一張生物牌在你的操控下從任一墳墓場放進戰場。當該生物死去時，其擁有者輸掉這盤遊戲。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85d5f47e-299b-4598-a1f8-432eedaa9d1b\', \'multiverseId\': 530134}, \'multiverseid\': 530134}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Schicksalskarten\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Würfle einen W20 und ziehe die Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand vom Ergebnis ab. Falls das Ergebnis 0 oder weniger ist, wirf alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab.\\n1—9 | Bringe eine per Zufall bestimmte Karte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n10—19 | Ziehe zwei Karten.\\n20 | Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte aus einem beliebigen Friedhof unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Wenn jene Kreatur stirbt, verliert ihr Besitzer die Partie.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530550&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c329091-55c8-440f-be1d-35e3bd15a776\', \'multiverseId\': 530550}, \'multiverseid\': 530550}, {\'name\': \'La baraja de múltiples cosas\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Tira 1d20 y resta la cantidad de cartas en tu mano. Si el resultado es 0 o menos, descarta tu mano.\\n1—9 | Regresa una carta al azar de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\n10—19 | Roba dos cartas.\\n20 | Pon en el campo de batalla bajo tu control una carta de criatura de cualquier cementerio. Cuando esa criatura muera, su propietario pierde el juego.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c42f823d-942c-4f10-932b-25ead300ffda\', \'multiverseId\': 530587}, \'multiverseid\': 530587}, {\'name\': \'Les cartes merveilleuses\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Lancez un d20 et soustrayez le nombre de cartes de votre main au résultat. Si le résultat est inférieur ou égal à 0, défaussez-vous de votre main.\\n1—9 | Renvoyez une carte choisie au hasard depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\n10—19 | Piochez deux cartes.\\n20 | Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature de n\'importe quel cimetière. Quand cette créature meurt, son propriétaire perd la partie.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530624&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3970892d-5ff8-4e38-9bb5-c2503d46a8e7\', \'multiverseId\': 530624}, \'multiverseid\': 530624}, {\'name\': \'Il Mazzo delle Meraviglie\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Tira un d20 e sottrai il numero di carte nella tua mano. Se il risultato è pari o inferiore a 0, scarta la tua mano.\\n1—9 | Riprendi in mano una carta a caso dal tuo cimitero.\\n10—19 | Pesca due carte.\\n20 | Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura da un qualsiasi cimitero. Quando quella creatura muore, il suo proprietario perde la partita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e27cf531-8b3f-4e54-8355-1d016c1ad65c\', \'multiverseId\': 530661}, \'multiverseid\': 530661}, {\'name\': \'デック・オヴ・メニー・シングズ\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：１個のd20を振り、あなたの手札にあるカードの枚数をその出目から引く。その数が０以下であるなら、あなたの手札を捨てる。\\n１—９ | あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚を無作為に選んであなたの手札に戻す。\\n10—19 | カード２枚を引く。\\n20 | 墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。そのクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それのオーナーはゲームに敗北する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed824a66-b5cb-4c64-9f1f-4bba65f47654\', \'multiverseId\': 530698}, \'multiverseid\': 530698}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Tarraske\', \'text\': \'Die Tarraske hat Eile und Abwehr {10}, solange sie gewirkt wurde.\\nImmer wenn Die Tarraske angreift, kämpft sie gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn sie sich erhebt, fallen Nationen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527754&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7af1d4de-d257-4e80-a84b-77c3e3e2496a\', \'multiverseId\': 527754}, \'multiverseid\': 527754}, {\'name\': \'La tarasca\', \'text\': \'La tarasca tiene las habilidades de prisa y rebatir {10} siempre que se lanzara.\\nSiempre que La tarasca ataque, lucha contra la criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se alza, se desmoronan naciones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eafdfbc-6768-41b1-8eeb-dae4854693e5\', \'multiverseId\': 528015}, \'multiverseid\': 528015}, {\'name\': \'La tarasque\', \'text\': "La tarasque a la célérité et parade {10} tant qu\'elle a été lancée.\\nÀ chaque fois que La tarasque attaque, elle se bat contre une créature ciblée qu\'un joueur défenseur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dinosaure\', \'flavor\': "Quand elle se dresse, les nations s\'effondrent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528276&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbe24943-2bab-43ee-ae8c-7fb020c06b38\', \'multiverseId\': 528276}, \'multiverseid\': 528276}, {\'name\': \'Il Tarrasque\', \'text\': \'Il Tarrasque ha rapidità ed egida {10} fintanto che è stato lanciato.\\nOgniqualvolta Il Tarrasque attacca, lotta con una creatura bersaglio controllata dal giocatore in difesa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': \'Quando si desta, le nazioni crollano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd00d440-0293-45dd-b700-722384ae9454\', \'multiverseId\': 528537}, \'multiverseid\': 528537}, {\'name\': \'タラスク\', \'text\': \'タラスクが唱えられたものであるかぎり、これは速攻と護法{10}を持つ。\\nタラスクが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これはそれと格闘を行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'奴が立ち上がると、国が崩れ落ちる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8fc0537-bebd-49f5-8ff6-7089ae9e65b0\', \'multiverseId\': 528798}, \'multiverseid\': 528798}, {\'name\': \'타라스크\', \'text\': \'타라스크는 발동된 한 신속 및 보호진 {10}을 가진다.\\n타라스크가 공격할 때마다, 수비플레이어가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 타라스크는 그 생물과 싸운다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 공룡\', \'flavor\': \'그것이 일어나면, 국가가 무너진다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5297b282-51ba-4a39-bfdc-737c0d96e4b2\', \'multiverseId\': 529058}, \'multiverseid\': 529058}, {\'name\': \'Tarrasque\', \'text\': \'Tarrasque tem ímpeto e salvaguarda {10} contanto que tenha sido conjurado.\\nToda vez que Tarrasque ataca, ele luta contra a criatura alvo que o jogador defensor controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dinossauro\', \'flavor\': \'Quando ele se ergue, nações caem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d82a8a8-48e9-4df5-9b21-39b7df45de5b\', \'multiverseId\': 529319}, \'multiverseid\': 529319}, {\'name\': \'Тараск\', \'text\': \'Тараск имеет Ускорение и Оберег {10} при условии, что он был разыгран как заклинание.\\nКаждый раз, когда Тараск атакует, он дерется с целевым существом под контролем защищающегося игрока.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Динозавр\', \'flavor\': \'Когда он поднимается, падают государства.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'350b38b9-8cb8-4b6c-8836-889adb851faf\', \'multiverseId\': 529580}, \'multiverseid\': 529580}, {\'name\': \'末日毁灭兽\', \'text\': \'只要末日毁灭兽经牌手施放，它便具有敏捷与守护{10}。\\n每当末日毁灭兽攻击时，它与目标由防御牌手操控的生物互斗。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～恐龙\', \'flavor\': \'起身之时，灭国之日。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27754792-f203-435f-b5b5-8b9e9a8e907e\', \'multiverseId\': 529840}, \'multiverseid\': 529840}, {\'name\': \'末日毀滅獸\', \'text\': \'只要末日毀滅獸經玩家施放，它便具有敏捷與守護{10}。\\n每當末日毀滅獸攻擊時，它與目標由防禦玩家操控的生物互鬥。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～恐龍\', \'flavor\': \'起身之時，滅國之日。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cfd05ab-d2c5-4030-b9de-5cf38bfa0a6b\', \'multiverseId\': 530100}, \'multiverseid\': 530100}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Tarraske\', \'text\': \'Die Tarraske hat Eile und Abwehr {10}, solange sie gewirkt wurde.\\nImmer wenn Die Tarraske angreift, kämpft sie gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531018&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b58e1070-3d3f-4008-b66d-bd1fa6c06be1\', \'multiverseId\': 531018}, \'multiverseid\': 531018}, {\'name\': \'La tarasca\', \'text\': \'La tarasca tiene las habilidades de prisa y rebatir {10} siempre que se lanzara.\\nSiempre que La tarasca ataque, lucha contra la criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fdc520e-6245-4955-b560-4a72f9d59f20\', \'multiverseId\': 531069}, \'multiverseid\': 531069}, {\'name\': \'La tarasque\', \'text\': "La tarasque a la célérité et parade {10} tant qu\'elle a été lancée.\\nÀ chaque fois que La tarasque attaque, elle se bat contre une créature ciblée qu\'un joueur défenseur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dinosaure\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531120&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b30e75b-a23a-4b3f-b2ae-3fa4f6049b77\', \'multiverseId\': 531120}, \'multiverseid\': 531120}, {\'name\': \'Il Tarrasque\', \'text\': \'Il Tarrasque ha rapidità ed egida {10} fintanto che è stato lanciato.\\nOgniqualvolta Il Tarrasque attacca, lotta con una creatura bersaglio controllata dal giocatore in difesa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'795dd0b7-34d8-42e8-a61f-4ca495196075\', \'multiverseId\': 531171}, \'multiverseid\': 531171}, {\'name\': \'タラスク\', \'text\': \'タラスクが唱えられたものであるかぎり、それは速攻と護法{10}を持つ。\\nタラスクが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これはそれと格闘を行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 恐竜\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc66facb-550a-4ac2-a7d8-a443bcf0efc9\', \'multiverseId\': 531222}, \'multiverseid\': 531222}, {\'name\': \'타라스크\', \'text\': \'타라스크는 발동된 한 신속 및 보호진 {10}을 가진다.\\n타라스크가 공격할 때마다, 수비플레이어가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 타라스크는 그 생물과 싸운다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 공룡\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed7b2901-c88d-4753-8874-263755f681b1\', \'multiverseId\': 531273}, \'multiverseid\': 531273}, {\'name\': \'Tarrasque\', \'text\': \'Tarrasque tem ímpeto e salvaguarda {10} contanto que tenha sido conjurado.\\nToda vez que Tarrasque ataca, ele luta contra a criatura alvo que o jogador defensor controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dinossauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee85974-dacb-42f3-a5ba-f4b8b0f4804e\', \'multiverseId\': 531324}, \'multiverseid\': 531324}, {\'name\': \'Тараск\', \'text\': \'Тараск имеет Ускорение и Оберег {10} при условии, что он был разыгран как заклинание.\\nКаждый раз, когда Тараск атакует, он дерется с целевым существом под контролем защищающегося игрока.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Динозавр\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ff2bc61-8d11-46a4-a09c-ce1ca7a5af67\', \'multiverseId\': 531375}, \'multiverseid\': 531375}, {\'name\': \'末日毁灭兽\', \'text\': \'只要末日毁灭兽经牌手施放，它便具有敏捷与守护{10}。\\n每当末日毁灭兽攻击时，它与目标由防御牌手操控的生物互斗。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～恐龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac807924-1e75-43b8-89f1-b856e339f227\', \'multiverseId\': 531426}, \'multiverseid\': 531426}, {\'name\': \'末日毀滅獸\', \'text\': \'只要末日毀滅獸經玩家施放，它便具有敏捷與守護{10}。\\n每當末日毀滅獸攻擊時，它與目標由防禦玩家操控的生物互鬥。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～恐龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53d6a226-8082-433d-9f29-34a20ff76489\', \'multiverseId\': 531477}, \'multiverseid\': 531477}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diebeswerkzeug\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Diebeswerkzeug ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, solange ihre Stärke 3 oder weniger beträgt.\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527669&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'564346c1-3737-4536-810b-6ce19b989a54\', \'multiverseId\': 527669}, \'multiverseid\': 527669}, {\'name\': \'Herramientas de ladrón\', \'text\': \'Cuando las Herramientas de ladrón entren al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\\nLa criatura equipada no puede ser bloqueada mientras su fuerza sea de 3 o menos.\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5929c9bc-2692-4cbd-bcd3-bceda3dadf3f\', \'multiverseId\': 527930}, \'multiverseid\': 527930}, {\'name\': \'Outils de voleur\', \'text\': "Quand les Outils de voleur arrivent sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)\\nLa créature équipée ne peut pas être bloquée tant que sa force est inférieure ou égale à 3.\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528191&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'042cb7ed-d40b-4958-8835-9863d3f11b60\', \'multiverseId\': 528191}, \'multiverseid\': 528191}, {\'name\': \'Arnesi da Scasso\', \'text\': \'Quando gli Arnesi da Scasso entrano nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\\nLa creatura equipaggiata non può essere bloccata fintanto che la sua forza è pari o inferiore a 3.\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb1ade57-b2c6-4652-8bea-d3d9f254e356\', \'multiverseId\': 528452}, \'multiverseid\': 528452}, {\'name\': \'盗人の道具\', \'text\': \'盗人の道具が戦場に出たとき、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n装備しているクリーチャーのパワーが３以下であるかぎり、それはブロックされない。\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0288be68-dd1e-4049-9a21-644940dd8e33\', \'multiverseId\': 528713}, \'multiverseid\': 528713}, {\'name\': \'도둑의 도구\', \'text\': \'도둑의 도구가 전장에 들어올 때, 보물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. (보물 토큰은 "{T}, 이 마법물체를 희생한다: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다."를 가진 마법물체이다.)\\n장착된 생물은 그 생물의 공격력이 3 이하인 한 방어될 수 없다.\\n장착 {2} ({2}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 집중마법 시기에만 장착할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0330a46-0c2d-459e-98c7-3e5b5062e464\', \'multiverseId\': 528973}, \'multiverseid\': 528973}, {\'name\': \'Ferramentas de Ladrão\', \'text\': \'Quando Ferramentas de Ladrão entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de Tesouro. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}, sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".)\\nA criatura equipada não poderá ser bloqueada enquanto seu poder for igual ou inferior a 3.\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25e6a5ef-0db2-47c0-814e-3956fe511148\', \'multiverseId\': 529234}, \'multiverseid\': 529234}, {\'name\': \'Воровские Инструменты\', \'text\': \'Когда Воровские Инструменты выходят на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку Клада. (Это артефакт со способностью «{T}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: добавьте одну ману любого цвета».)\\nСнаряженное существо не может быть заблокировано, пока значение его силы не более 3.\\nСнарядить {2} ({2}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1f9c36f-235b-4777-843b-51db00cf7940\', \'multiverseId\': 529495}, \'multiverseid\': 529495}, {\'name\': \'小偷工具\', \'text\': \'当小偷工具进战场时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。（珍宝衍生物是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\\n只要佩带此武具之生物的力量等于或小于3，它便不能被阻挡。\\n佩带{2}（{2}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebdb503c-53bb-4e5e-aad0-a7ebf9341c76\', \'multiverseId\': 529755}, \'multiverseid\': 529755}, {\'name\': \'小偷工具\', \'text\': \'當小偷工具進戰場時，派出一個珍寶衍生物。（珍寶衍生物是具有「{T}，犧牲此神器：加一點任意顏色的魔法力」的神器。）\\n只要佩帶此武具之生物的力量等於或小於3，它便不能被阻擋。\\n佩帶{2}（{2}：貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。只能於巫術時機佩帶。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cc5723a-a40e-40bd-bb67-45ca7d370a83\', \'multiverseId\': 530015}, \'multiverseid\': 530015}]', "[{'name': 'Diener der Stärkeren', 'text': 'Bedrohlich\\nRudeltaktik — Immer wenn der Diener der Stärkeren angreift und falls du in diesem Kampf mit Kreaturen mit Gesamtstärke 6 oder mehr angegriffen hast, kannst du eine Drache-Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel bringen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Kobold', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527703&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '508bfe72-5129-48ed-8e15-34be8f5dc86a', 'multiverseId': 527703}, 'multiverseid': 527703}, {'name': 'Siervo de los poderosos', 'text': 'Amenaza.\\nAtacar en manada — Siempre que el Siervo de los poderosos ataque, si atacaste con criaturas con una fuerza total de 6 o más este combate, puedes poner una carta de criatura Dragón de tu mano en el campo de batalla girada y atacando.', 'type': 'Criatura — Kóbold', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527964&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0a331a2-3642-4332-84fc-df44b5b438aa', 'multiverseId': 527964}, 'multiverseid': 527964}, {'name': 'Mignon des puissants', 'text': 'Menace\\nTactique de meute — À chaque fois que le Mignon des puissants attaque, si vous avez attaqué avec des créatures de force totale supérieure ou égale à 6 pendant ce combat, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée et attaquante, une carte de créature Dragon de votre main.', 'type': 'Créature : kobold', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528225&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7af5a995-3f01-4e4f-9921-95be34c52e70', 'multiverseId': 528225}, 'multiverseid': 528225}, {'name': 'Servitore dei Potenti', 'text': 'Minacciare\\nTattiche del Branco — Ogniqualvolta il Servitore dei Potenti attacca, se hai attaccato con creature con forza totale pari o superiore a 6 in questo combattimento, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e attaccante una carta creatura Drago dalla tua mano.', 'type': 'Creatura — Coboldo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528486&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83fa71e7-8723-4cd0-baf1-f8f053d9b9e1', 'multiverseId': 528486}, 'multiverseid': 528486}, {'name': '強き者の下僕', 'text': '威迫\\n集団戦術 — 強き者の下僕が攻撃するたび、あなたがこの戦闘フェイズに攻撃させたクリーチャーのパワーの合計が６以上である場合、あなたはあなたの手札にあるドラゴン・クリーチャー・カード１体をタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で戦場に出してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — コボルド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528747&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1ff1230-7413-411d-960d-b900b2327262', 'multiverseId': 528747}, 'multiverseid': 528747}, {'name': '강한 자의 하수인', 'text': '호전적\\n무리 전술 — 강한 자의 하수인이 공격할 때마다, 당신이 이번 전투에 공격한 생물들의 공격력 총합이 6 이상이라면, 당신은 당신의 손에 있는 용 생물 카드를 탭되어 공격 중인 상태로 전장에 놓을 수 있다.', 'type': '생물 — 코볼드', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529007&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19457ffe-a558-41a6-ad05-50cb26f0eeb7', 'multiverseId': 529007}, 'multiverseid': 529007}, {'name': 'Assecla dos Poderosos', 'text': 'Ameaçar\\nTáticas de grupo — Toda vez que Assecla dos Poderosos ataca, se você tiver atacado com criaturas com total de poder igual ou superior a 6 neste combate, você pode colocar no campo de batalha um card de criatura Dragão de sua mão virado e atacando.', 'type': 'Criatura — Kobold', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529268&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '110b3814-1a32-4cec-8164-93bb1455a45a', 'multiverseId': 529268}, 'multiverseid': 529268}, {'name': 'Приспешник Могучего', 'text': 'Угроза\\nТактика стаи — Каждый раз, когда Приспешник Могучего атакует, если в этом бою вы атаковали существами с суммарной силой 6 или больше, вы можете положить на поле битвы карту существа-Дракона из вашей руки повернутой и атакующей.', 'type': 'Существо — Кобольд', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529529&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bfec5be1-d307-4764-880b-e3be295a6ac3', 'multiverseId': 529529}, 'multiverseid': 529529}, {'name': '强者奴仆', 'text': '威慑\\n集群战术～每当强者奴仆攻击时，若你本次战斗中用以攻击之生物力量总和等于或大于6，则你可以将一张龙生物牌从你的手上横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。', 'type': '生物 ～鬼崽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529789&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b6bf404-51fd-4df2-8076-3eac0e9f3d61', 'multiverseId': 529789}, 'multiverseid': 529789}, {'name': '強者奴僕', 'text': '威懾\\n集群戰術～每當強者奴僕攻擊時，若你本次戰鬥中用以攻擊之生物力量總和等於或大於6，則你可以將一張龍生物牌從你的手上橫置放進戰場，且正進行攻擊。', 'type': '生物 ～鬼崽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530049&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cc84276-86dd-43cf-b372-63d45a24a87c', 'multiverseId': 530049}, 'multiverseid': 530049}]", "[{'name': 'Diener der Stärkeren', 'text': 'Bedrohlich\\nRudeltaktik — Immer wenn der Diener der Stärkeren angreift und falls du in diesem Kampf mit Kreaturen mit Gesamtstärke 6 oder mehr angegriffen hast, kannst du eine Drache-Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel bringen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Kobold', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531005&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2263602-80b8-436a-8068-a7b262cbf43c', 'multiverseId': 531005}, 'multiverseid': 531005}, {'name': 'Siervo de los poderosos', 'text': 'Amenaza.\\nAtacar en manada — Siempre que el Siervo de los poderosos ataque, si atacaste con criaturas con una fuerza total de 6 o más este combate, puedes poner una carta de criatura Dragón de tu mano en el campo de batalla girada y atacando.', 'type': 'Criatura — Kóbold', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531056&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1731ac9a-1a4a-4f59-89c2-939255cc8195', 'multiverseId': 531056}, 'multiverseid': 531056}, {'name': 'Mignon des puissants', 'text': 'Menace\\nTactique de meute — À chaque fois que le Mignon des puissants attaque, si vous avez attaqué avec des créatures de force totale supérieure ou égale à 6 pendant ce combat, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée et attaquante, une carte de créature Dragon de votre main.', 'type': 'Créature : kobold', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531107&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecf0ee71-9e96-4c21-9076-cd6763eb502a', 'multiverseId': 531107}, 'multiverseid': 531107}, {'name': 'Servitore dei Potenti', 'text': 'Minacciare\\nTattiche del Branco — Ogniqualvolta il Servitore dei Potenti attacca, se hai attaccato con creature con forza totale pari o superiore a 6 in questo combattimento, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e attaccante una carta creatura Drago dalla tua mano.', 'type': 'Creatura — Coboldo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531158&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98db1fa7-8d1b-46df-8786-54ec4d52513f', 'multiverseId': 531158}, 'multiverseid': 531158}, {'name': '強き者の下僕', 'text': '威迫\\n集団戦術 — 強き者の下僕が攻撃するたび、あなたがこの戦闘フェイズに攻撃させたクリーチャーのパワーの合計が６以上である場合、あなたはあなたの手札にあるドラゴン・クリーチャー・カード１体をタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に出してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — コボルド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531209&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6776cbca-17c9-4c32-90d6-7423c6ddbc32', 'multiverseId': 531209}, 'multiverseid': 531209}, {'name': '강한 자의 하수인', 'text': '호전적\\n무리 전술 — 강한 자의 하수인이 공격할 때마다, 당신이 이번 전투에 공격한 생물들의 공격력 총합이 6 이상이라면, 당신은 당신의 손에 있는 용 생물 카드를 탭되어 공격 중인 상태로 전장에 놓을 수 있다.', 'type': '생물 — 코볼드', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531260&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cafacc0a-fbb3-4098-a036-1a47c2b093a4', 'multiverseId': 531260}, 'multiverseid': 531260}, {'name': 'Assecla dos Poderosos', 'text': 'Ameaçar\\nTáticas de grupo — Toda vez que Assecla dos Poderosos ataca, se você tiver atacado com criaturas com total de poder igual ou superior a 6 neste combate, você pode colocar no campo de batalha um card de criatura Dragão de sua mão virado e atacando.', 'type': 'Criatura — Kobold', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531311&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5620cdd1-6cbf-431a-ade7-026849d342da', 'multiverseId': 531311}, 'multiverseid': 531311}, {'name': 'Приспешник Могучего', 'text': 'Угроза\\nТактика стаи — Каждый раз, когда Приспешник Могучего атакует, если в этом бою вы атаковали существами с суммарной силой 6 или больше, вы можете положить на поле битвы карту существа-Дракона из вашей руки повернутой и атакующей.', 'type': 'Существо — Кобольд', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531362&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14ef286a-e42e-4deb-b27a-35325e5d7212', 'multiverseId': 531362}, 'multiverseid': 531362}, {'name': '强者奴仆', 'text': '威慑\\n集群战术～每当强者奴仆攻击时，若你本次战斗中用以攻击之生物力量总和等于或大于6，则你可以将一张龙生物牌从你的手上横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。', 'type': '生物 ～鬼崽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531413&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e606f18a-b4df-4987-b5dd-b36e62d069f6', 'multiverseId': 531413}, 'multiverseid': 531413}, {'name': '強者奴僕', 'text': '威懾\\n集群戰術～每當強者奴僕攻擊時，若你本次戰鬥中用以攻擊之生物力量總和等於或大於6，則你可以將一張龍生物牌從你的手上橫置放進戰場，且正進行攻擊。', 'type': '生物 ～鬼崽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531464&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11bcb0ec-0a4e-49a5-ac85-4cbdf2905f97', 'multiverseId': 531464}, 'multiverseid': 531464}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drachenfeuer\', \'text\': \'Als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du eine Drache-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen oder einen Drachen, den du kontrollierst, bestimmen.\\nDas Drachenfeuer fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls du eine Drache-Karte offen vorgezeigt oder einen Drachen bestimmt hast, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch gewirkt hast, fügt das Drachenfeuer stattdessen Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke jener Karte bzw. Kreatur zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527686&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9225018c-b59b-4119-9105-9f51ad7f65f6\', \'multiverseId\': 527686}, \'multiverseid\': 527686}, {\'name\': \'Fuego del dragón\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, puedes mostrar una carta de Dragón de tu mano o elegir un Dragón que controlas.\\nEl Fuego del dragón hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo. Si mostraste una carta de Dragón o elegiste un Dragón al lanzar este hechizo, en vez de eso, el Fuego del dragón hace una cantidad de daño igual a la fuerza de esa carta o criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d1d5f1b-f136-4ef4-afe5-e182921e8a05\', \'multiverseId\': 527947}, \'multiverseid\': 527947}, {\'name\': \'Feu du dragon\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, vous pouvez révéler une carte de dragon de votre main ou choisir un dragon que vous contrôlez.\\nLe Feu du dragon inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker. Si vous avez révélé une carte de dragon ou choisi un dragon au moment où vous avez lancé ce sort, le Feu du dragon inflige un nombre de blessures égal à la force de cette carte ou de cette créature à la place.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528208&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5df33994-d4eb-4fd9-ae79-ba63a5566da1\', \'multiverseId\': 528208}, \'multiverseid\': 528208}, {\'name\': \'Fuoco del Drago\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, puoi rivelare una carta Drago dalla tua mano o scegliere un Drago che controlli.\\nIl Fuoco del Drago infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio. Se hai rivelato una carta Drago o hai scelto un Drago mentre hai lanciato questa magia, il Fuoco del Drago infligge invece danno pari alla forza di quella carta o creatura.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94fbdec6-689f-4328-aad2-004fe4ed2f10\', \'multiverseId\': 528469}, \'multiverseid\': 528469}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの火\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの手札にあるドラゴン・カード１枚を公開するか、あなたがコントロールしているドラゴン１体を選んでもよい。\\nクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。ドラゴンの火はそれに3点のダメージを与える。この呪文を唱えるに際しあなたがドラゴン・カードを公開するかドラゴンを選んでいたなら、代わりにドラゴンの火はそのカードやクリーチャーのパワーに等しい点数のダメージをそれに与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1769992-c319-433e-81fa-ac28a2235aa3\', \'multiverseId\': 528730}, \'multiverseid\': 528730}, {\'name\': \'용의 불길\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 당신은 당신의 손에서 용 카드 한 장을 공개하거나 당신이 조종하는 용을 선택할 수 있다.\\n생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 용의 불길은 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다. 당신이 이 주문을 발동하면서 용 카드를 공개하거나 용을 선택했다면, 용의 불길은 대신 그 카드 또는 생물의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99ca21d7-25a7-4d57-8b3a-a100aa177c12\', \'multiverseId\': 528990}, \'multiverseid\': 528990}, {\'name\': \'Fogo do Dragão\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, você pode revelar um card de Dragão de sua mão ou escolher um Dragão que você controla.\\nFogo do Dragão causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo. Se você revelou um card de Dragão ou escolheu um Dragão conforme conjurou esta mágica, em vez disso, Fogo do Dragão causa um dano igual ao poder daquele card ou criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67b93d9c-0833-4034-8b3e-0a58463ae2e0\', \'multiverseId\': 529251}, \'multiverseid\': 529251}, {\'name\': \'Драконье Пламя\', \'text\': "В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания вы можете показать карту Дракона из вашей руки или выбрать Дракона под вашим контролем.\\nДраконье Пламя наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или planeswalker\'у. Если при разыгрывании этого заклинания вы показали карту Дракона или выбрали Дракона, то вместо этого Драконье Пламя наносит повреждения, равные силе той карты или существа.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d621947-bd19-428d-b133-0316e081b3e6\', \'multiverseId\': 529512}, \'multiverseid\': 529512}, {\'name\': \'龙火\', \'text\': \'你可以从你手上展示一张龙牌或选择一个由你操控的龙，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n龙火对目标生物或鹏洛客造成3点伤害。如果你于施放此咒语时展示了龙牌或选择了龙，则改为龙火造成等同于该牌或生物之力量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b5fadae-6f43-43d1-b713-9dca331b038c\', \'multiverseId\': 529772}, \'multiverseid\': 529772}, {\'name\': \'龍火\', \'text\': \'你可以從你手上展示一張龍牌或選擇一個由你操控的龍，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。\\n龍火對目標生物或鵬洛客造成3點傷害。如果你於施放此咒語時展示了龍牌或選擇了龍，則改為龍火造成等同於該牌或生物之力量的傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72247fdb-34b9-4103-bae2-d19352bc28f2\', \'multiverseId\': 530032}, \'multiverseid\': 530032}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenschildkröte\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nIn die Tiefe zerren — Wenn die Drachenschildkröte ins Spiel kommt, tappe sie und bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Sie enttappen nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihrer Beherrscher.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Schildkröte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0aa1310-c9fe-42ef-a3cb-e603179794e6\', \'multiverseId\': 527603}, \'multiverseid\': 527603}, {\'name\': \'Dragón tortuga\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nLlevar hacia el fondo — Cuando el Dragón tortuga entre al campo de batalla, gíralo y gira hasta una otra criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. No se enderezan durante el próximo paso de enderezar de sus controladores.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón tortuga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'761ec7b6-1f9c-4f65-956e-30622f0f4a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 527864}, \'multiverseid\': 527864}, {\'name\': \'Dragon-tortue\', \'text\': "Flash\\nEntraîner sous l\'eau — Quand le Dragon-tortue arrive sur le champ de bataille, engagez-le et engagez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Ils ne se dégagent pas pendant les prochaines étapes de dégagement de leurs contrôleurs.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et tortue terrestre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ba94508-793d-4bfa-81b1-5a3f6c6dd20a\', \'multiverseId\': 528125}, \'multiverseid\': 528125}, {\'name\': \'Testuggine Dragona\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nTrascina Giù — Quando la Testuggine Dragona entra nel campo di battaglia, TAPpa la Testuggine Dragona e fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Non STAPpano durante il prossimo STAP dei rispettivi controllori.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tartaruga Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3ccd5ec-b463-4a00-b01f-56379c36a789\', \'multiverseId\': 528386}, \'multiverseid\': 528386}, {\'name\': \'竜亀\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n引きずり込み — 竜亀が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。竜亀とそのクリーチャーをタップする。それらは、次のそれらのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・海亀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c3dccf8-18c5-4338-8db0-70214a4eff48\', \'multiverseId\': 528647}, \'multiverseid\': 528647}, {\'name\': \'용 거북이\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n아래로 잡아끌기 — 용 거북이가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 용 거북이와 그 생물을 탭한다. 그 생물들은 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용 거북이\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebe9fa6c-99cf-4189-a0f0-f4e6eb677498\', \'multiverseId\': 528907}, \'multiverseid\': 528907}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Tartaruga\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nArrastar para o fundo — Quando Dragão Tartaruga entrar no campo de batalha, vire-a e até uma criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Elas não são desviradas durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seus controladores.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão Tartaruga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad74f23a-a6cd-424e-9b65-daf443fa63d8\', \'multiverseId\': 529168}, \'multiverseid\': 529168}, {\'name\': \'Драконовая Черепаха\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nЗатянуть под воду — Когда Драконовая Черепаха выходит на поле битвы, поверните ее и не более одного целевого существа под контролем оппонента. Они не разворачиваются во время следующего шага разворота контролирующих их игроков.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон Черепаха\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19921523-6a9d-4c02-bcbf-b6844f80524d\', \'multiverseId\': 529429}, \'multiverseid\': 529429}, {\'name\': \'龙龟\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n拖入水底～当龙龟进战场时，将它和至多一个目标由对手操控的生物横置。它们于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙／龟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b80089f7-28a4-420a-8115-e5eea6672abd\', \'multiverseId\': 529689}, \'multiverseid\': 529689}, {\'name\': \'龍龜\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n拖入水底～當龍龜進戰場時，將它和至多一個目標由對手操控的生物橫置。它們於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍／龜\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b8dd297-990c-425d-b5a2-a9cd779895b5\', \'multiverseId\': 529949}, \'multiverseid\': 529949}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenschildkröte\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nIn die Tiefe zerren — Wenn die Drachenschildkröte ins Spiel kommt, tappe sie und bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Sie enttappen nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihrer Beherrscher.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Schildkröte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530992&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f980dfc7-6e4b-495b-9899-8760e46186cc\', \'multiverseId\': 530992}, \'multiverseid\': 530992}, {\'name\': \'Dragón tortuga\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nLlevar hacia el fondo — Cuando el Dragón tortuga entre al campo de batalla, gíralo y gira hasta una otra criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. No se enderezan durante el próximo paso de enderezar de sus controladores.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón tortuga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca3f5736-2df3-4ac2-992c-2b4442e2c228\', \'multiverseId\': 531043}, \'multiverseid\': 531043}, {\'name\': \'Dragon-tortue\', \'text\': "Flash\\nEntraîner sous l\'eau — Quand le Dragon-tortue arrive sur le champ de bataille, engagez-le et engagez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Ils ne se dégagent pas pendant les prochaines étapes de dégagement de leurs contrôleurs.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et tortue terrestre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531094&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'458c5c7a-0f5d-4500-9f4b-726a1469b52c\', \'multiverseId\': 531094}, \'multiverseid\': 531094}, {\'name\': \'Testuggine Dragona\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nTrascina Giù — Quando la Testuggine Dragona entra nel campo di battaglia, TAPpa la Testuggine Dragona e fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Non STAPpano durante il prossimo STAP dei rispettivi controllori.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tartaruga Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f28e8fe4-8305-4db8-8a3c-ff3a9a68b70f\', \'multiverseId\': 531145}, \'multiverseid\': 531145}, {\'name\': \'竜亀\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n引きずり下ろし — 竜亀が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。竜亀とそのクリーチャーをタップする。それらは、そのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・海亀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8964ffe0-7d72-4817-9c70-3896db89f4a2\', \'multiverseId\': 531196}, \'multiverseid\': 531196}, {\'name\': \'용 거북이\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n아래로 잡아끌기 — 용 거북이가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 용 거북이와 그 생물을 탭한다. 그 생물들은 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용 거북이\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96a8f3e5-3ec3-4281-9055-8ccae16db280\', \'multiverseId\': 531247}, \'multiverseid\': 531247}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Tartaruga\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nArrastar para o fundo — Quando Dragão Tartaruga entrar no campo de batalha, vire-a e até uma criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Elas não são desviradas durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seus controladores.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão Tartaruga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb9e3f56-da14-4a67-b69d-094e8b9548aa\', \'multiverseId\': 531298}, \'multiverseid\': 531298}, {\'name\': \'Драконовая Черепаха\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nЗатянуть под воду — Когда Драконовая Черепаха выходит на поле битвы, поверните ее и не более одного целевого существа под контролем оппонента. Они не разворачиваются во время следующего шага разворота контролирующих их игроков.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон Черепаха\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd1cbef9-927a-48e7-aca4-32c87db40848\', \'multiverseId\': 531349}, \'multiverseid\': 531349}, {\'name\': \'龙龟\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n拖入水底～当龙龟进战场时，将它和至多一个目标由对手操控的生物横置。它们于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙／龟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cb57c43-b44c-472c-b3c1-ccefb466fb6c\', \'multiverseId\': 531400}, \'multiverseid\': 531400}, {\'name\': \'龍龜\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n拖入水底～當龍龜進戰場時，將它和至多一個目標由對手操控的生物橫置。它們於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍／龜\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'738d0496-f393-426a-99f5-ab70f3c82b8e\', \'multiverseId\': 531451}, \'multiverseid\': 531451}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drinne\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nImmer wenn die Drinne einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen 2/1 schwarzen Spinne-Kreaturenspielstein mit Bedrohlichkeit und Reichweite.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Ihre Gestalt ähnelt der von Lolth, aber sie sind jene unglücklichen Drow, die die Königin der Spinnen enttäuscht haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527645&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b69bfd1-6acd-4fcf-8382-97a2f491e697\', \'multiverseId\': 527645}, \'multiverseid\': 527645}, {\'name\': \'Draña\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nSiempre que la Draña haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de criatura Araña negra 2/1 con las habilidades de amenaza y alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque sus formas encarnen la imagen de Lolth, las drañas son drows desafortunados que le fallaron a la Reina Araña.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a563ccf-effa-4d47-9834-9d30e85f8a76\', \'multiverseId\': 527906}, \'multiverseid\': 527906}, {\'name\': \'Drider\', \'text\': \'Portée\\nÀ chaque fois que le Drider inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton de créature 2/1 noire Araignée avec la menace et la portée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et araignée\', \'flavor\': "Bien que leur forme soit à l\'image de Lolth, les driders sont ces drows qui ont failli à la Reine Araignée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528167&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7a7b681-5ebb-4675-bf87-ce5561afd9e9\', \'multiverseId\': 528167}, \'multiverseid\': 528167}, {\'name\': \'Drider\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nOgniqualvolta il Drider infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea una pedina creatura Ragno 2/1 nera con minacciare e raggiungere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno Elfo\', \'flavor\': "Anche se la loro forma incarna l\'immagine di Lolth, i drider sono gli sventurati drow che hanno deluso la Regina Ragno.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f084c9c8-ee0e-4038-97b2-04a1eda6f7a3\', \'multiverseId\': 528428}, \'multiverseid\': 528428}, {\'name\': \'ドライダー\', \'text\': \'到達\\nドライダーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、威迫と到達を持つ黒の２/１の蜘蛛・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'ロルスの姿に似てはいるが、ドライダーは蜘蛛の女王を絶望させた不運のドラウである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb5efb5c-4b90-4626-821e-8c12067f4b87\', \'multiverseId\': 528689}, \'multiverseid\': 528689}, {\'name\': \'드라이더\', \'text\': \'대공\\n드라이더가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 호전적 및 대공을 가진 2/1 흑색 거미 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 거미\', \'flavor\': \'그들의 모습이 롤스의 형상을 닮았을지라도, 드라이더들은 거미 여왕을 실망시킨 불행한 드로우들일 뿐이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bccb8de-d793-4ed5-8fed-30aec14c6c27\', \'multiverseId\': 528949}, \'multiverseid\': 528949}, {\'name\': \'Draider\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nToda vez que Draider causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie uma ficha de criatura Aranha preta 2/1 com ameaçar e alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'Embora suas formas personifiquem a imagem de Lolth, os draiders são os infelizes drows que falharam com a Rainha Aranha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d8af8f5-2a0e-4a69-94a1-c0d91bc1cb5a\', \'multiverseId\': 529210}, \'multiverseid\': 529210}, {\'name\': \'Драук\', \'text\': \'Захват\\nКаждый раз, когда Драук наносит боевые повреждения игроку, создайте одну фишку существа 2/1 черный Паук с Угрозой и Захватом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Паук\', \'flavor\': \'Внешне они созданы по образу и подобию Лолт, но на деле драуки — это те незадачливые дроу, кто подвел Паучью Королеву.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82898360-4a10-4f93-9f26-7d9acdb5e9ab\', \'multiverseId\': 529471}, \'multiverseid\': 529471}, {\'name\': \'蛛化精灵\', \'text\': \'延势\\n每当蛛化精灵对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个2/1黑色，具威慑与延势异能的蜘蛛衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'虽然蛛化精灵外形神似罗丝，但他们其实是令蜘蛛女王蒙羞的不幸卓尔。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67baa6d2-f0e2-464c-893f-2b15bd605cbc\', \'multiverseId\': 529731}, \'multiverseid\': 529731}, {\'name\': \'蛛化精靈\', \'text\': \'延勢\\n每當蛛化精靈對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，派出一個2/1黑色，具威懾與延勢異能的蜘蛛衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'雖然蛛化精靈外形神似羅絲，但他們其實是令蜘蛛女王蒙羞的不幸卓爾。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed5185b7-9b29-44ff-87f4-255cfb09169b\', \'multiverseId\': 529991}, \'multiverseid\': 529991}]', "[{'name': 'Druide des Zirkels der Träume', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {G} für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Druide', 'flavor': 'Die Reiche, die von Druiden des Zirkels der Träume beschützt werden, sind schimmernde, fruchtbare Orte, wo Traum und Wirklichkeit ineinander verschwimmen und die Müden rasten können.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527723&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73759d92-c080-456a-95ff-fb6e0a692f01', 'multiverseId': 527723}, 'multiverseid': 527723}, {'name': 'Druida del Círculo de los Sueños', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {G} por cada criatura que controlas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Druida elfo', 'flavor': 'Los reinos que protegen los druidas del Círculo de los Sueños son lugares relucientes y fructíferos en los que los sueños y la realidad se difuminan y los cansados pueden reposar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527984&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e2a3414-810d-4431-814b-90c621e9e8fd', 'multiverseId': 527984}, 'multiverseid': 527984}, {'name': 'Druide du cercle des rêves', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {G} pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et druide', 'flavor': 'Les royaumes protégés par les druides du Cercle des rêves sont des lieux prospères et rutilants, où rêves et réalité se confondent et où les plus las peuvent trouver le repos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528245&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb246bea-0fe1-46e6-b6c5-d3fd3bc0d7a3', 'multiverseId': 528245}, 'multiverseid': 528245}, {'name': 'Druido del Circolo dei Sogni', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {G} per ogni creatura che controlli.', 'type': 'Creatura — Druido Elfo', 'flavor': 'I reami protetti dai druidi del Circolo dei Sogni sono luoghi splendenti e fecondi, dove sogno e realtà si mescolano e coloro che sono stanchi trovano riposo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528506&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '869cbcd8-c68e-4bc9-a62a-3e0fdd46e4ab', 'multiverseId': 528506}, 'multiverseid': 528506}, {'name': '夢の円環のドルイド', 'text': '{T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき{G}を加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド', 'flavor': '夢の円環のドルイドが守る領域は、夢と現実が混じり合い、疲れた者たちに安息を与える、光り輝く豊かな場所である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528767&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ba0e83e-506d-48c7-a72a-12c40d0b0985', 'multiverseId': 528767}, 'multiverseid': 528767}, {'name': '꿈의 모임 드루이드', 'text': '{T}: 당신이 조종하는 각 생물마다 {G}를 추가한다.', 'type': '생물 — 엘프 드루이드', 'flavor': '꿈의 모임 드루이드들에 의해 보호되는 영역은 꿈과 현실이 함께 뒤섞여 있으며 지친 사람들이 휴식을 찾을 수 있는, 빛나고 보람 있는 장소이다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529027&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ba429c5-c7e9-446b-b559-602c0ed1b2aa', 'multiverseId': 529027}, 'multiverseid': 529027}, {'name': 'Druida do Círculo dos Sonhos', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {G} para cada criatura que você controla.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elfo Druida', 'flavor': 'Os reinos protegidos pelos druidas do Círculo dos Sonhos são lugares luminosos e férteis, onde o sonho e a realidade se misturam e os fatigados podem descansar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529288&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6969edc1-0dbe-4df4-b06a-8ffa111a6174', 'multiverseId': 529288}, 'multiverseid': 529288}, {'name': 'Друид Круга Снов', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {G} за каждое существо под вашим контролем.', 'type': 'Существо — Эльф Друид', 'flavor': 'Края, которые защищают друиды Круга Снов, — это сияющие плодородные земли, где сплелись мечты и реальность, а усталый путник может обрести покой.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529549&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11086303-669c-4cf1-901d-2aadf4ba92ca', 'multiverseId': 529549}, 'multiverseid': 529549}, {'name': '梦境结社德鲁伊', 'text': '{T}：你每操控一个生物，便加{G}。', 'type': '生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊', 'flavor': '由梦境结社德鲁伊守护的国度通常都充满活力、硕果累累，其间梦境和现实交织，疲惫者能获得休息。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529809&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bff04898-6680-476c-a078-0f3af35e4fec', 'multiverseId': 529809}, 'multiverseid': 529809}, {'name': '夢境結社德魯伊', 'text': '{T}：你每操控一個生物，便加{G}。', 'type': '生物 ～妖精／德魯伊', 'flavor': '由夢境結社德魯伊守護的國度通常都充滿活力、碩果纍纍，其間夢境和現實交織，疲憊者能獲得休息。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530069&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de715d75-180f-4886-8c06-b8d6003d8a50', 'multiverseId': 530069}, 'multiverseid': 530069}]", "[{'name': 'Druide des Zirkels der Träume', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {G} für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530541&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04edaf48-c52f-4c42-a6d5-19c3860c50b0', 'multiverseId': 530541}, 'multiverseid': 530541}, {'name': 'Druida del Círculo de los Sueños', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {G} por cada criatura que controlas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Druida elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530578&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd755ccdf-9cd2-4d8b-a97b-c4fbbe0d4691', 'multiverseId': 530578}, 'multiverseid': 530578}, {'name': 'Druide du cercle des rêves', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {G} pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530615&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2df0b3a-bd23-4c9d-9c1a-46fa464e4cfb', 'multiverseId': 530615}, 'multiverseid': 530615}, {'name': 'Druido del Circolo dei Sogni', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {G} per ogni creatura che controlli.', 'type': 'Creatura — Druido Elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530652&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '833ed0e5-8683-4e88-bc41-e0b3d8bb94cb', 'multiverseId': 530652}, 'multiverseid': 530652}, {'name': '夢の円環のドルイド', 'text': '{T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき{G}を加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530689&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '646807f8-2258-4b52-8ed1-a4744387170a', 'multiverseId': 530689}, 'multiverseid': 530689}]", '[{\'name\': \'Druide des Zirkels des Mondes\', \'text\': \'Bärengestalt — Solange es dein Zug ist, ist der Druide des Zirkels des Mondes ein Bär mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 4/2. (Er verliert alle anderen Kreaturentypen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Druiden des Zirkels des Mondes sind entschlossene Wächter der Natur, die sich tief in der Wildnis bewegen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527724&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'256efffd-fae2-4a8b-aea5-d676aba1505d\', \'multiverseId\': 527724}, \'multiverseid\': 527724}, {\'name\': \'Druida del Círculo de la Luna\', \'text\': \'Forma de oso — Mientras sea tu turno, el Druida del Círculo de la Luna es un Oso con fuerza y resistencia base de 4/2. (Pierde todos sus otros tipos de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los druidas del Círculo de la Luna son fieros guardianes de la naturaleza que moran en los parajes más apartados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d6d8237-cbd8-4dc8-a4b1-9e05f14b7934\', \'multiverseId\': 527985}, \'multiverseid\': 527985}, {\'name\': \'Druide du cercle de la lune\', \'text\': "Transformation ursidée — Tant que c\'est votre tour, le Druide du cercle de la lune est un ours avec une force et une endurance de base de 4/2. (Il perd tous ses autres types de créature.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'Les druides du Cercle de la lune sont de redoutables gardiens de la nature qui hantent les lieux les plus profonds de la forêt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528246&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67330a3b-9f4f-43e4-a866-206b5e1207a2\', \'multiverseId\': 528246}, \'multiverseid\': 528246}, {\'name\': \'Druido del Circolo della Luna\', \'text\': "Forma dell\'Orso — Fintanto che è il tuo turno, il Druido del Circolo della Luna è un Orso con forza e costituzione base 4/2. (Perde tutti gli altri tipi di creatura.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo Umano\', \'flavor\': \'I druidi del Circolo della Luna sono feroci guardiani della natura che risiedono nelle aree più recondite delle terre selvagge.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b02608bc-981e-44bd-88e3-d2cf3c6194eb\', \'multiverseId\': 528507}, \'multiverseid\': 528507}, {\'name\': \'月の円環のドルイド\', \'text\': \'熊の姿 — あなたのターン中であるかぎり、月の円環のドルイドは基本のパワーとタフネスが４/２の熊である。（それは他のクリーチャー・タイプをすべて失う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'月の円環のドルイドは森の最深部に潜む勇猛な自然の守護者である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9fd2c2c-0da6-49eb-a9ad-310c4009a6af\', \'multiverseId\': 528768}, \'multiverseid\': 528768}, {\'name\': \'달의 모임 드루이드\', \'text\': \'곰 형상 — 당신의 턴인 한, 달의 모임 드루이드는 기본 공격력 및 방어력이 4/2인 곰이다. (다른 모든 생물 유형을 잃는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'달의 모임 드루이드들은 황야의 가장 깊은 곳을 떠돌아다니는 자연의 맹렬한 수호자들이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2565838-36b4-42ef-ac23-dcde4170088d\', \'multiverseId\': 529028}, \'multiverseid\': 529028}, {\'name\': \'Druida do Círculo da Lua\', \'text\': \'Forma de urso — Enquanto for o seu turno, Druida do Círculo da Lua é um Urso com poder e resistência básicos 4/2. (Ele perde todos os outros tipos de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Os druidas do Círculo da Lua são protetores ferozes da natureza, espreitando nas áreas mais selvagens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82131af4-fb83-49f2-9295-d1724cb93971\', \'multiverseId\': 529289}, \'multiverseid\': 529289}, {\'name\': \'Друид Круга Луны\', \'text\': \'Облик медведя — Пока длится ваш ход, Друид Круга Луны является Медведем с базовыми силой и выносливостью 4/2. (Он теряет все другие типы существа.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'Друиды Круга Луны — яростные защитники природы, которые обитают в самых глубоких уголках диких земель.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34230a1a-3aab-4511-83dd-47de14e45647\', \'multiverseId\': 529550}, \'multiverseid\': 529550}, {\'name\': \'明月结社德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'熊形态～只要是在你的回合中，明月结社德鲁伊便是基础力量与防御力为4/2的熊。（它失去所有其他生物类别。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'明月结社的德鲁伊是大自然的凶猛护卫，出没于荒野最深处。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58b65bf7-3274-48f3-9da7-49d10cbbc26d\', \'multiverseId\': 529810}, \'multiverseid\': 529810}, {\'name\': \'明月結社德魯伊\', \'text\': \'熊形態～只要是在你的回合中，明月結社德魯伊便是基礎力量與防禦力為4/2的熊。（它失去所有其他生物類別。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'明月結社的德魯伊是大自然的兇猛護衛，出沒於荒野最深處。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9116348-861a-48ea-89d0-f5c719aa986b\', \'multiverseId\': 530070}, \'multiverseid\': 530070}]', '[{\'name\': \'Du hörst ein Geräusch\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Die Gruppe wecken — Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Fallen auslösen — Dieser Zauberspruch fügt einer angreifenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527589&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'607671fc-037b-4842-869f-e9cba609ae6b\', \'multiverseId\': 527589}, \'multiverseid\': 527589}, {\'name\': \'Oyes algo durante tu guardia\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Despertar al grupo — Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\\n• Activar trampas — Este hechizo hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura atacante objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc8e8c37-a54c-4df6-ac30-b437c852ea1a\', \'multiverseId\': 527850}, \'multiverseid\': 527850}, {\'name\': \'Vous entendez quelque chose\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Vous réveillez le groupe — Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Vous déclenchez les pièges — Ce sort inflige 5 blessures à une créature attaquante ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528111&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'929e3a4c-7b84-4f53-b0bd-a25e1473a6af\', \'multiverseId\': 528111}, \'multiverseid\': 528111}, {\'name\': \'Senti Qualcosa nel Turno di Guardia\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Sveglia il Gruppo — Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Attiva le Trappole — Questa magia infligge 5 danni a una creatura attaccante bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e5e15ca-8a8c-4dc5-a15b-edcc7e1134a6\', \'multiverseId\': 528372}, \'multiverseid\': 528372}, {\'name\': \'君は見張り中に物音を聞いた\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• パーティーを起こす — ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n• 罠を作動させる — 攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。この呪文はそれに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a19f4859-31cf-49a4-b314-5ac13e2cfa59\', \'multiverseId\': 528633}, \'multiverseid\': 528633}, {\'name\': \'보초를 서는 동안 무슨 소리가 들렸다\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 파티 깨우기 — 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n• 함정 작동 — 공격 중인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 이 주문은 그 생물에게 피해 5점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aed8978-06fa-47c0-80d2-d0eb5f9be831\', \'multiverseId\': 528893}, \'multiverseid\': 528893}, {\'name\': \'Vocês Ouvem Algo Enquanto Vigiam\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Instigar o grupo — As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\\n• Disparar armadilhas — Esta mágica causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura atacante alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93292c5a-cc58-4ae6-a46a-801747fd7f80\', \'multiverseId\': 529154}, \'multiverseid\': 529154}, {\'name\': \'Вы Что-то Слышите в Карауле\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Поднять отряд — Существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 до конца хода.\\n• Снарядить ловушки — Это заклинание наносит 5 повреждений целевому атакующему существу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'630088f1-fd0b-4452-a9dc-84a34bba5f22\', \'multiverseId\': 529415}, \'multiverseid\': 529415}, {\'name\': \'你放哨时听到声响\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•叫醒队伍～由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\\n•启动陷阱～此咒语对目标进行攻击的生物造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'569e4f9e-045c-4c91-b9da-2c8f1a94fa5f\', \'multiverseId\': 529675}, \'multiverseid\': 529675}, {\'name\': \'你放哨時聽到聲響\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•叫醒隊伍～由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\\n•啟動陷阱～此咒語對目標進行攻擊的生物造成5點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e26a4aa-36d0-4eac-a33a-0517e6ab54d3\', \'multiverseId\': 529935}, \'multiverseid\': 529935}]', '[{\'name\': \'Duellrapier\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn das Duellrapier ins Spiel kommt, lege es an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst.\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0.\\nAusrüsten {4} ({4}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527687&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fc8c99c-e786-43b5-a890-98da5605647b\', \'multiverseId\': 527687}, \'multiverseid\': 527687}, {\'name\': \'Estoque de duelista\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando el Estoque de duelista entre al campo de batalla, anéxalo a la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0.\\nEquipar {4}. ({4}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'759bd09d-8d58-4416-bd6b-88565a195d5f\', \'multiverseId\': 527948}, \'multiverseid\': 527948}, {\'name\': \'Rapière de duel\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand la Rapière de duel arrive sur le champ de bataille, attachez-la à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nLa créature équipée gagne +2/+0.\\nÉquipement {4} ({4} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528209&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef79522e-8df0-45c7-9051-875d87112845\', \'multiverseId\': 528209}, \'multiverseid\': 528209}, {\'name\': \'Stocco da Duello\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando lo Stocco da Duello entra nel campo di battaglia, assegnalo a una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0.\\nEquipaggiare {4} ({4}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a3680cc-5959-44aa-8439-5fff9c618f33\', \'multiverseId\': 528470}, \'multiverseid\': 528470}, {\'name\': \'決闘のレイピア\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n決闘のレイピアが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備{4}（{4}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e771852-3dc4-4dc8-9731-9a3fe46fb5c1\', \'multiverseId\': 528731}, \'multiverseid\': 528731}, {\'name\': \'결투용 레이피어\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n결투용 레이피어가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 결투용 레이피어를 그 생물에 부착한다.\\n장착된 생물은 +2/+0을 받는다.\\n장착 {4} ({4}: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 집중마법 시기에만 장착할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7b869dd-926d-421a-9a90-ae04bc983afc\', \'multiverseId\': 528991}, \'multiverseid\': 528991}, {\'name\': \'Rapieira de Duelo\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Rapieira de Duelo entrar no campo de batalha, anexe-a à criatura alvo que você controla.\\nA criatura equipada recebe +2/+0.\\nEquipar {4} ({4}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82380fb4-c44a-4620-a2f9-5c2aac4936fc\', \'multiverseId\': 529252}, \'multiverseid\': 529252}, {\'name\': \'Дуэльная Рапира\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Дуэльная Рапира выходит на поле битвы, прикрепите ее к целевому существу под вашим контролем.\\nСнаряженное существо получает +2/+0.\\nСнарядить {4} ({4}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1830d5e-dd40-4bbc-a649-bfdc03325588\', \'multiverseId\': 529513}, \'multiverseid\': 529513}, {\'name\': \'决斗细剑\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当决斗细剑进战场时，将它贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。\\n佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n佩带{4}（{4}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdfd1a64-9456-469e-808a-d36ebfcecae2\', \'multiverseId\': 529773}, \'multiverseid\': 529773}, {\'name\': \'決鬥細劍\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n當決鬥細劍進戰場時，將它貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。\\n佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n佩帶{4}（{4}：貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。只能於巫術時機佩帶。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb33a829-c860-41c1-bae5-965aa4a128f0\', \'multiverseId\': 530033}, \'multiverseid\': 530033}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düsterpirscher\', \'text\': \'Solange du ein Gewölbe absolviert hast, hat der Düsterpirscher Doppelschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Waldläufer\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde dafür sorgen, dass du nie wieder einen Seiler mit einem Stalagmiten verwechselst."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527563&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27b09972-22bf-4e22-a754-38f4f2dd23af\', \'multiverseId\': 527563}, \'multiverseid\': 527563}, {\'name\': \'Acechador en la penumbra\', \'text\': \'Mientras hayas completado una mazmorra, el Acechador en la penumbra tiene la habilidad de dañar dos veces.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guardabosque enano\', \'flavor\': \'"Me aseguraré de que no vuelvas a confundir a un lacero con una estalagmita".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=527824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b230a1b-8394-421c-af24-719e06db049e\', \'multiverseId\': 527824}, \'multiverseid\': 527824}, {\'name\': \'Pisteur des ténèbres\', \'text\': \'Tant que vous avez terminé un donjon, le Pisteur des ténèbres a la double initiative.\', \'type\': \'Créature : nain et ranger\', \'flavor\': "« Je m\'assurerai que tu ne confondes plus un enlaceur avec un stalagmite. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528085&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'155a253e-9e74-49d8-ada4-9597be915138\', \'multiverseId\': 528085}, \'multiverseid\': 528085}, {\'name\': \'Inseguitore Ombra\', \'text\': "Fintanto che hai completato un dungeon, l\'Inseguitore Ombra ha doppio attacco.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ranger Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ti insegnerò a distinguere un fustigatore da una stalagmite".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c04b8c32-b7db-4815-ad4e-f81ef991fedf\', \'multiverseId\': 528346}, \'multiverseid\': 528346}, {\'name\': \'グルーム・ストーカー\', \'text\': \'あなたがダンジョンを踏破したことがあるかぎり、グルーム・ストーカーは二段攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・レインジャー\', \'flavor\': \'「二度とローパーを石筍と間違えないようにしてやる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dca9b71f-7276-43ca-8f92-f7c7df24010b\', \'multiverseId\': 528607}, \'multiverseid\': 528607}, {\'name\': \'음침한 추적자\', \'text\': \'당신이 던전을 완료한 한, 음침한 추적자는 이단공격을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 레인저\', \'flavor\': \'"로퍼를 석순이라고 착각하는 일은 두 번 다시 없게 만들어 주지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=528867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9210c7d-9a38-470d-903e-a89918080b69\', \'multiverseId\': 528867}, \'multiverseid\': 528867}, {\'name\': \'Espreitador Sombrio\', \'text\': \'Contanto que você tenha completado uma masmorra, Espreitador Sombrio tem golpe duplo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Guardião\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu vou garantir que você nunca mais confunda um estrangulador com uma estalagmite de novo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79b12c04-6080-4558-a59c-45f9295e1a8a\', \'multiverseId\': 529128}, \'multiverseid\': 529128}, {\'name\': \'Мрачный Выслеживатель\', \'text\': \'При условии, что вы прошли подземелье, Мрачный Выслеживатель имеет Двойной удар.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Следопыт\', \'flavor\': \'«Уж я позабочусь о том, чтобы ты больше не принял веревочника за сталагмит».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f5b24fc-bf9e-4b33-b16b-d2a23fbe8c77\', \'multiverseId\': 529389}, \'multiverseid\': 529389}, {\'name\': \'幽光伏击客\', \'text\': \'只要你完成过地城，幽光伏击客便具有连击异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～矮人／游侠\', \'flavor\': \'「我会确保你不再把树绳妖误认作石笋。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43d76ded-b8df-49a9-adf9-68319162ae46\', \'multiverseId\': 529649}, \'multiverseid\': 529649}, {\'name\': \'幽光伏擊客\', \'text\': \'只要你完成過地城，幽光伏擊客便具有連擊異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～矮人／遊俠\', \'flavor\': \'「我會確保你不再把樹繩妖誤認作石筍。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=529909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea031c19-bf88-4b9e-b1b1-8d2bc4d52b2a\', \'multiverseId\': 529909}, \'multiverseid\': 529909}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ebene\', \'type\': \'Standardland — Ebene\', \'flavor\': \'Unter dem Wüstensand habt ihr eine außerweltliche Kraft entdeckt, die vor unvorstellbarer Energie pulsiert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530175&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43e43a7-b046-4e06-b009-228f7c66f56e\', \'multiverseId\': 530175}, \'multiverseid\': 530175}, {\'name\': \'Llanura\', \'type\': \'Tierra básica — Llanura\', \'flavor\': \'Tras aventurarse bajo las arenas del desierto, el grupo descubre un poder sobrenatural que vibra con una energía inconcebible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11fa14ba-b350-4a5f-bb6c-35b1630c93b7\', \'multiverseId\': 530195}, \'multiverseid\': 530195}, {\'name\': \'Plaine\', \'type\': \'Terrain de base : plaine\', \'flavor\': \'En vous aventurant sous le sable du désert, vous découvrez une puissance inconnue dégageant une énergie inconcevable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530215&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3dd1e2c-1422-4af2-b03c-dfbb2c78a296\', \'multiverseId\': 530215}, \'multiverseid\': 530215}, {\'name\': \'Pianura\', \'type\': \'Terra Base — Pianura\', \'flavor\': "Mentre vi avventurate nelle profondità dei deserti di sabbia, scoprite una forza aliena che pulsa con un\'energia straordinaria.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b65fc622-149f-4d70-97c0-a2cd824ee634\', \'multiverseId\': 530235}, \'multiverseid\': 530235}, {\'name\': \'平地\', \'type\': \'基本土地 — 平地\', \'flavor\': \'砂漠の砂の地下洞窟を探索していると、君は未知なるエネルギーが脈動する異星の力を発見した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68fb9a7b-0e77-4275-ac4f-cbd74822eb3e\', \'multiverseId\': 530255}, \'multiverseid\': 530255}, {\'name\': \'들\', \'type\': \'기본 대지 — 들\', \'flavor\': \'사막의 모래 아래를 탐험하던 당신은 상상할 수 없는 에너지가 맥박처럼 고동치는 외계의 힘을 발견했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5447f2ce-0b52-4523-9770-ceb7ec6f42a2\', \'multiverseId\': 530275}, \'multiverseid\': 530275}, {\'name\': \'Planície\', \'type\': \'Terreno Básico — Planície\', \'flavor\': \'Aventurando-se sob as areias do deserto, vocês descobrem um poder alienígena pulsando com uma energia imensurável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'533f5fee-fa20-4b6e-92ef-e4ccdbc5519e\', \'multiverseId\': 530295}, \'multiverseid\': 530295}, {\'name\': \'Равнина\', \'type\': \'Базовая Земля — Равнина\', \'flavor\': \'Решившись выяснить, что же скрывают пески пустыни, вы обнаружили чужеродную силу, излучающую неизвестную энергию.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7ea8913-9652-4210-a80f-0834c8498ed8\', \'multiverseId\': 530315}, \'multiverseid\': 530315}, {\'name\': \'平原\', \'type\': \'基本地 ～平原\', \'flavor\': \'你冒险深入黄沙之底，找到一股脉动着不可思议能源的奇异力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3464652-8ba3-469d-b301-d9fb096600ce\', \'multiverseId\': 530335}, \'multiverseid\': 530335}, {\'name\': \'平原\', \'type\': \'基本地 ～平原\', \'flavor\': \'你冒險深入黃沙之底，找到一股脈動著不可思議能源的奇異力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c703cbd3-957d-4a45-8338-45b33c31b249\', \'multiverseId\': 530355}, \'multiverseid\': 530355}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ebene\', \'type\': \'Standardland — Ebene\', \'flavor\': \'Unter dem Wüstensand habt ihr eine außerweltliche Kraft entdeckt, die vor unvorstellbarer Energie pulsiert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=530176&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f648d08-99ba-451f-9767